<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1SA" style="id">- YAO BIBLE VERSION</book>
  <para style="h">1 Samweli</para>
  <para style="toc1">Chitabu chandanda cha Samweli</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Samweli</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Sam</para>
  <para style="mt2">1 Samweli</para>
  <para style="mt1">Chitabu chaandanda chi che Samweli</para>
  <para style="imt">Chilongolelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Itabu ya 1 Samweli ni 2 Samweli kuundanda yaliji chitabu chimo chichamanyikaga nti “Chitabu cha Samweli.” Pa ulendo waandanda chitabu chi chagaŵikwe ni kuŵa itabu iŵili pa litoleo lyalikuŵilanjikwa, “Litoleo lya Septuaginti.” Lyeleli lyaliji litoleo lyakuundanda lya tafusili ja Lilangano lya Kalakala mu chiŵecheto cha Chiyunani. Liina lya tafusili jo lyajigele malumbo gakuti tafusili jo jaŵichikwe chile ni ŵakusyoma 70 pane 72 ŵa Chigiliki. Mu tafusili ja Chigiliki ji, itabu ya 1 Samweli na 2 Samweli yaŵilanjikwe 1 Falme ni 2 Falme, ni mu litoleo lya Chilatini lilyakuiye pakumala lyelelyo, itabu yo yagalawiche ni kuŵilanjikwa 1 Mamwenye ni 2 Mamwenye. Kwayele itabu yaikumanyika lelojino nti 1 Mamwenye ni 2 Mamwenye yaŵilanjikwe mu litoleo lyo, 3 Mamwenye ni 4 Mamwenye. Itabu ya 1 Samweli na 2 Samweli ijigele ipanganyo ya chihisitolia nkati utame wa jwakulondola jwa Akunnungu che Samweli, mwenye che Sauli, ni mwenye che Daudi. Che Samweli ŵaliji chilongola jwambesi katema chilambo cha ku Isilaeli pachatyosile kulongoswa ni ŵakulamula ni kutanda kulongoswa ni mamwenye. Che Samweli jujojo ni juŵaajitilile mauta che Sauli ni che Daudi kuŵa mamwenye ŵaŵili ŵakuundanda ŵa ku Isilaeli. Itabu ya 1 Samweli ni 2 Samweli ikusalichisya indu ya chihisitolia ya chilambo cha ku Isilaeli pa chipindi cho.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ngapangwa jwakummanyilila juŵalembile itabu ya 1 Samweli ni 2 Samweli. Jwakulemba nganalisala nsyene mu itabu yo, nambo panepa ŵaliji jwanjumi pa chipindi chose cha utawala wa mwenye che Daudi, ni panepa ŵaliji chiŵela jwanjumi namose pakumala utawala wo, nombe panepa ŵakombwele kupata itabu ine iyasalaga nkati umi u che Sauli ni che Samweli ni kusyoma. Kwaligongo lya kusisika nnope nkati mundu pane ŵandu ŵalembile itabu yi, sooni ngaikumanyika itabu yi yalembekwe chakachi.</para>
  <para style="iot">Yaili mwelemo</para>
  <para style="io">Kupagwa ni kuŵilanjikwa kwa jwakulondola jwa Akunnungu che Samweli pa kwatumichila Akunnungu, mu sula 1 mpaka sula ja 3.</para>
  <para style="io">Ŵafilisiti iŵatite kwigala lisanduku lya lilangano lya Akunnungu kutyochela kwa Ŵaisilaeli, ni ilyatite kwikanawo maulago kwa misi ja Ŵafilisiti katema palyaliji mu misi jao, mu sula ja 4 mpaka sula ja 7.</para>
  <para style="io">Ŵaisilaeli iŵasachile akole ni mwenye, ni sooni che Samweli iŵatite pakwajitilila mauta che Sauli aŵe mwenye ŵaandanda ni Akunnungu iŵatite pakwakana che Sauli kanyuma, mu sura ja 8 mpaka sula ja 15.</para>
  <para style="io">Che Samweli iŵatite pakwajitilila mauta che Daudi aŵe mwenye jwaaŵili jwa ku Isilaeli ni che Sauli iŵatite pakulinga mpaka mbesi ja umi wakwe kwaulaga che Daudi, mu sula ja 16 mpaka sula ja 31.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1SA 1" />
  <para style="s">Che Elikana ni ŵapannango wakwe ku Shilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 1:1" />Jwapali mundu jumo juŵaŵilanjikwe che Elikana, jwa lukosyo lwa Efulaimu, ŵatamaga musi wa ku Lama chilambo cha ikwesya cha ku Efulaimu. Mundu jo atatigwe ŵaliji che Yelohamu ambujegwe waliji che Elihu ambuje ŵa mmauja waliji che Tohu ŵantundu ŵa che Sufu. <verse eid="1SA 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 1:2" />Che Elikana ŵalombele achakongwe ŵaŵili, jumo ŵaŵilanjikwe che Hana ni jwaaŵili ŵaŵilanjikwe che Penina. Che Penina ŵaŵeleche ŵanache nambo che Hana nganaŵeleka. <verse eid="1SA 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 1:3" />Kila chaka che Elikana ŵajesile ulendo kutyochela ku Lama kwaula ku Shilo kukwapopelela Ambuje Akunnungu ni kwapelechela mbopesi. Achachanda ŵaŵili ŵa che Eli, che Hofini ni che Finehasi, ŵaliji ŵambopesi ŵa Akunnungu kweleko. <verse eid="1SA 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 1:4" />Katema kose che Elikana piŵapelekaga mbopesi syakwe sya kutinisya, ŵangaŵilaga che Penina ŵankwakwe liunjili limo lya nyama jo, ni achiŵanagwe achalume ni achakongwe kila mundu liunjili limo. <verse eid="1SA 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 1:5" />Nambo che Elikana ŵampaga che Hana maunjili gaŵili gambone nnope ligongo ŵannonyele kwannope nachiŵamuno Ambuje Akunnungu ŵantesile aŵe jwangaŵeleka. <verse eid="1SA 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 1:6" />Ligongo lyakuti Ambuje Akunnungu nganiŵapa che Hana kuŵeleka mwanache, che Penina ŵannyosyaga kwannope che Hana, mwakwichila kwatumbilisya. <verse eid="1SA 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 1:7" />Yeleyo yatendekaga chaka ni chaka. Ndaŵi syosepe paŵajaulaga ku nyuumba ja Akunnungu che Penina ŵantumbilisyaga che Hana mpaka kutanda kulila ni kukana kulya chilichose. <verse eid="1SA 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 1:8" />Che Elikana ŵankwakwe ŵammusyaga, “Che Hana ligongo chichi nkulila? Ligongo chichi nkukana kulya? kwachichi nkulilasika mu ntima? Ana une nganima jwambone nnope kukwenu kupunda ŵanache likumi ŵachilume?”<verse eid="1SA 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Hana ni che Eli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 1:9" />Pa lyuŵa limo ali amasile kulya ni kung'wa pa nyuumba ja Ambuje Akunnungu kwele ku Shilo ko, che Hana ŵajimi. Kele katema ko jwambopesi che Eli ŵatemi pa chitengu pambali ni nnango wa nyuumba ja Ambuje Akunnungu. <verse eid="1SA 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 1:10" />Nombe che Hana ŵalilasiche kwannope. Ni katema kaŵaliji nkwapopelela Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaliji nkulila kwaligogo. <verse eid="1SA 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 1:11" />Ni ŵataŵile nasili achitiji, “Alakwe Ambuje Akunnungu jwa machili, iŵaga tingalolechesye masauko gangu une jwakutumichila jwenu ni kuungumbuchila une, pangaandiŵalila, une jwakutumichila jwenu, mwambaga une jwakutumichila jwenu mwanache jwannume, tinjimpa alakwe Ambuje Akunnungu mwanache jo aŵe jwenu mu umi wakwe wose. Ngaamyolekwa mu ntwe mwakwe ng'o.”<verse eid="1SA 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 1:12" />Che Hana ŵajendelechele kwapopelela Ambuje Akunnungu, ni jwambopesi che Eli ŵaliji nkulolechesya kukang'wa kwakwe. <verse eid="1SA 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 1:13" />Che Hana ŵapopelaga chikatikati, kang'wa jakwe jatenganyikaga mwangakoposya maloŵe. Kwayele che Eli ŵaganisisye kuti akolelwe. <verse eid="1SA 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 1:14" />Nipele che Eli ŵatite, “Ana tinjendelechele kukolelwa mpaka chakachi? Nneche kung'wa Divai.” <verse eid="1SA 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 1:15" />Che Hana ŵajanjile, “Ngaŵa yeleyo ambuje ŵangu, une ndili jwankongwe jungulilasika kwannope. Uneji nganing'wa divai pane nkologo uliwose, nambo naliji mkwasalila Ambuje Akunnungu yaili mu ntima mwangu. <verse eid="1SA 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 1:16" />Nkaang'anichisya une kuti ndili jwankongwe jwawamba. Ndaŵi josepe ji ndili nkupolela apano kwa kulilasika ni ligogo.” <verse eid="1SA 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 1:17" />Nipele che Eli ŵansalile, “Mmuje kumusi pangali lipamba. Nombe Akunnungu ŵa ku Isilaeli ampe achila chimmendile.” <verse eid="1SA 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 1:18" />Che Hana ŵatite, “Ngummenda une jwakutumichila jwenu mung'anichisyeje yambone.” Che Hana ŵatyosile, ŵajawile kulya chakulya, ni nganawoneka sooni kuŵa jwakulilasika.<verse eid="1SA 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kupagwa kwa Samweli ni kuŵichikwa pajika kwa ligongo lya Akunnungu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 1:19" />Nipele kundaŵi kwakwe che Elikana ni ŵamu nyuumba jakwe ŵajimwiche kundaŵindaŵipe, pakumala kwapopelela Ambuje Akunnungu ŵausile kumangwawo, kwele ku Lama ko. Che Elikana waonegene ni che Hana ŵankwakwe, nombe Ambuje Akunnungu ŵajanjile mapopelo gakwe. <verse eid="1SA 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 1:20" />Pelepo che Hana wakwete chitumbo, ŵaligopwele mwanache jwannume, ŵammilasile liina lyakwe Samweli, achitiji, “Napopelele Ambuje Akunnungu.”<verse eid="1SA 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 1:21" />Chaka chichakuiye Che Elikana ni ŵamu nyuumba jakwe ŵapite sooni ku Shilo ni kwapelechela Ambuje Akunnungu mbopesi sya chaka ni chaka ni kugopola nasili syawo. <verse eid="1SA 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 1:22" />Au ulendo wu che Hana nganajaula, ŵansalile ŵankwakwe kuti, “mwanache ju pitaleche konga tinjijaula najo kuti ngampeleche paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu, akatameje kweleko umi wakwe wosepe.” <verse eid="1SA 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 1:23" />Che Elikana ŵankwakwe ŵansalile, “Ntendeje inkwiwona ili yambone. Nlindilileje mpaka pachimunnekasye konga mwanache jo. Ambuje Akunnungu ankamuchisye kuti nasili jenu jitendeche.” Nipele che Hana ŵasigalile panyuumba, ŵajendelechele kunnela mwanache jwao mpaka paŵannekasisye konga.<verse eid="1SA 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 1:24" />Pakaiche katema ka mwanache jo kunnekasya konga ŵanjigele ni kunjausya ku nyuumba ja Ambuje Akunnungu ku Shilo pamo ni ng'ombe jankambako ja yaka itatu, mbisi sita sya utandi ni nsaku wa lipende wetaje divai. Che Hana ŵampeleche mwanache jo pa nyuumba ja Ambuje Akunnungu ali mwanache jwannandi. <verse eid="1SA 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 1:25" />Paŵamasile kusikita ng'ombe jankambaku jila, ŵanjawisye samweli kwa jwambopesi che Eli. <verse eid="1SA 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 1:26" />Che Hana ŵansalile che Eli “choonde ambuje ŵangu, mpela inkuti kutama, une ndili jwankongwe ajula jumwamweni ndili nyiimi paujo penu kwapopelela Ambuje Akunnungu. <verse eid="1SA 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 1:27" />Napopesile kuti ambe mwanache ju, nombewo ambele chinaaŵendile cho. <verse eid="1SA 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 1:28" />Kwa ligongo lyo uneji ngwapa Ambuje Akunnungu mwanache ju, katema kose pachaŵe jwanjumi, aŵichikwe pajika kwaligongo lya Ambuje Akunnungu.”</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1SA 1:28">Ni ŵampopesile Ambuje Akunnungu pelepo.<verse eid="1SA 1:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1SA 2" />
  <para style="s">Mapopelo ga che Hana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 2:1" />Nipele che Hana ŵapopesile achitiji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:1">“Ntima wangu ukusangalala kwa ligongo lya Ambuje Akunnungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:1">Ngwakusya Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaambele machili.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:1">None mbatile machili paujo pa ŵammagongo ŵangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:1">ngusangalala pakuŵa Ambuje angulupwisye ni kundenda sangalale!”<verse eid="1SA 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 2:2" />“Ngapagwa ŵaakukundikwa kupopelelwa mpela Ambuje Akunnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:2">ngapagwa jwine jwalijose jwaali mpela ŵelewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:2">ngapagwa jwaali lwala nti Akunnungu ŵetu<verse eid="1SA 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 2:3" />Nnechanje kuligamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:3">ni kuwecheta kwa kulifuna.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:3">Pakuŵa Ambuje Akunnungu ni ŵakwimanyilila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:3">Ŵelewo ni ŵachalamule ipanganyo yetu yose.<verse eid="1SA 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 2:4" />Maukunje ga ŵaali ni machili gatemeche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:4">nambo akwapamachili ŵaalepetele.<verse eid="1SA 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 2:5" />Ŵandu ŵaŵajikutaga kalakala</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:5">sambano akutenda masengo ga kulema kuti apate yakulya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:5">Nambo ŵaŵaliji ŵasala kalakala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:5">sambano akwete yakulya yejinji.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:5">Jwankongwe jwangaŵeleka sambano aligopwele ŵanache saba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:5">Nambo jwankongwe jwaŵeleche ŵanache ŵajinji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:5">sambano asigele nkulilasika.<verse eid="1SA 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 2:6" />Ambuje Akunnungu ni ŵakuulaga ni sooni akuuchisya umi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:6">Ŵelewo ni ŵakwatulusya ŵandu kumalembe ni kwakoposya sooni.<verse eid="1SA 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 2:7" />Ambuje Akunnungu akwatesya ŵane kuŵa ŵakulaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:7">ni ŵane kuŵa ŵakusichila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:7">Ŵane akwatulusya ni ŵane akwakwesya.<verse eid="1SA 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 2:8" />Akwanyakula ŵakulaga kutyochela nkulaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:8">akwatyosya ŵakusoŵekwa kutyochela mu usauchi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:8">ni kwatenda atame pamo ni achakulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:8">ni kwatenda atame pa chitengu cha luchimbichimbi cha mwenye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:8">Pakuŵa misingi ja chilambo jili jakwe Ambuje Akunnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:8">Ni pachanya pakwe achiŵisile chilambo.<verse eid="1SA 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 2:9" />Ŵelewo ni ŵakuugosa matala ga wandu ŵakwe ŵali ŵakukulupilichika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:9">nambo chiwatende ŵandu ŵachigongomalo ajonasiche mu chipi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:9">Pakuŵa ngapangwa mundu jwakupata indu kwa machili gakwe syene.<verse eid="1SA 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 2:10" />Ŵammagongo ŵa Ambuje tatemangulanywe ipande ipande,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:10">tachilindima nti njasi kutyochela kwinani kwaligongo lyao.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:10">Ambuje tachichilamula chilambo chose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:10">tachimpa machili ni luchimbichimbi mwenye jwa msagwile.”<verse eid="1SA 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 2:11" />Nipele che Elikana ŵajawile kumangwakwe ku Lama, nambo che Samweli mwanagwe ŵasigele ku Shilo kukoko achatumichilaga Ambuje paujo pa che Eli jwambopesi.<verse eid="1SA 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ŵanache ŵachilume ŵa che Eli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 2:12" />Ŵanache achalume ŵa che Eli ŵaliji ŵachigongomalo, ni wangamanyilila Ambuje. <verse eid="1SA 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 2:13" />Nipele galiji masyoŵelelo ga ŵambopesi paujo pa ŵandu kuti kila mala mundu pakupeleka mbopesi akuno nyama jili nkutokota pa mooto, jwakutumichila jwa jwambopesi ŵaikaga ni msomelo uwaliji ni songa sitatu. <verse eid="1SA 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 2:14" />Jwakutumichila jo ŵatumbuchisyaga msomelo wo mu chiteleko, nyama jilijose jijatyosyekwaga mwelemo ni msomelo wo, jaliji jakwe jwambopesi. Yeleyi ŵambopesi ni iŵatendelelaga Ŵaisilaeli wose ŵaŵajaulaga ku Shilo kukupeleka mbopesi syao. <verse eid="1SA 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 2:15" />Nambo atamuno mauta nganigatiniswe jwakutumichila jwa ŵambopesi jwaiche kwa mundu juwatyosyaga mbopesi jula ni kunsalila kuti, “Mumpe jwambopesi nyama akaŵanichile pakuŵa jwalakwe jo ngaaja kupochela nyama jeteleche kutyochela kukwenu, nambo jangateleka.” <verse eid="1SA 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 2:16" />Iŵaga mundu chansalile “Nlindilile kaje nagatinisye mauta nipele tinjigale nyama jilijose jinkujisaka,” pele jwele jwakutumichila jwa jwambopesi ŵajangaga “Ngwamba, mumbe sampano, iŵaga ngankusaka kuumba tinansumule.” <verse eid="1SA 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 2:17" />Au ulemwa uŵatesile achachanda ŵa che Eli waliji wekulungwa nnope paujo pa Ambuje. Pakuŵa nganasichimbichisya mbopesi siŵapelekaga ŵandu kwa Ambuje.<verse eid="1SA 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Samweli ku Shilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 2:18" />Nambo che Samweli ŵajendelechele kwatumichila Ambuje Akunnungu, ali awete chisibao cha bafuta. <verse eid="1SA 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 2:19" />Kila chaka achikulugwe ŵantotele kanzu jamwana ni kunjauchisya paŵaliji nkwaula ni ŵankwakwe kupeleka mbopesi ja kutinisya chaka ni chaka. <verse eid="1SA 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 2:20" />Che Eli ŵaliji nkwapa upile che Elikana ni che Hana ŵankwakwe achitiji, “Ambuje Akunnungu ampe mmwe che Elikana ŵanache ŵane kwa jwankongwe ju kuti ajigale lipesa lya ajula jumummichile pajika kwaligongo lya Ambuje Akunnungu.” Nipele che Elikana ni che Hana ŵankwakwe ŵausile kumungwawo.<verse eid="1SA 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 2:21" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵatendele yambone che Hana, nombewo ŵaŵeleche ŵanache ŵatatu achalume ni ŵanache ŵaŵili achakongwe, kele katema ko jwanjchanda Samweli jwajendelechele kwatumichila Ambuje.<verse eid="1SA 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Eli ni achiŵanagwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 2:22" />Kele katema ko che Eli ŵaliji achekulwipe kwannope. Ŵapilikene indu yose iŵaipanganyaga achiŵanagwe achalume kwa ŵandu ŵose ŵa ku Isilaeli, ni iŵatite kugona ni achakongwe ŵaŵaliji nkupanganya masengo pannango wa lisakasa lya kusimanilana kwaligongo lya Akunnungu, <verse eid="1SA 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 2:23" />ŵausisye, “Ligongo chichi nkupanganya yele indu yi? Mbilikene kutyochela kwa ŵandu ŵose nkati yangalumbana inkuipanganya. <verse eid="1SA 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 2:24" />Nkatendaga yeleyo achiŵanangu ligongo yele indu inguipilikana kutyochela kwa ŵandu ŵa Ambuje Akunnungu ili yakusakala. <verse eid="1SA 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 2:25" />Iŵaga Mundu antendele sambi njakwe, Ambuje Akunnungu akukombola kunchenjela mundu jo. Nambo mundu anneŵelaga Ambuje Akunnungu ŵani ŵaakukombola kwaŵendela kwa Ambuje Akunnungu kuti alecheleswe?” Nambo achiŵanagwe wo nganampilikanila atati jwawo, pakuŵa Ambuje Akunnungu ŵamasile kulamula kwaulaga.<verse eid="1SA 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 2:26" />Jwanchanda che Samweli ŵapundile kukula ni kukola lisusa, achanonyelesyaga Ambuje Akunnungu pamo ni ŵandu.<verse eid="1SA 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Akunnungu akuukana umbopesi wa ŵandu ŵamu nyuumba ji che Eli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 2:27" />Pa lyuŵa limo jwakulondola jwa Akunnungu ŵaiche kwa che Eli ni kwasalila, “Ambuje Akunnungu akuti yelei: ‘Naliunukwile kwa ŵapa ulongo wa che Haluni, atati ŵenu paŵaliji ku ukapolo wa Falao chilambo cha ku Misili. <verse eid="1SA 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 2:28" />Mwa ngosyo syose sya ku Isilaeli naasagwile che Haluni atati ŵenu ni ŵapa ulongo wao kuti aŵe ŵambopesi ŵangu, apeleche mbopesi sya kutinisya pa chilisa changu, atutumisye ubani ni kuwala chisibao ali nkuundumichila. Naapele malo ja mbopesi syangu sya kutinisya siŵambelechelaga Ŵaisilaeli pa mooto. <verse eid="1SA 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 2:29" />Ligongo lya chichi nkusimilila mata mbopesi syakutinisya ni sadaka sinaasalile ŵandu ambelechele une? Mmwejo mwachimbichisye ŵanache wenu kupunda une kwa kulilisya mwachinsyene pa malo ja kunakana ja sadaka syakuumbelechela ŵandu ŵangu Ŵaisilaeli!’ <verse eid="1SA 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 2:30" />Kwayele, Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵa ku Isilaeli akuti nnyi, ‘Nalanjile kuti ulongo wenu ni ulongo wa achachekulu ŵenu taachindumichila paujo pangu moŵa gose pangali mbesi,’ nambo sambano Ambuje Akunnungu akunsalila yelei, ‘Chele chindu cho ngaandenda ng'o mpela inatite pakusala.’ Tinaachimbichisye aŵala ŵaakunjimbichisya ni aŵala ŵaakunyelusya tinaanyelusye. <verse eid="1SA 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 2:31" />Mpilikane, moŵa gakuika patinaaulaje achachanda wose pa ulongo wenu ni pa ntundu wenu, ni ngasapagwa jwannume jwalijose juchatame kwichila mwakuchekulupa. <verse eid="1SA 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 2:32" />Nomwe tinnaje patimme pa nyuumba jangu, nachiŵamuno Ŵaisilaeli chakole upile, ngapagwa mundu mu ulongo wenu juchatame ni kwichila mwakuchekulupa. <verse eid="1SA 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 2:33" />Jwajuli jose jwati ngasinantyosya pa chilisa pangu, tasigalile kuti alile ni kupetesya ntima wakwe, ni achalume ŵajinji mu uŵelesi wenu tachiwa akanaŵe kuchekulupa. <verse eid="1SA 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 2:34" />Ni chindu chichichasimane achachanda ŵenu ŵaŵili, che Hofini ni che Finehasi ni achi: Wose ŵanaŵaŵili tachiwa pa lyuŵa limo. Chele chindu cho ni chichichiŵe chimanyisyo. <verse eid="1SA 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 2:35" />Nipele tinjilisagulila jwambopesi jwine jwakukulupilichika juchapanganye malinga ni aila yaili mu ntima mwangu ni inguiganichisya. Jwelejo tinjimpa uŵelesi wakulimbanga utachitumichila paujo pa mwenye jutinansagule. <verse eid="1SA 2:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 2:36" />Mundu julijose juchasigalile mu ulongo wenu chanjaulile jwambopesi jo ni kunjinamila ni kummenda mbiya pane chipaande cha nkate. Nombe chansalile, ‘Choonde muumbe masengo galigose pa umbopesi kuti ngombole kupata chakulya.’”<verse eid="1SA 2:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1SA 3" />
  <para style="s">Ambuje Akunnungu akunkopochela che Samweli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 3:1" />Pa moŵa go nchanda che Samweli paŵaliji nkwatumichila Ambuje Akunnungu ali mkwimililwa ni che Eli, Ambuje Akunnungu ŵakungulwiche ni ŵandu kwakwapikanisya liloŵe ngaŵa kakajinji, ni nganiŵaasagamisya sagamisi gagajinji. <verse eid="1SA 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 3:2" />Pa lyuŵa limo chilo, che Eli juŵaliji ngakulola yambone ŵaliji agonile mu chuumba mwakwe. <verse eid="1SA 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 3:3" />Che Samweli nombe ŵaliji agonile pa Nyuumba ja Akunnungu chiŵandika ni lisanduku lya lilangano lya Akunnungu. Lumuli lwa Ambuje Akunnungu lwaliji luchikolelaga. <verse eid="1SA 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 3:4" />Pelepo Ambuje Akunnungu ŵammilasile che Samweli. Nombejo ŵajitiche “Une apano!” <verse eid="1SA 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 3:5" />Nipele che Samweli ŵautuchile ku che Eli, ni ŵatite, “Iiche, ngati mumilasileje.” Nambo che Eli ŵajanjile achitiji, “Uneji nganinammilanga. Njaule nkagone.” Che Samweli ŵausile kukugona.<verse eid="1SA 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 3:6" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵammilasile sooni, “Che Samweli!” Che Samweli ŵajimwiche, ŵajawile sooni kwa che Eli ni kwasalila, “Iiche, ngati mumilasileje.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 3:6">Nambo che Eli ŵajanjile, “Mwanangu uneji nganinammilanga, njaule nkagone.” <verse eid="1SA 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 3:7" />Che Samweli ŵaliji ngaanaŵe kwamanyilila Ambuje Akunnungu, ni utenga wa Akunnungu waliji nguunawe kuunukulikwa kukwakwe. <verse eid="1SA 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 3:8" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵammilasile che Samweli kaatatu. Che Samweli ŵajimwiche, ŵanjaulile che Eli ni kwasalila, “Iiche, ngati mumilasileje.” Pelepo che Eli ŵaimanyilile kuti Ambuje Akunnungu ni ŵaakummilanga che Samweli. <verse eid="1SA 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 3:9" />Nipele che Eli ŵansalile che Samweli, “Njaule nkagone, ammilangaga sooni nkajile ‘Mmechete alakwe Ambuje Akunnungu, pakuŵapo une jwakutumichila jwenu ngupikanila.’” Kwayele che Samweli ŵausile ni kugona.<verse eid="1SA 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 3:10" />Kanyuma Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaiche ni kwima pelepo, ŵammilasile che Samweli mpela kuundanda, “Che Samweli, che Samweli!” Nipele che Samweli ŵajanjile, “Mmechete alakwe Ambuje Akunnungu pakuŵa uneji jwakutumichila jwenu ngupilikanila.” <verse eid="1SA 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 3:11" />Nipele Ambuje Akunnungu ŵansalile che Samweli, “Nnole maandichile kuchitenda chindu mu Isilaeli, ni kila mundu juchapikane, tachijogopa. <verse eid="1SA 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 3:12" />Pa lyuŵa lyo tinjitindimisya aila indu yose inaisasile kuti tindende kutandilila kuundanda mpaka kumbesi nkati che Eli ni ŵapannango wakwe. <verse eid="1SA 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 3:13" />Naasalile kuti tinjajamuka ŵapannango wakwe moŵa gose pangali mbesi, kwaligongo lya sambi jiŵajimanyililaga pakuŵapo achiŵanagwe achalume andukene une, nombejo nganiŵaakanya. <verse eid="1SA 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 3:14" />Kwayele nalumbile nkati ŵamu nyuumba ji che Eli, kuti maleŵa ga ŵamu nyuumba ji che Eli ngagatyosekwa, iŵeje kwa sadaka atamuno kwa mbopesi syakutinisya.”<verse eid="1SA 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 3:15" />Che Samweli ŵagonile pepala mpaka kundaŵi, nipele ŵajimwiche ni kuugula minango ja nyuumba ja Ambuje Akunnungu. Nambo ŵajogwepe kwasalila che Eli yele indu yasasile Ambuje Akunnungu yo. <verse eid="1SA 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 3:16" />Kwayele che Eli ŵammilasile che Samweli ni kunsalila, “Mwanangu che Samweli.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 3:16">Nombejo ŵajanjile “Une apano!” <verse eid="1SA 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 3:17" />Che Eli ŵammusisye, “Ana Ambuje Akunnungu ansalile ichichi? Nkaasisa chansalile. Mwaasisaga chansalile, Ambuje Akunnungu anjamuche nnope.” <verse eid="1SA 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 3:18" />Nipele che Samweli ŵasasile yanayose iŵasalilwe, pangasisa chindu chilichose. Nipele che Eli ŵatite, “Ŵelewo ali Ambuje Akunnungu, apanganye chilichose chakuchiwona kuti chili chambone kukwakwe.”<verse eid="1SA 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 3:19" />Che Samweli paŵajendelechele kukula Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaliji pamo nawo, ni nganaleka chachilichose chiŵansalile che Samweli changanichimalila. <verse eid="1SA 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 3:20" />Ŵandu wose mu Isilaeli kutandilila ku Dani cha kumpoto, mpaka ku Beli Sheba, cha kulujenda, ŵaimanyilile kuti che Samweli ŵaliji jwakulondola jwakukulupilichika jwa Ambuje Akunnungu.<verse eid="1SA 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 3:21" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵapundile kulilosya kwele ku Shilo ko, ni kweleko Ambuje Akunnungu ŵalilosisye ku che Samweli kwa litala lya liloŵe lyakwe.<verse eid="1SA 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1SA 4" />
  <para style="s">Lisanduku lya lilangano likujigalikwa ni Ŵafilisiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 4:1" />Che Samweli ŵaliji nkwasalila Ŵaisilaeli wose utenga uwasalilwaga ni Akunnungu. Ni yaliji pa moŵa go Ŵafilisiti ŵasongangene kuti aputane ni Ŵaisilaeli. Ŵaisilaeli ŵaŵisile chigono chao kwele ku Ebeneseli, ni Ŵafilisiti ŵaŵisile chigono chao kwele ku Afeki. <verse eid="1SA 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 4:2" />Ŵafilisiti ŵaajaulile Ŵaisilaeli ni kwagungumuchila, ni pakumala kuputana kwannope Ŵaisilaeli ŵaputikwe. Ŵaisilaeli elufu nne ŵaulajikwe ku ngondo ko. <verse eid="1SA 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 4:3" />Ŵangondo ŵaŵasigalile paŵausile pachigono, achachekulu ŵa ku Isilaeli ŵatite, “Ligongo chichi Ambuje Akunnungu akundile kuti Ŵafilisiti atupunde lelo jino? Twende tukajigale lisanduku lya lilangano lya Ambuje Akunnungu ku Shilo ko kuti Ambuje wo alongane ni uweji ku ngondo, akatukulupusye ni ŵammagongo ŵetu.” <verse eid="1SA 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 4:4" />Kwayele ŵaatumile ŵandu kwele ku Shilo ko, nombewo ŵalijigele lisanduku lya lilangano lya Ambuje Akunnungu ŵa machili gose, ŵati chitengu chakwe cha umwenye chili pasikati ja yepanganyikwe iŵili yaili ni mapapiko yaikuŵilanjikwa makelubi. Aŵala achachanda ŵaŵili ŵa che Eli, che Hofini ni che Finehasi ŵaiche pamo ni alila lisanduku lya lilangano lya Ambuje Akunnungu.<verse eid="1SA 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 4:5" />Katema Lisanduku lya lilangano lya Ambuje Akunnungu palyaiche pachigono, Ŵaisilaeli wose ŵakwesisye liloŵe mwakusangalala, mpaka chilambo chose chatenganyiche. <verse eid="1SA 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 4:6" />Ŵafilisiti paŵapilikene malama ga sangalala, ŵatite, “Apikane malama gakogoya ku chigono cha Ŵaisilaeli! Ana yeleyi malumbo gakwe ichichi?” Piŵapilikene kuti lisanduku lya lilangano lya Ambuje Akunnungu liiche pa chigono cha Ŵaebulania, <verse eid="1SA 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 4:7" />ŵajogwepe kwannope, ni ŵatite, “Kuiche minungu ku chigono kwawo! Ulaje kukwetu! Pakuŵa indu yanti nnyi nganiitendecheje kunyuma ko. <verse eid="1SA 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 4:8" />Ulaje kukwetu! Ana ŵani chatukulupusye uwe kwa jele minungu ja machili ji? Jeleji ni minungu jijauleje Ŵamisili kwa iputiko yakupisyangana ku chipululu kula. <verse eid="1SA 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 4:9" />Sambano ŵanyamwe Ŵafilisiti, nlimbangane. Mputane ngondo mpela ŵangondo ŵamachili, nkaika kuŵa achikapolo ŵa Ŵaebulania mpela ŵanyawo iŵatite kuŵa achikapolo ŵetu. Nputane nawo nti ŵangondo ŵali ni umanyilisi.”<verse eid="1SA 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 4:10" />Kwa yele Ŵafilisiti ŵaputile ngondo mwakulimba mpaka kwapunda Ŵaisilaeli, ŵaŵautwiche kila mundu ku nyuumba kwakwe. Pa lyuŵa lyo ŵandu ŵajinji ŵaulajikwe, pakuŵa ŵangondo ŵaakwenda wamakongolo elufu salasini pasikati ja Ŵaisilaeli ŵaulajikwe. <verse eid="1SA 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 4:11" />Lisanduku lya lilangano lya Ambuje Akunnungu lyajigalikwe ni Ŵafilisiti ni aŵala achachanda ŵaŵili ŵa che Eli, che Hofini ni che Finehasi ŵaulajikwe.<verse eid="1SA 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Eli akwasika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 4:12" />Pa lyuŵa lilyolyo mundu jumo jwa lukosyo lwa Benjamini ŵautwiche kutyochela pa luŵala luŵaputilanaga ngondo mpaka ku Shilo, ali apapwile papwile yakuwala yakwe, ni kulitaga luundu luli muntwe mwakwe kulosya kulilasika. <verse eid="1SA 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 4:13" />Mundu jula paŵaiche, che Eli ŵaliji atemi pa chitengu chakwe mungulugulu litala, achilolechesyaga iŵaga kwana mundu jutaiche kutyochela ku ngondo, ligongo ntima wakwe waliji ni lipamba nkati lisanduku lya lilangano lya Ambuje Akunnungu. Mundu jula paŵaiche mmusi ni kusala iyakopochele, ŵandu wose ŵalisile mwakunyanyisya. <verse eid="1SA 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 4:14" />Che Eli paŵapilikene kulila ko ŵausisye, “Uli lilama lyo lyachichi?” Mundu jula ŵajawile kwakwanguya ku che Eli kukwasalila ngani syo. <verse eid="1SA 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 4:15" />Kele katema ko che Eli ŵaliji ni yaka tisini na nane ni meeso gakwe galiji gangali machili gakulola uchenene. <verse eid="1SA 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 4:16" />Mundu jula ŵansalile che Eli, “Uneji ndyochele ku ngondo sampano; utwiche kungondo lelo jino.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 4:16">Che Eli ŵausisye, “Mwanangu indu yaliji uli kweleko?” <verse eid="1SA 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 4:17" />Mundu jula ŵatite, “Ŵaisilaeli aputikwe ni Ŵafilisiti mpaka autwiche. Ŵandu ŵajinji aulajikwe pasikati ja Ŵaisilaeli. Kupunda pelepo achachanda ŵenu ŵaŵili che Hofini ni che Finehasi aulajikwe, ni lisanduku lya lilangano lya Ambuje Akunnungu lijigalikwe ni Ŵafilisiti.”<verse eid="1SA 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 4:18" />Mundu jula paŵalikolasile lisanduku lya lilangano lya Ambuje Akunnungu, che Eli ŵagwile lugali, kutyochela pa chitengu chakwe mungulugulu litala. Paŵagwile ŵatemangwiche lukosi lwakwe pakuŵa ŵaliji jwakwimbala ni jwancheku, nipele ŵawile. Che Eli ŵaliji ŵaalongwesye Ŵaisilaeli kwa yaka alobaini.<verse eid="1SA 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ŵankwakwe che Finehasi akwasika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 4:19" />Sooni yele indu yo payakopochele, akwegwawo che Eli, yaani ŵankwakwe che Finehasi ŵaliji ni chitumbo, ni moŵa gakuligopola galiji gaŵandichile. Jwalakwe jo paŵapilikene kuti lisanduku lya lilangano lya Ambuje Akunnungu lijigalikwe ni Ŵafilisiti, ni kuti akwegwawo ŵalume ni ŵankwakwe ŵaliji ali awile, popopo ŵalwasile chilungusi ni kuligopola. <verse eid="1SA 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 4:20" />Jwankongwe jo paŵawaga, achakongwe ŵaŵankamuchisyaga ŵansalile, “Nlimbangane ntima, nligopwele mwanache jwannume.” Nambo jwelejo nganajanga chilichose namose kwapikanila. <verse eid="1SA 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 4:21" />Jwammilasile mwanache jo Ikabodi, malumbo gakwe, “Lumbili lwa Akunnungu lutyosile pasikati ja Ŵaisilaeli,” pakuŵa lisanduku lya lilangano lya Ambuje Akunnungu lijigalikwe, ni sooni akwegwawo ni ŵankwakwe ŵanawose awile. <verse eid="1SA 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 4:22" />Ŵatite yeleyo ligongo, lumbili lwa Akunnungu lutyosile pasikati ja Ŵaisilaeli pakuŵa lisanduku lya lilangano lya Ambuje Akunnungu lijigalikwe ni Ŵafilisiti.<verse eid="1SA 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1SA 5" />
  <para style="s">Lisanduku lya lilangano pasikati ja Ŵafilisiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 5:1" />Ŵafilisiti paŵalijigele lisanduku lya lilangano lya Ambuje Akunnungu, ŵalinyakwile kutyochela ku Ebeneseli mpaka ku musi wao wa ku Ashidodi. <verse eid="1SA 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 5:2" />Nipele ŵalijinjisye lisanduku lya lilangano lya Ambuje Akunnungu mu nyuumba ja chinyago cha nnungu jwao jwakuŵilanjikwa Dagoni, ni kuliŵika pambali ni nnungu Dagoni jo. <verse eid="1SA 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 5:3" />Kundaŵi kwakwe ŵandu ŵa ku Ashidodi ali ajimwiche ŵachiweni chinyago cha Dagoni chili chigwile manguku paasi paujo pa lisanduku lya lilangano lya Ambuje Akunnungu. Ŵachijimiche sooni chinyago cho ni kuchiŵika sooni peuto pakwe. <verse eid="1SA 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 5:4" />Nambo kundaŵi kwakwe paŵajimwiche ŵachiweni chinyago cha Dagoni chigwile sooni manguku paujo pa lisanduku lya lilangano lya Ambuje Akunnungu, ntwe ni makono, yanayose itemangwiche, ni kugwila cha pannango. Chilu pe cha chinyago cha Dagoni cho ni chichasigele. <verse eid="1SA 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 5:5" />Lyelelyo ni ligongo ŵambopesi ŵa Dagoni ni ŵandu wosepe ŵakwinjila mu nyuumba ja Dagoni kwapopelela ngakuliŵata felemu ja paasi ja pannango wa nyuumba ja Dagoni mpaka lelo.<verse eid="1SA 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 5:6" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaajamwiche mwachikali ŵandu ŵa ku Ashidodi ni misinda jose jijaŵandichile nawo, ŵaichisye uwonasi ni kwalagasya ni yakwimbila. <verse eid="1SA 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 5:7" />Ŵandu ŵakutama ku Ashidodi paŵaiwe yele indu yo ŵatite, “Akunnungu jwa Ŵaisilaeli akutujamuka kwachikali uweji pamo ni nnungu jwetu Dagoni. Lisanduku lya lilangano lya Ambuje Akunnungu ngaikukomboleka kutama kukwetu.” <verse eid="1SA 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 5:8" />Ŵaalajisye ŵantenga ni kwaŵilanga ilongola ŵa Ŵafilisiti ni kwausya, “Ana tutende nawo ichichi lisanduku lya lilangano lya Ambuje Akunnungu ŵa Ŵaisilaeli?” Nombewo ŵajanjile “Lisanduku lya lilangano nlijausye kwele ku Gati.” Nipele ŵalijawisye ku musi wa Gati. <verse eid="1SA 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 5:9" />Nambo paŵalijawisye lisanduku lya lilangano lyo kwele ku Gati ko Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaujamwiche musi wo, ŵaatasile lipamba lyakogoya ŵandu ŵa musi wo, ŵaalagasisye ŵandu ŵa wele musi wo, achachanda ni achakulungwa, yaajinjile yakwimbila. <verse eid="1SA 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 5:10" />Kwayele ŵalijawisye lisanduku lya lilangano lya Ambuje Akunnungu lyo ku musi wa ku Ekiloni. Nambo lisanduku lya lilangano lya Ambuje Akunnungu lyo palyaiche kweleko, ŵandu ŵa musi wo ŵalisile achitiji, “Atuichisye lisanduku lya lilangano lya Ambuje Akunnungu ŵa Ŵaisilaeli kuti atuulaje uwe ni ŵandu ŵetu.” <verse eid="1SA 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 5:11" />Nipele ŵaatumile ŵantenga ni kwasonganya sooni ilongola ŵa Ŵafilisiti ni kwasalila, “Nliusye lisanduku lya lilangano lya Ambuje Akunnungu jwa Ŵaisilaeli mu chilambo chakwe, nangaŵaga yeleyo tilituulaje uweji pamo ni ŵandu ŵetu.” Ŵatesile yeleyo ligongo Akunnungu ŵaliji nkwajamuka ŵandu kwa chikali, ni ŵajinji ŵao ŵaliji awile, kwayele ŵandu ŵaliji ni lipamba lyekulungwa. <verse eid="1SA 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 5:12" />Nombe aŵala ŵanganajasika yaasime yakwimbila, ni ililo yao yaiche mpaka kwinani.<verse eid="1SA 5:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1SA 6" />
  <para style="s">Ŵafilisiti akuliusya lisanduku lya lilangano ku Isilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 6:1" />Lisanduku lya lilangano lya Ambuje Akunnungu palyatemi kwa Ŵafilisiti kwa miesi saba, <verse eid="1SA 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 6:2" />Ŵafilisiti ŵaaŵilasile ŵambopesi ŵa Dagoni ni ŵachisango ŵao ni kwausya, “Ana tutende ichichi nkati lisanduku lya Lilangano lya Ambuje Akunnungu? Ntusalile yachitujile kuliusya ku Isilaeli.”<verse eid="1SA 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 6:3" />Ni ŵanyawo ŵajanjile, “Iŵaga nkusaka kuliusya lisanduku lya lilangano lya Ambuje Akunnungu ŵa Ŵaisilaeli, nkaliusya makono pe. Nambo ntende yaili yose nliusye ni sadaka ja kutyosya chileŵo nipele chi tinlame. Ni ŵanyamwe chimmanyilile kwachichi Akunnungu wanjamukaga.”<verse eid="1SA 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 6:4" />Ŵandu ni ŵausisye, “Ana twajauchisye sadaka chi jakutyosya chileŵo jo?” Ni ŵaajanjile, “Inyago nsano ya sahabu yaili mpela yakuimbila, ni inyago nsano ya sahabu yaili mpela mapuku, chilichose chikwima pamalo pa chilongola jumo jwa Ŵafilisiti pakuŵapo ulwele uwansimene ŵanyamwe ni ulwele uwowo uwasimene ilongola ŵenu. <verse eid="1SA 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 6:5" />Kwayele nkolosye inyago ya yakuimbila yenu, ni inyago ya mapuku genu, indu yaikuchitenda chilambo chenu chijonasiche kuti mwape luchimbichimbi Akunnungu ŵa Ŵaisilaeli. Panepa taleche kwajamuka ŵanyamwe mwachinsyene, minungu jenu ni chilambo chenu. <verse eid="1SA 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 6:6" />Kwachichi nkulimba ntima mpela Ŵamisili ni Falao iŵatite kutenda? Ana Akunnungu paŵatendele kwa chikali Ŵamisili, ŵele ŵandu wo nganiŵalechela Ŵaisilaeli ajaulanje? <verse eid="1SA 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 6:7" />Nipele nlinganye mutuka jampya ni ng'ombe siŵili syasikonjesya syanganisitawikwe likongwa chitandilile. Nsitaŵe syele ngombe syo mmutuka nambo ŵanache ŵakwe mwausye ni kwajinjisya mwichinga mwao. <verse eid="1SA 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 6:8" />Nlijigale lisanduku lya lilangano lya Ambuje Akunnungu ni kuliŵika mmutuka mo, ni pambali pakwe mmiche aila inyago ya sahabu inkunjauchisya nti sadaka ja kutyosya chileŵo chenu. Nipele nlileche lijaule kulikusaka kwaula. <verse eid="1SA 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 6:9" />Nipele nloleje, iŵaga mutuka jo jikwamba kwaula ku nsinda wa ku Beti Shemeshi, pelepo chitumanyilile kuti jwatuichisye chitapano chi ali Ambuje Akunnungu. Nambo iŵaga ngajikwaula kweleko, nipele tutwimanyilile kuti ngaŵa nkono wakwe watuputile, nambo malilo ga gatusimene kwa kutapana kwetu.”<verse eid="1SA 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 6:10" />Nipele ŵatesile mpela iŵatite kusalilwa, ŵasijigele ng'ombe siŵili sila ni kusitaŵila mutuka, ni ŵanache ŵakwe ŵaalesile mu lichinga. <verse eid="1SA 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 6:11" />Ŵaliŵisile lisanduku lya lilangano lya Ambuje Akunnungu mmutuka mo pamo ni lisanduku lyana inyago ya sahabu yelandane ni mapuku ni aila inyago ya yakwimbila. <verse eid="1SA 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 6:12" />Ng'ombe sila syagambile kwaula ku musi wa ku Beti Shemeshi pangali kugalauchila kulyo atamuno kunchiji, syaliji nkulila pisyajaulaga. Ilongola ŵa Ŵafilisiti ŵala ŵaakuilisye mpaka mumpika wa ku Beti Shemeshi.<verse eid="1SA 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 6:13" />Ŵandu ŵa ku Beti Shemeshi ŵaliji nkugungula ngano mu chiŵata. Paŵanyakwile mitwe jawo ni kulolechesya ŵaliweni lisanduku lya lilangano lya Ambuje Akunnungu, ni ŵasangalele kwannope. <verse eid="1SA 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 6:14" />Mutuka jo jajawile kungunda wa che Yoshua, mundu juŵatamaga ku Beti Shemeshi. Palyaiche pelepo lyajimi chiŵandika ni liganga lyekulungwa. Ŵandu ŵajipaswile sasu mutuka jila, nipele ŵasikite ngombe syo ni kusityosya mbopesi jakutinisya kwa Ambuje Akunnungu. <verse eid="1SA 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 6:15" />Nombe Ŵalawi ŵalitulwisye lisanduku lya lilangano lya Ambuje Akunnungu ni alila lisanduku lyalili ni inyago ya sahabu ni kuiŵika pachanya pa liganga lyekulungwa lila. Nipele pa lyuŵa lyo ŵandu ŵa ku Beti Shemeshi ŵapeleche mbopesi syakutinisya ni mbopesi sine kwa Ambuje Akunnungu. <verse eid="1SA 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 6:16" />Ilongola nsano ŵa Ŵafilisiti ŵala paŵaiweni yeleyo ŵausile ku Ekiloni pa lyuŵa lilyolyo.<verse eid="1SA 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 6:17" />Ŵafilisiti ŵaijawisye inyago nsano ya sahabu ya yakwimbila ila kwa Ambuje Akunnungu nti sadaka jakutyosya chileŵo chao, chinyago chimo kwa kila musi umo: Musi wa ku Ashidodi ni ku Gasa ni ku Ashikeloni ni ku Gati ni ku Ekiloni. <verse eid="1SA 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 6:18" />Sooni ŵaijawisye inyago nsano ya sahabu ya mapuku malinga ni uŵalaje wa misi jose ja Ŵafilisiti jijatawalikwe ni ilongola nsano ŵa Ŵafilisiti. Misi jo jaliji ni makome ni misinda jakwe nganijisyunguchiswa likumba. Liganga lyekulungwa lila ku ngunda wa che Yoshua jwa musi wa ku Beti Shemeshi apala peuto paŵaliwisile lisanduku lya lilangano lya Ambuje Akunnungu, lili umboni wa chele chindu cho mpaka lelojino.<verse eid="1SA 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 6:19" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaauleje ŵandu sabini ŵakutama musi ŵa ku Beti Shemeshi, ligongo ŵalingulile mulisanduku lya lilangano lya Ambuje Akunnungu. Ŵandu ŵalisile malilo ligongo Ambuje Akunnungu ŵajamwiche kwa chikali.<verse eid="1SA 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lisanduku lya lilangano ku Kiliyati Yealimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 6:20" />Nipele ŵandu ŵakutama ku musi wa ku Beti Shemeshi ŵatite, “Ana ŵani chakombole kulama paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu, ŵeleŵa Akunnungu ŵaakukundikwa kupopelelwa? Ni lisanduku lya lilangano lya Ambuje Akunnungu tilichijaula kwapi pakuti lityoche akuno?” <verse eid="1SA 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 6:21" />Ni ŵaatumile ŵantenga kwaula kwa ŵandu ŵakutama ku musi wa ku Kiliati Yealimu, akajile kuti, “Ŵafilisiti aliusisye lisanduku lya lilangano lya Ambuje Akunnungu, njise kwajigale.”<verse eid="1SA 6:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1SA 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 7:1" />Kwayele ŵandu ŵa ku Kiliati Yealimu ŵajawile ni kulijigala lisanduku lya lilangano lya Ambuje Akunnungu, ŵalijawisye ku nyuumba ji che Abinadabu, juŵatamaga ku chitumbi. Ŵantesile akundikwe kwa kwapopelela Akunnungu mwanagwe jwannume jwakuŵilanjikwa che Eleasali kuti aŵe jwakulilolela lisanduku lyo.<verse eid="1SA 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Samweli akuŵa chilongola jwa Ŵaisilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 7:2" />Lisanduku lya lilangano lya Ambuje Akunnungu lyatemi ku Kiliati Yealimu kwa yaka ishilini. Pa kele katema ko Ŵaisilaeli wose ŵaliji nkulilasika nombewo ŵapopesile kwa Ambuje Akunnungu kuti ŵakamusye.<verse eid="1SA 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 7:3" />Che Samweli ŵaasalile Ŵaisilaeli kuti, “Iŵaga nkwaujilila Ambuje Akunnungu ni mitima jenu jose nkusachilwa ntyosye minungu josepe ja chilendo ni inyago ya nnungu jwankongwe Ashitaloti. Mungalauchile Ambuje Akunnungu ni mitima jenu, ni kwatumichila ŵawowo pe, nombewo tachinkulupusya mmakono mwa Ŵafilisiti.” <verse eid="1SA 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 7:4" />Kwayele Ŵaisilaeli ŵatyosisye inyago ya minungu ja Baali ni Ashitaloti ni kwatumichila Ambuje Akunnungu jikape.<verse eid="1SA 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 7:5" />Nipele, che Samweli ŵaasalile ilongola kuti “Mwaŵilanje Ŵaisilaeli wose asongangane ku Misipa, ni kweleko tingaaŵende Ambuje Akunnungu kwaligongo lyenu.” <verse eid="1SA 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 7:6" />Kwayele Ŵaisilaeli wose ŵasongangene kwele ku Misipa ko. Ŵagatechile meesi kutyochela ku lusulo ni kugajita paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu kulosya kuti ali mmasauko, ŵataŵile lyuŵa lila lyose ni kuti, “Tutesile sambi paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu.” Che Samweli ni juŵaliji jwakulamula jwa Ŵaisilaeli kwele ku Misipa ko.<verse eid="1SA 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 7:7" />Katema Ŵafilisiti paŵapilikene kuti Ŵaisilaeli asongangene ku Misipa ko, ilongola nsano ŵa Ŵafilisi ŵajawile kukwagungumuchila. Ŵaisilaeli paŵapilikene nkati ngani jo ŵajogwepe. <verse eid="1SA 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 7:8" />Nipele ŵansalile che Samweli, “Nkaleka kupopela kwa Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵetu, kuti atukulupusye kwa Ŵafilisiti wo.” <verse eid="1SA 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 7:9" />Nipele che Samweli ŵajigele kangondolo kakonga ŵampelechele jose jene Ambuje Akunnungu nti mbopesi jakutinisya. Pelepo che Samweli ŵapopesile kwa Ambuje Akunnungu kwaligongo lya Ŵaisilaeli, nombe Ambuje ŵajanjile lipopelo lyakwe. <verse eid="1SA 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 7:10" />Katema che Samweli paŵaliji nkupeleka mbopesi jakutinisya jila, Ŵafilisiti ŵaaŵandichile Ŵaisilaeli kuti ŵaagungumuchile. Nambo Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaajogoisye Ŵafilisiti ni liloŵe lya njasi kutyochela kwinani ni kwalyulyuganya nnope, mwakuti ŵapwilingene paujo pa Ŵaisilaeli. <verse eid="1SA 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 7:11" />Ŵaisilaeli ŵautwisye Ŵafilisiti kutyochela ku Misipa mpaka chiŵandika ni musi wa ku Beti Kali, ali nkwaulaga litala lyosepe.<verse eid="1SA 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 7:12" />Nipele che Samweli ŵajigele liganga ni kulijimika pasikati ja Misipa ni ku Sheni, ŵaliŵilasile liganga lyo Ebeneseli, nikuti, “Ambuje Akunnungu atukamwisye mpaka pelepa patuli pano.” <verse eid="1SA 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 7:13" />Kwanti yeleyo Ŵafilisiti ŵalepele pa ngondo, ni nganaujila sooni kwagungumuchila Ŵaisilaeli. Katema kose che Samweli paŵaliji ŵajumi Akunnungu ŵatesile ukombole wakwe uputane ni Ŵafilisiti. <verse eid="1SA 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 7:14" />Misi jose ja Ŵaisilaeli jijajigalikwe ni Ŵafilisiti kutandilila musi wa ku Ekiloni ni ku Gati jajigalikwe ni kwauchisya Ŵaisilaeli. Nipele kwaliji ni chitendewele pasikati ja Ŵaisilaeli ni Ŵaamoli.<verse eid="1SA 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 7:15" />Che Samweli ŵajendelechele kuŵa jwakulamula jwa Ŵaisilaeli pa moŵa gose ga umi wakwe. <verse eid="1SA 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 7:16" />Pa kila chaka che Samweli ŵajaulaga ku Beseli ni ku Giligali ni ku Misipa, ni kulamula magambo ga Ŵaisilaeli pa misi jose jo.<verse eid="1SA 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 7:17" />Nipele ŵaujaga ku Lama, pakuŵa kweleko kwaliji kumangwawo, ni kweleko nombe ŵalamulilaga magambo ga Ŵaisilaeli. Nombe kweleko ŵaataŵile Ambuje Akunnungu chilisa.<verse eid="1SA 7:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1SA 8" />
  <para style="s">Ŵaisilaeli akuŵenda kuti akole mwenye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 8:1" />Che Samweli paŵachekulwipe, ŵaatesile ŵanache ŵao achalume kuŵa ŵakulamula chilambo cha Ŵaisilaeli. <verse eid="1SA 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 8:2" />Mwanache jwakwe jwakwitiwo ŵaŵilanjikwe che Yoeli, ni jwaaŵili ŵaŵilanjikwe che Abiya. Wose ŵanaŵaŵili ŵaliji ŵakulamula kwele ku Beli Sheba. <verse eid="1SA 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 8:3" />Nambo ŵanache wo nganatamaga kwakwanonyelesya Akunnungu mpela muŵatesile atati ŵao. Nambo ŵagambaga kulisosela yakupoka kwawo. Ŵapochelaga indu kwachisyepela ni nganalamulaga magambo kwagoloka.<verse eid="1SA 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 8:4" />Nipele ilongola wose ŵa Ŵaisilaeli ŵasongangene pamo, ŵanjaulile che Samweli ku Lama ko, <verse eid="1SA 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 8:5" />ŵansalile, “Nnole alakwe jo sambano achekulwipe ni ŵanache ŵenu ngakutama kwakwanonyelesya Akunnungu mpela mmwe. Kwayele ntusagulile mwenye juchatulongosye mpela mwakutendela ilambo ine yose.” <verse eid="1SA 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 8:6" />Maloŵe gele ga ŵandu ŵa ku Isilaeli gakusaka kuti ŵaasagulile mwenye jwakwalongosya, nganigannonyelesya che Samweli. Kwayele jwapopesile kwa Ambuje Akunnungu. <verse eid="1SA 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 8:7" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵansalile che Samweli, “Mwajitichisye kila chindu chaakunsalila ŵandu, pakuŵa ngakunkana mmwejo, nambo akuungana une kuŵa mwenye jwawo. <verse eid="1SA 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 8:8" />Kutandilila panaakopwesye ku Misili, aanesile une, aŵele ali nkujitumichila minungu jine mpaka lelo. Indu yaambanganyichisye une, ni iyoyo yaakumpanganyichisya ni mmwe wakwe. <verse eid="1SA 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 8:9" />Nipele mwapilikanile, nambo mwajamuche kwannope, ni mwasalile pangasisa indu itaachapanganyisya mwenye jutachatawala jo.”<verse eid="1SA 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 8:10" />Kwayele, che Samweli ŵaasalile aŵala ŵandu ŵaŵaŵendaga ŵaasagulile mwenye yosepe iŵasasile Ambuje Akunnungu. <verse eid="1SA 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 8:11" />Ŵatite, “Yeleyi ni ichajile pakumpanganyichisya mwenye jwenu jutachintawala. Ŵanache ŵenu achalume chachatenda ŵakwendesya mutuka sya ngondo, ni ŵane ŵakwendesya falasi ŵakwe, ni ŵane ŵakuutuka mmbujo mwa mutuka syo. <verse eid="1SA 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 8:12" />Tasagule ŵane aŵe ilongola ŵa mipingo ja ŵangondo elufu moja ni ŵane aŵe ilongola ŵa mipingo ja ŵangondo hansinihansini. Ŵane tachatenda aŵe ŵakulima mu ngunda mwakwe, ni kugungula magungulo gakwe. Ŵane tachatenda aŵe ŵakusyana yakumenyanila ya pa ngondo ni ŵane tachisyana isyano ya mutuka syakwe sya ngondo. <verse eid="1SA 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 8:13" />Achiŵali ŵenu tachajigala ŵatende ŵakukolosya mauta gakununjila, ni ŵane ŵakuteleka yakulya ni ŵane ŵakuteleka mikate. <verse eid="1SA 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 8:14" />Tachijigala migunda jenu jajili ni chajila, migunda ja miseituni ni ja sabibu ni kwapa ŵakutumichila ŵakwe. <verse eid="1SA 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 8:15" />Tachijigala liunjili lya kakumi lya magungulo genu ni lya sabibu syenu ni kwapa ŵakamusi ŵakwe ni ŵakutumichila ŵakwe. <verse eid="1SA 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 8:16" />Tachajigala ŵakutumichila ŵenu achalume ni achakongwe ni ng'ombe syenu syakunakana ni mbunda syenu ni kwaligongo lya masengo gakwe. <verse eid="1SA 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 8:17" />Tachijigala liunjili lya kakumi lya ngondolo ni mbusi syenu. Ni ŵanyamwe mwachinsyene tinchiŵa achikapolo ŵakwe. <verse eid="1SA 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 8:18" />Pelepo patigannyichile gelego tinchiika kulila, kusosa ukamuchisyo kwa ligongo lya mwenye jumunsagwile ŵanyamwe mwachinsyene. Nambo Ambuje Akunnungu ngaika kunjanga.”<verse eid="1SA 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 8:19" />Namose yeleyo ŵandu nganampilikanila che Samweli, ni ŵatite, “Ngwamba! Uweji tukusaka tukole mwenye jutatutawale, <verse eid="1SA 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 8:20" />ni uwe tuŵe mpela ŵandu ŵa ilambo ine. Mwenye jwetu atulamulileje magambo getu ni kutulongosya pa ngondo.”<verse eid="1SA 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 8:21" />Ni pele che Samweli ŵajile kukwasalila Ambuje Akunnungu gele maloŵe gose gasalilwe ni wandu. <verse eid="1SA 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 8:22" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵasalile che Samweli, “Mwapilikanile ni mwape mwenye.” Nipele che Samweli ŵaasalile Ŵaisilaeli aujangane kila mundu ku musi wakwe.<verse eid="1SA 8:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1SA 9" />
  <para style="s">Che Sauli akusimana ni che Samweli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 9:1" />Mu lukosyo lwa Benjamini jwapali mundu jwakusichila ni jwakumanyika kwannope juŵaŵilanjikwe che Kishi. Jweleju ŵaliji mwanache ju che Abieli chisukulu chi che Selo, mwanache jwa mmauja ju che Bekolati atatigwe ŵaŵilanjikwe che Afia, mundu jwa lukosyo lwa Benjamini. <verse eid="1SA 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 9:2" />Che kishi ŵakwete mwanache jwannume liina lyakwe che Sauli. Che Sauli ŵaliji jwakusalala nnope, pasikati ja Ŵaisilaeli paliji pangali nchanda jwakusalala kumpunda jweleju. Che Sauli ŵaliji jwanlewu kwapunda ŵandu wose ŵa Islaeli mwakuti ŵandu wosepe ŵapelelaga mmakoyo.<verse eid="1SA 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 9:3" />Pa lyuŵa limo mbunda sya che Kishi atatigwe che Sauli syapotele. Nipele che Kishi ŵansalile che Sauli, “Munjigale jwamasengo jumo njaule nkasose mbunda syo.” <verse eid="1SA 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 9:4" />Nipele che Sauli ŵajawile kukusosa kumatumbi ga Efulaimu, ni malo gose ga Shalisha, nambo kweleko nganiŵawona. Nipele ŵaiche mpaka ku Shalimu, ni kweleko nombe nganiŵawona. Ni ŵaasosile ku chilambo cha Benjamini, namose yeleyo nganiŵawona. <verse eid="1SA 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 9:5" />Paŵaiche ku chilambo cha Sufu che Sauli ŵansalile jwakutumichila jwakwe, “Twende tuuje kumusi, nangaŵa yeleyo atati ŵangu taleche kuganisya yankati mbunda, ni kutanda kola lipamba kwaligongo lyetu.”<verse eid="1SA 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 9:6" />Jwakutumichila jula ŵansalile, “Nlindilile kanandi, pa musi wu apali mundu jwa Akunnungu jwakuchimbichikwa kwannope, chilichose chakusala chikutendekwaga. Sambano tunjaulile, panepa chatusalile kuti tujaule kwapi.” <verse eid="1SA 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 9:7" />Che Sauli ŵausisye, “Nambo twanjaulilaga tutukampe ichichi? Nnole masulufu gatwaliji nago gamasile ni nganitukola ntuuka wa kumpa mundu jwa Akunnungu jo. Ana tukwete ntuuka wauli ŵose wakwaapa sooni?”<verse eid="1SA 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 9:8" />Jwakutumichila jula ŵajanjile, “Une ngwete chipande cha mwana cha madini ga fesa. Tingampe jwele mundu jwa Akunnungu jo kuti atusalile tujaule litalachi.” <verse eid="1SA 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 9:9" />Kalakala ko ku Isilaeli mundu asakaga kummusya Akunnungu chiusyo ŵatiji, “Tunjaulile mundu jwa Ambuje Akunnungu jwakumanyilila yachiikopochele mmbujo.” Pakuŵa mundu jwakuŵilanjikwa jwakulondola sambano kalakala ko ŵaŵilanjikwe jwakumanyilila yachiikopochele mmbujo. <verse eid="1SA 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 9:10" />Che Sauli ŵajanjile, “ili yachambone, tunjaulile.” Kwayele ŵajawile ku musi uwatamaga mundu jwa Akunnungu jula. <verse eid="1SA 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 9:11" />Piŵakwelaga chitumbi kwaula ku musi wo, ŵasimene achiŵali ŵaŵajaulaga kukuteka mesi. Ni ŵaausisye achiŵali wo, “Ana mundu jwa kuiwona indu ya kuiwona Akunnungu jula ali mu musi mu?” <verse eid="1SA 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 9:12" />Achiŵali ŵala ŵaajanjile, “Elo apali. Sooni ali mmbujo mwenu, mwajanguyaga chimunsimane. Aiche lelo jino pamusi pa, pakuŵapo ŵandu lelo akwaula kukutaga mbopesi ku malo gakutajila mbopesi ku chitumbi ko. <verse eid="1SA 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 9:13" />Najinjila pe mmusi mo, tinkaasimene akanaŵe kwaula ku malo gakupeleka mbopesi ku chitumbi ko kukulya. Pakuŵa ŵandu ngaalya mpaka jwalakwe jo aiche kaje ni kusipopelela mbopesi syo. Pakumala pelepo ŵandu ŵaŵalaliche wo ni pachalye. Kwayele njanguyanje, timunsimane.” <verse eid="1SA 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 9:14" />Nipele che Sauli ni jwakutumichila jwakwe ŵakwesile kwaula ku musi ula. Paŵajinjilaga mmusi mo ŵammweni che Samweli ali nkukopoka mmusi mo ali nkwika kuŵaliji achijaulaga ku malo gakupeleka mbopesi, ku chitumbi.<verse eid="1SA 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 9:15" />Nambo mwa liiso lyakwe, che Sauli akanaŵe kwinjila mmusi Ambuje Akunnungu ŵammanyisye che Samweli chele chindu chi yakuti, <verse eid="1SA 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 9:16" />“Malaŵi ndema mpela asi, tinannyichisye mundu kutyochela ku lukosyo lwa Benjamini, nomwe timunjitilile mauta aŵe mwenye jwa ŵandu ŵangu Ŵaisilaeli. Jwelejo tachakulupusya ŵandu ŵangu mmakono ga Ŵafilisiti, pakuŵa nakuweni kulaga kwa ŵandu ŵenu ni nakupikene kulila kwawo.” <verse eid="1SA 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 9:17" />Che Samweli paŵammweni che Sauli pe, Ambuje Akunnungu ŵansalile, “Jweleju ni junansalile jula. Jweleju ni jutachalongosya ŵandu ŵangu.” <verse eid="1SA 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 9:18" />Pelepo che Sauli ŵanjaulile che Samweli juŵaliji chiŵandika ni nnango wekulungwa wa musi ni ŵansalile, “Choonde munosye nyuumba ja mundu jwakuiwona indu yakuiwona Akunnungu jili kwapi.”<verse eid="1SA 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 9:19" />Che Samweli ŵanjanjile, “Une ndili mundu jo. Nnongolele njaule ku malo gakupeleka mbopesi kuchitumbi pakuŵa lelo tinkalye pamo ni une. Tinjinsalila yose yaili muntima mwenu ni malaŵi kundaŵi tinjikunda kuti njauleje. <verse eid="1SA 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 9:20" />Yankati asila mbunda syasipotele moŵa gatatu gagapite, nkakola lipamba, sioneche. Ana munduchi jwakunsaka nnope Ŵaisilaeli? Ana nganimma mmwe ni ŵandu wose ŵa paulongo wa atati ŵenu?”<verse eid="1SA 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 9:21" />Che Sauli ŵajanjile, “Uneji ngutyochela ku lukosyo lwa Benjamini, lukosyo lwaluli lwenandi nnope mu Isilaeli. Ni mu lukosyo lwa Benjamini mo ulongo wangu uli wenandi nnope. Sambano ligongo chichi alakwe jo nkuusalila indu yanti yeleyo?”<verse eid="1SA 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 9:22" />Nipele che Samweli ŵaajawisye che Sauli ni jwakutumichila jwakwe pansana, ni kwatamika peuto papakuchimbichikwa nnope pasikati ja aŵala ŵandu wose ŵaŵalalichikwe, ŵandu wose ŵaliji salasini. <verse eid="1SA 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 9:23" />Che Samweli ŵansalile jwakuteleka, “Njisenawo nyama jinampele jila, jinansalile kuti njiŵiche pajika.” <verse eid="1SA 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 9:24" />Jwakuteleka jula ŵajawile ni kuikanawo nyama jose ja lukongolo ni kujiŵika paujo pa che Sauli. Pelepo che Samweli ŵatite, “Nnole chelechi ni chindu chichaŵichikwe pajika kwa ligongo lyenu, nleje pakuwa chaŵichikwe pajika kwaligongo lyenu kwa chindimba chi kuti nlye pamo ni achalendo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 9:24">Kwayele che Sauli ŵalile pamo ni che Samweli lyele lyuŵa lyo. <verse eid="1SA 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 9:25" />Paŵatulukaga kutyoche ku malo ga kutyochesya mbopesi kwaula ku musi, che Samweli wawechete ni che Sauli kutyochela chumba cha malo ga penani pa lisakasa.<verse eid="1SA 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Sauli akuŵa mwenye jwa kuislaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 9:26" />Kundaŵindaŵi pe, che Samweli ŵammilasile che Sauli pa lisakasa pala: “Nliwiche chile kuti chinanlechelele kuti njaule kumangwenu.” Che Sauli paŵaliwisile chile, nipele wose ŵanaŵaŵili ŵatyosile pasa. <verse eid="1SA 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 9:27" />Paŵaiche kumbesi kwa musi wo che Samweli ŵansalile che Sauli, “Munsalile jwakutumichila jwenu alongolele kaje.” Jwakutumichila jula ŵalongolele, nipo che Samweli ŵajendelechele kunsalila che Sauli “Muninde kanandi ni une tinansalile maloŵe gasasile Ambuje Akunnungu gankati mmwejo.”<verse eid="1SA 9:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1SA 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 10:1" />Pelepo che Samweli ŵajigele kachuupa kamauta ni kwajitilila che Sauli muntwe, pelepo ŵankumbatile ni kunsalila, “Ambuje Akunnungu anjitilile mauta kuti mme wakutawala pa ŵandu ŵenu wali muchilambo chenu. <verse eid="1SA 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 10:2" />Lelo patintyoche apano tinsimane ni ŵandu ŵaŵili chiŵandika ni lilembe lya che Laheli kwele ku Selisa ku mpika wa chilambo cha Benjamini. Tachinsalila kuti mbunda simwasosaga sila siwoneche. Atati ŵenu alesile kuganisya ya mbunda sano ali ni lipamba lya mmwejo. Kila katema ali nkuliusya, ‘Chinampate chinauli mwanangu?’ <verse eid="1SA 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 10:3" />Mwatyokaga pelepo njaule kwachili chitela chachikulungwa mwaloni chachili ku Taboli, kuchinkasimane ni achalume ŵatatu, ali nkwaula kupeleka mbopesi kwa Akunnungu ku Beseli ko. Jumo tachiŵa ali nkusilongosya mbusi sitatu syamwanamwana ni jwaaŵili ajigele mikate jitatu, ni jwaatatu jo tachiŵa ali ajigele msaku wa lipende wauli ni divai. <verse eid="1SA 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 10:4" />Tachinkomasya ni kumpa mikate jiŵili, mmwejo nkapochele mikate jo. <verse eid="1SA 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 10:5" />Nipele patinkaiche kwele ku Gibea ja Akunnungu, pelepo paali ni chigono cha ŵangondo ŵa Chifilisi, pele patinkaŵandichile musi, tinkasimane mpingo wa ŵakulondola ŵa Akunnungu, ali nkutyoka ku malo gakupelechela mbopesi ku chitumbi ko ali nkuputa inanda ni tugoma twamwana ni ing'wenyeng'wenye ni itolilo, akuno ali nkulondola. <verse eid="1SA 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 10:6" />Mbumu jwa Ambuje Akunnungu tachintuluchila kwa machili, nomwe wakwe tinchitanda kulondola pamo nawo, ni tinchigalauswa ni kuŵa mpela mundu jwine. <verse eid="1SA 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 10:7" />Pelepo imanyisyo yo patinnyiwone, ntende chilichose chitanlongosye Akunnungu kuti nchitende, pakuŵa Akunnungu ali pamo ni mmwe. <verse eid="1SA 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 10:8" />Nnongolele kwaula ku musi wa ku Giligali, kutinansimane ni kutyosya mbopesi syakutinisya ni mbopesi syachitendewele. Nkaalindilile kweleko kwa moŵa saba mpaka pachiiche kunnosya chakupanganya.”<verse eid="1SA 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 10:9" />Che Sauli paŵagalawiche kuti alekangane ni che Samweli Akunnungu ŵaugalawisye ntima wa che Sauli kuŵa wine. Imanyisyo yosepe ila yatendekwe lyuŵa lila. <verse eid="1SA 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 10:10" />Che Sauli ni jwakutumichila jwakwe paŵaiche ku Gibea ko, ŵachingamilwe ni mpingo wekulungwa wa ŵakulondola. Mbumu jwa Akunnungu ŵanjinjile kwa machili ni che Sauli ŵatandite kulondola pamo ni ŵakulondola ŵala. <verse eid="1SA 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 10:11" />Ŵandu ŵaŵammanyililaga kalakala, paŵammweni ali nkulondola pamo ni ŵakulondola ŵatandite kuusyana, “Ana chinsimene ichichi mwanagwe che Kishi? Uli che Sauli nombe ali jumo jwa ŵakulondola?” <verse eid="1SA 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 10:12" />Mundu jumpepe juŵatamaga kukoko ŵajanjile, “Uli achatati ŵao ali ŵani?” Nipele kwaliji ni chiŵecheto chachikuti, “Ana che Sauli nombe ali mu mpingo wa ŵakulondola?” <verse eid="1SA 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 10:13" />Che Sauli paŵamasile kulondola, ŵakwesile kwaula pamalo pa kupeleka mbopesi ku chitumbi.<verse eid="1SA 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 10:14" />Atatigwe ŵanandi paŵaweni che Sauli ni jwakutumichila jwakwe, ŵausisye, “Ana mwaliji kwapi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 10:14">Che Sauli ŵajanjile “Twapite kukusosa mbunda, ni patwaiweni kuti ngasikuwoneka, twapite ku che Samweli kukwausya.” <verse eid="1SA 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 10:15" />Atatigwe ŵanandi ŵala ŵansalile, “Choonde muusalile chansalile che Samweli.” <verse eid="1SA 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 10:16" />Che Sauli ŵajanjile, “Ŵatusalile kuti mbunda siwoneche.” Nambo che Sauli nganaasalila atatigwe ŵanandi jula kuti che Samweli ŵaasalile kuti tachiŵa mwenye.<verse eid="1SA 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Sauli akulalichilwa kuti aŵele mwenye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 10:17" />Che Samweli ŵaaŵilasile ŵandu wose asongangane paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu ku Misipa ko. <verse eid="1SA 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 10:18" />Paŵasongangene ŵaasalile, “Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu jwa ku Isilaeli akuti nnyi: Naawombwele Ŵaisilaeli ku chilambo cha ku Misili, nankopwesye mwanya mmakono mwa Ŵamisili ni mwenye sine sisyanliŵatilaga. <verse eid="1SA 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 10:19" />Nambo lelo jino muunganile une Akunnungu ŵenu jungunkulupusya mu imbulunga ni masausyo. Ni ŵanyamwe ntite, ‘Ngwamba! Ntujimichisye mwenye juchatutawale.’ Sambano nlisonganye ŵanawose mmbujo mwa Ambuje Akunnungu nli mu ngosyo syenu ni mitundu jenu.” <verse eid="1SA 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 10:20" />Nipele che Samweli paŵasiichisye ngosyo syose sya ku Isilaeli chiŵandi nawo, ni Ambuje Akunnungu ŵalusagwile lukosyo lwa Benjamini. <verse eid="1SA 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 10:21" />Ŵaaiche nawo mmbujo ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Benjamini, malinga ni ntundu ni ntundu, ni ntundu wa che Matili wasagulikwe. Kumbesi che Sauli mwana ju che Kishi ŵasagulikwe kwa kutenda gudugudu. Nambo paŵansosile nganawoneka. <verse eid="1SA 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 10:22" />Ŵammusisye Ambuje Akunnungu sooni, “Uli jwele mundu jo aiche apano?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 10:22">Ambuje Akunnungu ŵajanjile, “Elo, alisisile pa misigo.” <verse eid="1SA 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 10:23" />Nipele ŵautuchile kunjigala, ŵankopwesye ni kunnyikanawo. Che Sauli paŵajimi pasikati ja ŵandu ŵaliji alewipe kwapunda ŵandu wose, ŵanawose ŵampelelaga mmakoyo. <verse eid="1SA 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 10:24" />Che Samweli ŵaasalile ŵandu wose, “Jweleju ni mundu jwasagulikwe ni Ambuje Akunnungu, ngapagwa julijose jwali mpela jweleju pasikati ja ŵandu wose.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 10:24">Ŵandu wose ŵanyanyisye achitiji, “Akole umi weleu mwenye.”<verse eid="1SA 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 10:25" />Nipele che Samweli ŵaasalile ŵandu nkati ulamusi ni indu yaakusachilwa mwenye kuipanganya, ni ŵalembile mu chitabu chiŵachiŵisile paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu. Nipele che Samweli ŵaalanjile ŵandu wose, kila mundu ajaule kumangwakwe. <verse eid="1SA 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 10:26" />Nipele che Sauli ŵajawile kumangwakwe ku Gibea, pamo ni ŵandu ŵaali ni machili ŵati Akunnungu ŵaalongwesye kutenda yeleyo. <verse eid="1SA 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 10:27" />Nambo ŵandu ŵane ŵakulaŵalaŵa ŵatite, “Uli, jwele mundu ju chakombole chinauli kutukulupusya?” Ŵannyelwisye che Sauli ni nganampanga ntuuka uliwose. Nambo nsyene ŵatemi jii.<verse eid="1SA 10:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1SA 11" />
  <para style="s">Che Sauli akwapunda Ŵaamoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 11:1" />Nipele pawapite mweesi umo, mwenye che Nahashi jwa Ŵaamoni, ŵapite ni kuusyungula musi wa ku Yabeshi Gileadi. Ŵandu ŵakutama mu mmusi wo ŵansalile che Nahashi, “Ntende chilanga cha chitendewele ni uwe, ni uweji tutuchintumichila.” <verse eid="1SA 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 11:2" />Nambo che Nahashi ŵaasalile, “Tindende chilanga cha chitendewele ni ŵanyamwe ikaŵe ndili nankolopwele liso lya kunchiji lya jwalijose, kuti pakutenda yeleyo naatesye soni Ŵaisilaeli wose.” <verse eid="1SA 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 11:3" />Achakulu ŵa ku Yabeshi ŵansalile, “Ntulecheje kwa moŵa saba kuti twatume ŵantenga ku chilambo chose cha Ŵaisilaeli. Iŵaga ngaapagwa mundu jwalijose jwakutukulupusya, pelepo tutulipeleche kwa mmwejo twachinsyene.” <verse eid="1SA 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 11:4" />Ŵantenga ŵala paŵaiche ku Gibea, kuŵatamaga che Sauli, ŵasasile utenga wo kwa ŵandu, ni ŵandu wose ŵatandite kulila kwa kunyanyisya.<verse eid="1SA 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 11:5" />Katema ko che Sauli ŵaliji nkutyoka kumigunda ni ng'ombe syakwe, ŵausisye, “Ŵandu wo ajinjilwe chindu chachi? Uli chikusausya ichichi mpaka ŵandu alile?” Ŵansalile utenga uŵaichenawo ŵandu kutyochela ku Yabeshi. <verse eid="1SA 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 11:6" />Papopo che Sauli paŵagapilikene maloŵe go, mbumu jwa Akunnungu ŵannyichilile kwa machili, ŵatumbile kwannope. <verse eid="1SA 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 11:7" />Ŵajigele ng'ombe syankambaku siŵili ni kusisinga, nipele ŵasikatenye ipandeipande, ŵaatumile ŵantenga kuti aijausye ipande yo ku chilambo chosepe cha Ŵaisilaeli, ni akaŵecheteje kuti, “Amu ni mutachitendelwa ng'ombe ja mundu jwalijose jwangakunkuya che Sauli ni che Samweli ku ngondo.” Ŵandu wose ŵa ku Isilaeli ŵajinjilwe ni lipamba, kwaligongo lya Ambuje Akunnungu. Kwayele ŵandu wose ŵakamulene ni kuŵa chindu chimo. <verse eid="1SA 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 11:8" />Che Sauli ŵaasongangenye ku Beseki ko, ni ŵaliji ni ŵandu laki tatu kutyochela ku Isilaeli ni elufu salasini kutyochela ku Yuda. <verse eid="1SA 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 11:9" />Ŵaasalile aŵala ŵantenga ŵaŵaiche kutyochela ku Yabeshi, “Ŵandu ŵakutama ku Yabeshi Gileadi mwasalile nnyi: Malaŵi pachiliŵale lyuŵa, chimme nli nkulupwiche.” Ŵandu ŵa ku Yabeshi paŵapilikene yeleyo ŵasangalele kwannope. <verse eid="1SA 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 11:10" />Kwayele ŵandu ŵa ku Yabeshi ŵaasalile Ŵaamoni kuti, “Malaŵi tutulipeleche kukwenu, ni ŵanyamwe chintutende chilichose chinkuchisaka.”<verse eid="1SA 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 11:11" />Kundaŵi kwakwe che Sauli ŵagaŵenye ŵandu mipingo jitatu. Nipele kumasikusiku ŵajinjile pa chigono cha waamoni, ni kwagungumuchila. Wajendelechele kwaulaga mpaka muusi. Ŵaŵakulupwiche wo ŵapwilingene, jwalijose kuutuchilaga kwa jikajikape.<verse eid="1SA 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 11:12" />Pelepo Ŵaisilaeli ŵamusisye che Samweli, “Ana ali kwapi aŵala ŵandu ŵaŵatiji kuti che Sauli ngakombola kuŵa mwenye jwetu? Mwaichisye ŵandu wo, ni uweji tutwaulaje.” <verse eid="1SA 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 11:13" />Nambo che Sauli ŵaasalile, “Pakapagwa jwalijose jwakuulagwa lelo, pakuŵa lelojino Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaakulupwisye Ŵaisilaeli.”<verse eid="1SA 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 11:14" />Che Samweli ŵaasalile, “Twende wosepe tujaule ku Gileadi tukantangasye sooni kuti che Sauli ni mwenye jwetu.” <verse eid="1SA 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 11:15" />Ŵandu wose ŵajawile ku Giligali, ni paŵaiche kweleko ŵantangesye che Sauli kuŵa mwenye paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu. Ŵampelechele Ambuje Akunnungu mbopesi sya chitendewele kweleko. Che Sauli pamo ni ŵandu wose ŵa ku Isilaeli ŵatesile chindimba chekulungwa.<verse eid="1SA 11:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1SA 12" />
  <para style="s">Che Samweli akulangana ni ŵandu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 12:1" />Payamasile yeleyo, che Samweli ŵaasalile ŵandu wose ŵa ku Isilaeli achitiji, “Ndesile yanayose imuusalile. Nampele mwenye juchamtawale. <verse eid="1SA 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 12:2" />Sambano, nkwete mwenye jutachinlongosya. Kwa uneji, akuno kuchekulupa ni muntwe mwegumbale uli, ni ŵanache ŵangu nli nawo pamo. Uneji mele ndili nkunlongosya kutandila uchanda wangu mpaka sambano jino. <verse eid="1SA 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 12:3" />Une ndili panopano, iŵaga ndesile chilichose changalumbana, nipele nsaleje paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu ni paujo pa mwenye jwakwe jwasagulikwe. Ana sumwile ng'ombe pane mbunda ja mundu jwalijose? Ana nampunjile mundu jwalijose? Ana apali mundu jwalijose junammonele? Ana mbochela chindu kwa mundu kuti nambusye magambo? Iŵaga ndesile indu yati mpela yeleyo, une tinjilipa.” <verse eid="1SA 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 12:4" />Ŵandu ŵajanjile, “Ngwamba, nganatulambusya namose kutuliŵatila namose kwigala chindu chilichose kwa mundu.” <verse eid="1SA 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 12:5" />Che Samweli ŵajanjile, “Ambuje Akunnungu ali jwaumboni jwetu, ni mwenye jwakwe jwansagwile lelo jino ali jwaumboni kuti mumweni nganingola ligambo.” Ŵanyawo ŵajanjile, “Ŵelewo Ambuje Akunnungu ali jwaumboni.” <verse eid="1SA 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 12:6" />Che Samweli ŵaasalile, “Ambuje Akunnungu ni jwansagwile che Musa ni che Haluni ni kwakoposya achambuje Ŵenu ku chilambo cha ku Misili. <verse eid="1SA 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 12:7" />Sambano njimanje papopo kuti tuilolelole paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu ipanganyo yachigolochelo iŵaitesile Ambuje Akunnungu kwa mwanya ni kwa achambuje ŵenu. <verse eid="1SA 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 12:8" />Che Yakubu ni ŵapaulongo wakwe paŵajawile ku Misili, ni Ŵamisili paŵaaliŵatile, achambuje ŵetu ŵaalilile Ambuje Akunnungu, nombewo ŵaatumile che Musa ni che Haluni ŵaŵaakopwesye achambuje ŵenu ku chilambo cha ku Misili ni kwatesya ntamanje mu chilambo chi. <verse eid="1SA 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 12:9" />Nambo ŵandu wo ŵaaliŵalile Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu jwawo, nombe Akunnungu ŵantesile che Sisela chilongola jwa ŵangondo ŵa ku Hasoli wapute, ni sooni waputikwe Ŵafilisiti ni mwenye jwa ku Ŵamoabu. Ŵele ŵandu ŵa ilambo wo ŵaputene ni achambuje ŵetu ni kwapunda. <verse eid="1SA 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 12:10" />Achambuje ŵenu ŵalisile kwa Ambuje Akunnungu achitiji, ‘Tutesile sambi ligongo tunnesile mmwe Ambuje Akunnungu ni kujitumichila minungu ja Baali ni Ashitaloti yaikolochekwe ni ŵandu. Ntukulupusye mmakono mwa ŵammagongo ŵetu, ni uweji tutuntumichile.’ <verse eid="1SA 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 12:11" />Pelepo Ambuje Akunnungu ŵantumile Yelubaali yaani che Gidioni ni kanyuma ŵantumile che Balaka ni che Yefuta ni mbesi ŵandumile une che Samweli. Nombe Ambuje Akunnungu ŵankulupwisye kutyochele kwa ŵammagongo ŵenu ŵaŵansyungwile, ni ŵanyamwe mwatemi mu chitendewele. <verse eid="1SA 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 12:12" />Nambo pamwammweni mwenye che Nahashi jwa Ŵaamoni aiche kungungumuchila, mwankanile Ambuje Akunnungu jwali mwenye jwenu, ni mwasalile, ‘Ngwamba, tukunsaka mwenye atutawaleje.’<verse eid="1SA 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 12:13" />“Sambano mwenye jumunsagwile ni aju. Mwaŵendile Ambuje Akunnungu ampe mwenye, nombewo ampele mwenye jwa kumtawala. <verse eid="1SA 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 12:14" />Iŵaga timwachimbichisye Ambuje Akunnungu, ni kwatumichila ni kwapilikanila pangaleka ni kugakamulisya malamusi gakwe, ŵanyamwe mwachinsyene pamo ni mwenye jwenu jwakumtawala iŵaga timwakuye Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, nipele yosepe tiichinjendela chenene. <verse eid="1SA 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 12:15" />Nambo iŵaga ngankwapilikanila Ambuje Akunnungu, ni kuleka kukuya makanyo gakwe, nipele ŵelewo tachijamuka mwanya pamo ni mwenye jwenu mpela iwatite kwajamuka achambuje ŵenu. <verse eid="1SA 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 12:16" />Kwayele, njimanje jii ni tinchiwone chindu chekulungwa chichatende Ambuje Akunnungu paujo penu. <verse eid="1SA 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 12:17" />Uli, sambano ngaŵa chau ni katema ka magungulo ga ngano? Nambo uneji tinaapopelele Ambuje Akunnungu kuti aichenawo njasi ni ula, ni ŵanyamwe tinchimanyilile achi chindu chi yachitite kuŵa chakusakala paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu pammendile kuti nkole mwenye.”<verse eid="1SA 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 12:18" />Nipele che Samweli ŵapopesile kwa Ambuje Akunnungu ni Ambuje Akunnungu wo ŵatumisye njasi ni ula pa lyuŵa lyo. Ŵandu wose ŵanjogwepe Ambuje Akunnungu kwannope ni che Samweli jwakwe. <verse eid="1SA 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 12:19" />Nipele ŵansalile che Samweli, “Choonde atupopelele uweji ŵakutumichila ŵenu kwa Ambuje Akunnungu jwenu, kuti tukawa. Uwe sambano tumanyilile kuti pa ileŵo yetu yose tujonjechesye sambi jekulungwa kwakulisachila mwenye.”<verse eid="1SA 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 12:20" />Che Samweli ŵaajanjile, “Nkajogopa, nachiŵamuno ntesile ugongomalo wu, nkaleka kwakuya Ambuje Akunnungu, nambo mwatumichile kwa mitima jenu jose. <verse eid="1SA 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 12:21" />Nkajikuya minungu ja unami jangampokasya namose ngajikukombola kunkulupusya, pakuŵa ngajikombola kutenda chachilichose. <verse eid="1SA 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 12:22" />Kwaligongo lya liina lyakwe lyekulu, Ambuje Akunnungu ngawakana wandu ŵandu ŵakwe pakuŵa Ambuje Akunnungu wanonyelwe kuntenda mme ŵandu ŵakwe. <verse eid="1SA 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 12:23" />Kwauneji ngaiŵa yambone neche kwapopelela kwa Ambuje Akunnungu, natendaga yeleyo chime ngutenda sambi kwa Ambuje Akunnungu kwa yele chinyendelechele kwajiganya litala lya lili lyamboni ni lya chigolochelo. <verse eid="1SA 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 12:24" />Nambo ŵanyamwe katema kose mwachimbichisyeje Ambuje Akunnungu ni kwatumichila kwa kukulupilichika kwa mitima jenu jose. Nkumbuchileje aila indu yekulungwa yantendele. <verse eid="1SA 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 12:25" />Nambo iŵaga nkwendelechela kutendekanya ugongomalo, chimmulajikwe mwanya pamo ni mwenye jwenu.”<verse eid="1SA 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1SA 13" />
  <para style="s">Waislaeli akuputana ngondo ni Ŵafilisiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 13:1" />Che Sauli ŵaliji ni yaka salasini katema paŵatandite kutawala. Ni ŵatawele ku Isilaeli kwa yaka alobaini na mbili. <verse eid="1SA 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 13:2" />Che Sauli ŵasagwile Ŵaisilaeli elufu tatu kuŵa ŵangondo ŵakwe, pasikati jawo ŵandu elufu mbili ŵaliji ni che Sauli ku Mikimashi ni ku chilambo cha ikwesya cha ku Beseli. Ŵandu elufu moja ŵaaŵisile kwele ku Gibea mu chilambo cha lukosyo lwa Benjamini, paasi pa ulongosi wa che Yonasani mwanagwe. Ŵandu ŵaŵasigalile ŵane wosepe ŵausisye kumangwawo. <verse eid="1SA 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 13:3" />Che Yonasani ŵachigungumuchile chigono cha Ŵafilisiti chichaliji ku Geba, nipele Ŵafilisiti wosepe ŵaipikene yeleyi. Kwayele che Sauli ŵagombile lipenga ku chilambo chose ŵatangesye achitiji, “Ŵaebulania apilikane.” <verse eid="1SA 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 13:4" />Ŵaisilaeli paŵapilikene kuti che Sauli ŵaliji auleje ŵangondo ŵa Ŵafilisiti ŵawaliji pachigono ni Ŵafilisiti wo ŵatandite kwachima kwannope Ŵaisilaeli, Nipele ŵandu ŵaŵilanjikwe ajaule kukukamulangana ni che Sauli kwele ku Giligali ko.<verse eid="1SA 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 13:5" />Ŵafilisiti ŵasongangene kuti akaputane ni Ŵaisilaeli ali ni mutuka syakwekwelemwa elufu salasini ni ŵangondo ŵakwela mu falasi elufu sita ni ŵangondo ŵakwenda wapaasi ŵajinji nti nsanga wakumbwani, ŵanawose ŵakwesile ni kuŵika chigono chao kwele ku Mikimashi, kungopochelo lyuŵa kwa Beti Aveni.<verse eid="1SA 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 13:6" />Ŵaisilaeli paŵaiweni kuti alinji mu chakogoya ni kuti ŵangondo ŵao akwagungumuchila kwannope, ŵatandite kulisisa. Ŵane ŵalisisile mmalembe ni wane muisukutu wane mu lwala ni ŵane mmasimbo ni ŵane mu isima. <verse eid="1SA 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 13:7" />Waebulania Ŵane ŵajombweche lusulo lwa Yolodani ni kwinjila ku chilambo cha ku Gadi ni ku Gileadi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 13:7">Nambo che Sauli ŵaliji ku Giligali kukoko ni ŵandu wose ŵankuiye ali nkutetemela. <verse eid="1SA 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 13:8" />Che Sauli ŵaliji nkwalindilila che Samweli kwa moŵa saba, mpela iŵatite kusala che Samweli. Nambo che Samweli nganajaula kwele ku Giligali ni ŵandu ŵatandite kupwilingana.<verse eid="1SA 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 13:9" />Nipele che Sauli ŵaasalile ŵandu, “Munyichisye mbopesi jenu jakutinisya ni asila sya chitendewele.” Nombejo ŵatasile mbopesi syakutinisya sila.<verse eid="1SA 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 13:10" />Papopo paŵamalisisye kupeleka mbopesi sya kutinisya, che Samweli ŵaiche. Che Sauli ŵakopweche pasa kwaula kukunchingamila. <verse eid="1SA 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 13:11" />Che Samweli ŵausisye, “Ana ntesile ichichi?” Che Sauli ŵajanjile, “Panaiweni kuti ŵandu akupwilingana, ni ŵalakwe jo mwaliji nkanaŵe kwika pa moŵa gamwaŵechete kuti tinnyiche, ni sooni panaiweni Ŵafilisiti aliŵisile chile kwa ngondo kwele ku Mikimashi ko, <verse eid="1SA 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 13:12" />ni naganisye kuti Ŵafilisiti chaiche kukuugungumuchila ku Giligali kunokuno. Sooni naliji bado kuŵenda chanasa kwa Ambuje Akunnungu. Pelepo yanganganichisye kupeleka mbopesi jakutinisya une nansyene.”<verse eid="1SA 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 13:13" />Che Samweli ŵajanjile che Sauli kuti, “Ntesile mwakuloŵela. Nganingajitichisya gaŵansalile Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu. Nkaajitichisye Ambuje Akunnungu akautamilisye umwenye wenu pa Ŵaisilaeli moŵa gose pangali mbesi. <verse eid="1SA 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 13:14" />Nambo sambano umwenye wenu ngautamilisya, pakuŵa nganingajitichisya makanyo gaŵampele Ambuje Akunnungu. Ambuje Akunnungu alisosele mundu jwine jwakuunonyelesya ntima wakwe, jwelejo ni jwansagwile kuŵa mwenye pa ŵandu ŵakwe.”<verse eid="1SA 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 13:15" />Nipele che Samweli ŵatyosile ku Giligali ni kwaula ku Gibea ku chilambo cha Benjamini.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 13:15">Che Sauli paŵaŵalasile ŵandu ŵaŵaliji pamo nawo, ŵaliji ŵangondo mia sita. <verse eid="1SA 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 13:16" />Che Sauli ni che Yonasani mwanagwe pamo ni ŵangondo ŵaŵaliji pamo nawo ŵatemi ku Gibea chilambo cha Benjamini ni Ŵafilisiti ŵaŵisile chigono ku Mikimashi. <verse eid="1SA 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 13:17" />Ŵafilisiti ŵatyosile ku chigono chao kwaula kukwagungumuchila ali pa mipingo jitatu. Mpingo umo wajawile ku Ofila ku chilambo cha ku Shuali. <verse eid="1SA 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 13:18" />Mpingo wine wajawile ku Beti Holoni, ni mpingo wine wajawile ku mpika waukwaula ku chiŵata cha Seboimu chachikulolegana ni chipululu.<verse eid="1SA 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 13:19" />Pa kele katema ko paliji pangali mundu jwali jose ku chilambo chose cha ku Isilaeli jwaŵakombwele kusyana chindu chachili chose pakuŵa Ŵafilisiti nganiŵakundaga Ŵaebulania kuti alijiganye kusyana mapanga pane mipamba. <verse eid="1SA 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 13:20" />Kila Mwisilaeli yakanganyichisye kwajaulila Ŵafilisiti kukunolesya lijela lyakwe lyakukwekwelemya ni chinyama, majela ni maŵago ni ikwakwa yao. <verse eid="1SA 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 13:21" />Pakuti anolesye maŵago ni isonga yakuputila ng'ombe Ŵaisilaeli ŵalipaga ntengo wekulungwa, ŵatyosyaga ipande iŵili ya madini ga feza, nambo iŵaga kunola lijela lyakukwekwelemya ni chinyama ntengo wakwe waliji chipande chimo cha madini ga feza. <verse eid="1SA 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 13:22" />Kwayele pajakopochelaga ngondo nganapagwa jwangondo pasikati ja wose ŵaŵaliji ni che Sauli ni che Yonasani mwanagwe juŵaliji ni lipanga pane mpamba ikaŵe che Sauli ni che Yonasani mwanagwe. <verse eid="1SA 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 13:23" />Kwayele Ŵafilisiti ŵajawisye mpingo wa ŵangondo kukulindilila litala lyalikwaula ku Mikimashi.<verse eid="1SA 13:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1SA 14" />
  <para style="s">Kulimba ntima ku che Yonasani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 14:1" />Lyuŵa limo che Yonasani mwanagwe che Sauli mwenye, ŵansalile nchanda jwakwe jwakunjigalila yakumenyanilana, “Njise, twende tujombochele ku chigono cha Ŵafilisiti.” Nambo che Yonasani nganansalila atatigwe chele chindu cho. <verse eid="1SA 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 14:2" />Pa moŵa go che Sauli ŵaliji aŵisile chigono kuusi kwa chitela cha mkomamanga kwele ku Migiloni paasa pa musi wa ku Gibea, ali pamo ni ŵangondo mia sita. <verse eid="1SA 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 14:3" />Jwambopesi juŵawalaga chisibao ŵaliji che Ahiya mwanache ju che Ahitubu nlongo njakwe che Ikabodi mwanache ju che Finehasi, mwanagwe che Eli juŵaliji jwambopesi jwa Ambuje Akunnungu musi wa ku Shilo. Ngapagwa juŵaimanyililaga kuti che Yonasani ŵaliji atyosile pachigono.<verse eid="1SA 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 14:4" />Kila upande uwatiji che Yonasani apite kuti aiche pa chigono cha Ŵafilisiti kwaliji ni lwala siŵili sisyaliji ni nduluko syekulungwa. Nduluko jimo jaŵilanjikwe Bosesi ni nduluko jine jaŵilanjikwe Sene. <verse eid="1SA 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 14:5" />Nduluko jimo jaliji chakumpoto kulolegana ni musi wa ku Mikimashi ni nduluko jine jaliji kulujenda kulolegana ni musi wa ku Gibea.<verse eid="1SA 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 14:6" />Che Yonasani ŵansalile nchanda jwakunjigalila yakumenyanilana jula, “Njise tujaule upaande waaŵili, akula ku chigono cha ŵandu ŵangakwamanyilila Akununnungu ŵanganaumbale ŵa. Panepa Ambuje Akunnungu chatukamuchisye, pakuŵa Ambuje Akunnungu ngakukulupusya kwa ligongo lya kutupa kwa ŵandu pane ungatupa.”<verse eid="1SA 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 14:7" />Jwanchanda jwakunjigalila yakumenyanilana jula ŵajanjile, “Elo uneji ndili pamo ni mmwe, pakuŵapo chinkuchiganisya mmwe ni chinguchiganisya une.” <verse eid="1SA 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 14:8" />Che Yonasani ŵansalile, “Elo ukotopasyo wangu ni au, tutujomboche twajaulileje ŵandu ŵala kuti akatuwone. <verse eid="1SA 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 14:9" />Iŵaga chatusalile kuti twalindilile mpaka aiche kutuli uwe, nipele tutujime papopo ni ngatwajaulila. <verse eid="1SA 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 14:10" />Nambo atiji tukwele twajaulile, nipele tutukwele kwajaulila pakuŵa chelecho chichiŵe chimanyisyo chakuti Ambuje Akunnungu chatukombolesye kwapunda.” <verse eid="1SA 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 14:11" />Nipele ŵalikopwesye kuti awoneche ni Ŵafilisiti. Ŵafilisiti paŵaaweni ŵatite, “Nnole Ŵaebulania ŵala ali nkukopoka mmasimbo muŵalisisile.” <verse eid="1SA 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 14:12" />Ŵafilisiti ŵaŵaliji nkulindilila pachigono ŵammilasile che Yonasani ni ajula nchanda juŵanjigalile yakumenyanilana “Njise akuno, nchiwone!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:12">Che Yonasani ŵansalile nchanda jula, “Nkwele twende, Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaatesile Ŵaisilaeli ŵaapunde.” <verse eid="1SA 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 14:13" />Nipele che Yonasani ŵakwesile pa nduluko pala chakwaŵa ni nchanda jwakwe jula ali nkukuya chapanyuma ali nkwaulaga Ŵafilisiti. <verse eid="1SA 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 14:14" />Ŵandu ŵaŵaauleje che Yonasani ni nchanda jwakwe paŵagungumuchile kaandanda ŵaliji ŵandu ishilini, ŵaaulajile pa malo gakunandipa gakwanila nusu heka. <verse eid="1SA 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 14:15" />Ŵangondo wose ŵa Ŵafilisiti ŵatandite kulyulyuganya, aŵala ŵangondo ŵaŵaliji pachigono ŵautuchile mmamigunda namose ŵangondo ŵaŵalindililaga pa chigono ni ŵakugungumuchila ŵatetemele kwaligongo lya woga. Kwaliji ni chindendemesi pamalo pala ni pele paliji ni woga wekulunga wannope uŵaichisye Akunnungu.<verse eid="1SA 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ŵaisilaeli akwapunda Ŵafilisiti ku ngondo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 14:16" />Ŵakuuchilichisya ŵa che Sauli ku Gibea ko mu chilambo cha Benjamini ŵaaweni ŵandu ŵajinji ali nkuutuka akuno ni akunokuno. <verse eid="1SA 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 14:17" />Che Sauli ŵaasalile ŵandu ŵaŵaliji pamo nawo, “Nliŵalanje kuti tuimanyilile iŵaga pana ŵatyosile.” Ŵaŵalasile nipele che Yonasani ni nchanda jwakwe jwakunjigalila yakumenyanilana nganawoneka. <verse eid="1SA 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 14:18" />Che Sauli ŵansalile jwambopesi che Ahiya, “Njisenawo lisanduku lya Ambuje Akunnungu.” Pa katema ko lisanduku lya lilangano lya Ambuje Akunnungu lyaliji pamo ni Ŵaisilaeli. <verse eid="1SA 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 14:19" />Che Sauli paŵaliji chiŵela nkuŵecheta ni jwambopesi, masegwe ga lipamba pachigono cha Ŵafilisiti gapundile kwannope. Kwayele che Sauli ŵansalile jwambopesi, “Nneche, nkaikanawo lisanduku lya lilangano lya Ambuje Akunnungu lyo.” <verse eid="1SA 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 14:20" />Nipele che Sauli ni ŵandu ŵakwe ŵaliŵisile chile ni kwaula ku ngondo kukumenyana ni Ŵafilisiti. Nambo Ŵafilisiti ali alyulyugene kwannope ali nkumenyana achinsyene pe ni mapanga gao. <verse eid="1SA 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 14:21" />Ŵaebulania ŵaŵaliji ku upaande wa Ŵafilisiti, aŵala ŵaŵajawile nawo ku chigono, ŵatyosile ŵaapite kuŵa pamo ni ŵangondo wa Ŵaisilaeli ŵaŵaliji pamo ni che Sauli ni che Yonasani. <verse eid="1SA 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 14:22" />Ni Ŵaisilaeli ŵane ŵaŵaliji alisisile ku chilambo cha ikwesya cha Efulaimu, paŵapilikene kuti Ŵafilisiti ali nkuutuka, nombe nawo ŵaakuiye ni kwaputa.<verse eid="1SA 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 14:23" />Kwayele Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaapele Ŵaisilaeli kupunda. Ngondo jajenele mpaka jaiche ku Beti Aveni.<verse eid="1SA 14:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Indu iyakopochele pajamasile ngondo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 14:24" />Lyele lyuwa lyo Ŵaisilaeli ŵaliji alepetele ligongo lya sala, pakuŵa che Sauli ŵalumbisye ŵandu kuti, “Mundu jwalijose juchalye chakulya chilichose lelo lyuŵa likanaŵe kutiŵila, ni sooni une ngunaŵe kwauchisya ŵammagongo ŵangu alweseche.” Kwayele pangali mundu jwalijose juŵalile chakulya chilichose lyuŵa lila lyose. <verse eid="1SA 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 14:25" />Ŵangondo wose paŵaiche mu ukweti ŵauweni uchi uli ujenele paasi. <verse eid="1SA 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 14:26" />Pawajinjile mu ukweti wauweni uchi uli nkusulula, nambo nganapagwa mundu jwajuli jose juŵalinjile kulapita uchi wo ligongo ŵajogopaga kulumbila kuŵalumbilile kula. <verse eid="1SA 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 14:27" />Nambo che Yonasani ŵaliji ŵangapikana atatigwe paŵalumbisye ŵandu. Kwayele ŵalugolwesye lubokola luŵaliji nawo, ŵalutoŵele pa liseega ŵalapite uchi ula. Pelepo ŵapatile machili. <verse eid="1SA 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 14:28" />Mundu jumo ŵansalile, “Atati ŵenu ŵaalumbisye kwachikali ŵandu achitiji, ‘Mundu jwalijose juchalye chakulya lelo alweseche.’ Lyelelyo ni ligongo ŵandu alepetele.” <verse eid="1SA 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 14:29" />Che Yonasani ŵajanjile, “Atati ŵangu ŵaichisye wandu malagasyo. Sambano uneji ngulipikana ngwete machili ligongo napite uchi kanandi. <verse eid="1SA 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 14:30" />Ŵangondo ŵetu akalile achila chakulya chiŵasumwile kutyochela kwa ŵammagongo ŵao, Ŵafilisiti ŵajinji akaulajikwe!”<verse eid="1SA 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 14:31" />Pa lyuŵa lila Ŵaisilaeli ŵaaputile Ŵafilisiti kutandilila ku Mikimashi mpaka ku Aiyaloni. Kwayele Ŵaisilaeli ŵamalilwe machili kwannope ligongo lya sala, <verse eid="1SA 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 14:32" />nipele ŵautuchile ku indu iŵasumwile kwa ŵammagongo ila, ŵajigele ngondolo ni ngombe jankambaku ni kuisikata jikanaŵe miasi kumala kusulula ŵajiŵawile nyamajo ni kulya. <verse eid="1SA 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 14:33" />Ŵandu ŵane ŵansalile che Sauli, “Nnole ŵandu akutenda sambi kwa Ambuje Akunnungu pakutauna nyama jajili ni miasi.” Che Sauli ŵaasalile ŵandu “Mwanya mmela ŵandu wangakulupilichika kwa Ambuje Akunnungu. Nligalambule liganga lyekulungwa apano pandili pano.” <verse eid="1SA 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 14:34" />Ni ŵaasalile sooni, “Njaule nkaasalile ŵandu wose aicheje ni ngombe ni ngondolo syao, asikite aleche miasi jisulule ni akulumisyeje ni kulya kunokuno nambo akatenda sambi kwa Ambuje Akunnungu kwa kulya nyama jajili ni miasi.” Kwayele kila mundu wajiichisye ngombe jakwe chilo chila ni kusikitila papopo. <verse eid="1SA 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 14:35" />Nipele che Sauli ŵaataŵile Ambuje Akunnungu chilisa. Keleko kaliji kaandanda kwa Che sauli kwataŵila Ambuje Akunnungu chilisa.<verse eid="1SA 14:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 14:36" />Nipele che Sauli ŵaasalile ŵandu, “Chilo twende twakuilisye Ŵafilisiti, tukaagungumuchile ni kwasumula ipanje yao mpaka kuninkucha, tukanneka jwanjumi mundu jwalijose.” Ŵandu ŵansalile “Ntendeje chilichose chinkuchiona chili chambone.” Nambo jwambopesi ŵaasalile, “Twausye Ambuje Akunnungu kaje.”<verse eid="1SA 14:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 14:37" />Kwayele che Sauli ŵausisye kwa Akunnungu kuti, “Ana nduluche nyaule ngaagungumuchile Ŵafilisiti? Uli, timwakamuchisye Ŵaisilaeli ŵaapunde?” Nambo Akunnungu nganajanga chilichose pa lyuŵa lyo. <verse eid="1SA 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 14:38" />Pelepo che Sauli ŵatite, “Njisangane apano mwanya ilongola ŵa ŵandu ŵangondo, kuti tumanyilile sambi chi jitendekwe lelo. <verse eid="1SA 14:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 14:39" />Ngulumbila kwa Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaali ŵajumi ni ŵakuchikulupusya chilambo cha ku Isilaeli, namose iŵeje mwanangu che Jonasani akusachilwa aulajikwe.” Nambo nganapagwa mundu juŵajanjile chilichose. <verse eid="1SA 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 14:40" />Kwayele che Sauli ŵaasalile, “Ŵanyamwe wose njimanje upaande ula, uneji ni mwanangu che Yonasani tutujime au upaande wu.” Ŵandu ŵajanjile, “Ntendeje chilichose chinkuchiwona chili chambone.” <verse eid="1SA 14:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 14:41" />Che Sauli ŵapopesile achitiji, “Alakwe Ambuje Akunnungu jwa ku Isilaeli, kwachichi nganimuunyanga une jwakutumichila jwenu? Alakwe Ambuje Akunnungu jwa ku Isilaeli, iŵaga uneji ni juneŵile pane che Yonasani mwanangu, nipele nlamule kwa liganga lyalikuŵilanjikwa ulimu. Nambo iŵaga ŵandu ŵenu Ŵaisilaeli ni ŵaleŵile, nlamule kwa liganga lyalikuŵilanjikwa Tumimu.” Che Yonasani ni che Sauli ŵasimanikwe ni chileŵo, nambo ŵandu nganasimanikwa ni chileŵo. <verse eid="1SA 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 14:42" />Che Sauli ŵatite, “Mpijeje kula pasikati jangu ni che Yonasani mwanangu.” Che Yonasani ŵasimanikwe ni chileŵo. <verse eid="1SA 14:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1SA 14:43" />Pelepo che Sauli ŵansalile che Yonasani, “Muusalile ntesile ichichi?” Che Yonasani ŵajanjile, “Nalapite uchi kanandi ni lubokola lwangu. Ndili apano ni sooni ndili chile kuwa.” <verse eid="1SA 14:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1SA 14:44" />Che Sauli ŵatite, “Akunnungu aamulaje iwaga mmwe che Yonasani ngamulajikwa.”<verse eid="1SA 14:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="1SA 14:45" />Nambo ŵandu ŵansalile che Sauli, “Ana nkuti awe che Yonasani jwapundile ngondo jajikulungwa jakwakulupusya Ŵaisilaeli? Yeleyo ngaikomboleka hata kanandi. Tukulumbila kwa Ambuje Akunnungu ŵajumi, namose luumbo lwa muntwe wakwe ngalupatuchila paasi. Chatesile lelo, atesile kwa ukamuchisyo wa Ambuje Akunnungu.” Kwayele ŵandu ŵasiŵile kuti che Yonasani ni akaulajikwa.<verse eid="1SA 14:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="1SA 14:46" />Nipele che Sauli ŵalesile kwakuilisya Ŵafilisiti, nombe Ŵafilisiti ŵausile muchilambo chao.<verse eid="1SA 14:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutawala kwa che Sauli ni nnango wakwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="1SA 14:47" />Che Sauli paŵaliji mwenye jwa ku Isilaeli, ŵamenyene ni ŵammagongo ŵaŵansyungulile kulikose. Ŵamenyene ni Ŵamoabu ni Ŵaamoni ni Ŵaedomu ni mamwenye ŵa ku Soba ni Ŵafilisiti. Palipose paŵamenyene ngondo ŵapundile. <verse eid="1SA 14:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1SA 14:48" />Ŵamenyene kwakulimbangana ni ŵaapundile Ŵaamaleki. Ŵaakulupwisye Ŵaisilaeli ni ŵandu wose ŵaŵaagungumuchile.<verse eid="1SA 14:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="1SA 14:49" />Ŵanache ŵachilume ŵa che Sauli ŵaliji che Yonasani ni che Ishivi ni che Maliki Shua. Ŵanache ŵachikongwe ŵaliji ŵaŵili, jwaandanda kupangwa jwaŵilanjikwe che Melabu ni jwannunguni jwaŵilanjikwe che Mikali. <verse eid="1SA 14:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1SA 14:50" />Jwankongwe jwa che Sauli jwaŵilanjikwe che Ahinoamu mwali jwa che Ahimaasi. Jwankulu jwa ŵangondo jwa che Sauli jwaŵilanjikwe che Abuneli mwanache ju che Neli, njombagwe che Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 14:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1SA 14:51" />Atatigwe che Sauli, yaani che Kishi ni atatigwe che Abuneli yaani che Neli ŵanawose ŵaliji ŵanache wachilule ŵa che Abieli.<verse eid="1SA 14:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="1SA 14:52" />Katema kose che Sauli pawaliji mwenye kwaliji ni ngondo jajikulungwa ni Ŵafilisiti, ni katema kose che Sauli ammonaga mundu jwamachili panepa jwakulimba ntima, ŵanjinjisyaga mu mpingo ŵa ŵangondo.<verse eid="1SA 14:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1SA 15" />
  <para style="s">Che Sauli akuputana ngondo ni Ŵaamaleki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 15:1" />Che Samweli ŵansalile che Sauli, “Ambuje Akunnungu ŵandumile une nanjitilile mauta mme mwenye jwa ŵandu ŵakwe Ŵaisilaeli. Sambano mpilikanile maloŵe ga Ambuje Akunnungu. <verse eid="1SA 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 15:2" />Ambuje Akunnungu akuti yeleyi, ‘Tinaajamuche Ŵaamaleki ligongo ŵaaputile Ŵaisilaeli paŵaliji nkutyoka ku Misili. <verse eid="1SA 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 15:3" />Sambano njaule nkaagungumuchile ni kujonanga indu yao yakwete. Ngasimwaleka ŵajumi, nkaaulaje ŵanawose: Achalume ni achakongwe wakwe ni ŵanache achanandi ni ŵakonga, ni ng'ombe ni ngondolo ni ngamia ni mbunda.’”<verse eid="1SA 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 15:4" />Che Sauli ŵaaŵilasile ŵangondo ŵakwe ni kwaŵalanga kwele ku Telaimu ko. Kwaliji ni ŵangondo ŵakwenda ŵapasi laki mbili ŵakutyochela ku Isilaeli ni elufu kumi kutyochela ku Yuda. <verse eid="1SA 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 15:5" />Kanyuma nsyene jo pamo ni ŵandu ŵakwe ŵajawile ku musi wa Ŵaamaleki, nipele ŵalijuŵile mwichemba kuti ŵajuŵilile. <verse eid="1SA 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 15:6" />Che Sauli ŵaasalile Ŵakeni, “Ntyokangane pasikati ja Ŵaamaleki kogopa kwajonanjila pamo nawo. Pakuŵapo ŵanyamwe mwaatendele indu yambone Ŵaisilaeli paŵatyochelaga ku Misili.” Nipele Ŵakeni ŵatyosile pasikati ja Ŵaamaleki.<verse eid="1SA 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 15:7" />Nipele che Sauli ŵaapundile Ŵaamaleki pa ngondo kutandila ku Hafila mpaka ku Shuli kungopochelo lyuŵa kwa Misili. <verse eid="1SA 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 15:8" />Ŵankamwile mwenye che Agagi jwa Ŵaamaleki ali jwanjumi ni ŵandu ŵakwe ŵaauleje ni lipanga. <verse eid="1SA 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 15:9" />Nambo che Sauli ni ŵangondo ŵakwe ŵalesile che Agagi ali wajumi, pamo ni ngondolo syakwimbala ni ng'ombe syakwimbala ni ng'ombe sya mwana ni ngondolo sya mwana ni chilichose chichawonekaga chakusalala indu yo nganasaka kuchijonanga. Nambo indu yose yanganaisaka ni yakuganda ŵaijonasile.<verse eid="1SA 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chesauli akukanikwa akaŵa mwenye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 15:10" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵansalile che Samweli kuti, <verse eid="1SA 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 15:11" />“Ngulilasika kuti nantesile che Sauli kuŵa mwenye. Pakuŵa agalawiche nipele alesile kuunguya une kwakuti nganagajitichisya malamusi gangu.” Che Samweli ŵatumbile, nipele ŵachesisye chilo chosepe kwalilila Ambuje Akunnungu. <verse eid="1SA 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 15:12" />Che Samweli ŵapilikene kuti che Sauli aiche ku Kalimeli ni ajimicheliganga lyekulungwa lya chikumbuchisyo cha ukulu wakwe, ni sooni apite ku Giligali. Kwayele kundaŵi kwakwe che Samweli ŵajimwiche kundaŵipe ŵapite kukusimana ni che Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 15:13" />Che Samweli paŵansimene che Sauli, che Sauli ŵansalile che Samweli, “Ambuje Akunnungu ampe upile, Ndesile malajisyo ga Ambuje Akunnungu.”<verse eid="1SA 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 15:14" />Che Samweli ŵausisye, “Ana kulila kwa ngondolo ku ni chichi? ni akuku kulila kwa ng'ombe kwangukupikana ku ni chichi?” <verse eid="1SA 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 15:15" />Che Sauli ŵajanjile, “Ŵangondo ŵangu ŵaijigele yeleyi kwa Ŵaamaleki, nganaulaga asila ngondolo ni ng'ombe syakwimbala, ŵasilesile kuti asityosye mbopesi kwa Ambuje Akunnungu ŵao, nambo ine yose tuuleje.” <verse eid="1SA 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 15:16" />Che Samweli ŵansalile kuti, “Mmyalale,! Tinansalile chindu chaasalile Ambuje Akunnungu chilo cha lelojino.” Che Sauli ŵajanjile, “Muusalile.”<verse eid="1SA 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 15:17" />Che Samweli ŵansalile, “Nachiŵamuno mwalionaga kuti mmwe nganimma ŵakumanyika, ana nganitendekwa kuwa chilongola jwa ngosyo sya ku Isilaeli? Ambuje Akunnungu ŵanjitilile mauta kuti mme mwenye jwa Ŵaisilaeli. <verse eid="1SA 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 15:18" />Ambuje Akunnungu paŵantumile ŵansalile kuti, ‘Njaule nkaaulaje aŵala Ŵaamaleki ŵali ni sambi, nkamenyane nawo mpaka nkaaulaje ŵanawose.’ <verse eid="1SA 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 15:19" />Ligongo chichi basi nganinlijitichisya liloŵe lya Ambuje Akunnungu? Ligongo chichi mwautuchile kusumula indu, ni kutenda ugongomalo paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu?”<verse eid="1SA 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 15:20" />Che Sauli ŵajanjile, “Une nagapikanile maloŵe ga Ambuje Akunnungu. Najawile akula kuŵandumile Ambuje Akunnungu, naauleje Ŵaamaleki wosepe ni nanjigele che Agagi mwenye jwa Ŵaamaleki ni kunnyikanawo apano. <verse eid="1SA 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 15:21" />Nambo ŵangondo ŵangu wajigele Ngondolo ni ng'ombe syakwimbala siŵasumwile. Ŵaiche nasyo akuno ku Giligali kuti ŵapelechele Ambuje Akunnungu jwenu mpela mbopesi sya kutinisya.”<verse eid="1SA 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 15:22" />Pelepo che Samweli ŵansalile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 15:22">“Ana Ambuje Akunnungu akunonyelwa kwannope ni ichichi:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 15:22">Mbopesi syakutinisya pamooto ni sya utandi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 15:22">kupunda kwitichisya liloŵe lyakwe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 15:22">Nnole, kuli kwambone kwajitichisya Ambuje kupunda kupeleka mbopesi syakutinisya</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 15:22">kuli kwambone kwapilikanila kupunda kwapelechela mbopesi sya malo gakunakana ga mikambaku ja ngondolo.<verse eid="1SA 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 15:23" />Kwagalauka Ambuje Akunnungu kuli mpela usaŵi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 15:23">ni chibuli chili mpela ugongomalo wa kuipopelela inyago.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 15:23">Pakuŵa ngakanile makanyo ga Ambuje Akunnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 15:23">nombewo aukanile umwenye wenu.”<verse eid="1SA 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 15:24" />Che Sauli ŵansalile che Samweli, “Ndesile sambi. Nagalesile malajisyo ga Ambuje Akunnungu, ni makanyo genu, ligongo naajogopaga ŵandu, nipele nagatesile gaŵagasachile ŵanyawo. <verse eid="1SA 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 15:25" />Nambo sambano ngunchondelela, muunechelesye sambi jangu. Muungunde muje pamo nomwe kuti ngaapopelele Ambuje Akunnungu.” <verse eid="1SA 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 15:26" />Che Samweli ŵajanjile, “Une ngamuja yalumo ni mmwe. Pakuŵapo mmwejo mwagakanile malamusi ga Ambuje Akunnungu, nombe nawo ankanile mmwejo nkajendelechela kuŵa mwenye jwa Ŵaisilaeli.” <verse eid="1SA 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 15:27" />Che Samweli paŵagalaukaga kuti ajaule, che Sauli ŵakamwile lujenje lwa mwinjilo wakwe, nipele lwapapwiche. <verse eid="1SA 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 15:28" />Nipele che Samweli ŵansalile che Sauli, “Kutandilila lelojino Ambuje Akunnungu ausumwile umwenye wa Ŵaisilaeli kutyoka kwa mmwejo lelo ŵaapele ŵane ŵali ŵambone kumpunda mmwejo. <verse eid="1SA 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 15:29" />Sooni Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaali ukulu wa ku Isilaeli ngasala unami namose ngaagalausya nganisyo syakwe, pakuŵapo ŵelewo nganaŵa mundu mwakwichila kugalausya nganisyo syakwe.” <verse eid="1SA 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 15:30" />Che Sauli ŵajanjile, “Ndesile sambi. Namose yeleyo choonde ngummenda munjimbichisye paujo pa ilongola ŵa ŵandu ŵangu Ŵaisilaeli. Muungunde muje pamo ni mmwe kuti ngaapopelele Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu.”<verse eid="1SA 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 15:31" />Nipele che Samweli ŵaujile yalumo ni che Sauli mpaka ku Giligali nipele che Sauli ŵaapopelele Ambuje Akunnungu. <verse eid="1SA 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 15:32" />Nipele che Samweli ŵatite, “Munnyiche nawo che Agagi mwenye jwa Ŵaamaleki.” Che Agagi ŵajawile kwa che Samweli ali nkusangalala pakuŵa ŵaganisyaga kuti, “Panepa anechelele, ngaamulajikwa.” <verse eid="1SA 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 15:33" />Che Samweli ŵatite, “Mpela muwutendele upanga wenu kwasandusya achakongwe ŵajinji kuŵa ŵangali ŵanache, iyoyo sambano achikulu ŵenu nombe tachiŵa jwangali mwanache pasikati pa achakongwe ŵane.” Ni ŵankatile che Agagi iŵaloiŵalo paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu kwele ku Giligali ko. <verse eid="1SA 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 15:34" />Nipele che Samweli ŵajawile ku Lama, ni mwenye che Sauli ŵakwesisye kuuja kumangwakwe ku Gibea ko. <verse eid="1SA 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 15:35" />Kutandilila lyuŵa lyo, che Samweli nganawonegana sooni ni che Sauli, mpaka lyuŵa liŵawile che Samweli, nachiŵamuno che Samweli ŵasupwiche ligongo li che Sauli. Ni Ambuje Akunnungu ŵalilasiche kuti ŵaasagwile che Sauli aŵe mwenye pasikati ja Ŵaisilaeli.<verse eid="1SA 15:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1SA 16" />
  <para style="s">Che Samweli akunjitilila mauta che Daudi kuti aŵe mwenye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 16:1" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵansalile che Samweli, “Ana chinjendelechele kwalilila che Sauli mpaka chakachi ni pakuŵapo une naakanile akajendelechela kuŵa mwenye jwa ŵandu ŵangu Ŵaisilaeli? Ngumbasye mauta mu nsengo wenu, nguntuma njaule ku musi wa ku Beselehemu ku che Yese. Pakuŵa nalisagulile mwenye pasikati ja achiŵanagwe.” <verse eid="1SA 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 16:2" />Nambo che Samweli ŵatite, “Tinyaule chanti uli? Apikanaga che Sauli ngani syo tachimulaga!” Ambuje Akunnungu ŵansalile, “Njigale ng'ombe jamwana pakwaula ni mwaikaga kweleko njileje, ‘Iiche kukwapelechela mbopesi ja kutinisya Ambuje Akunnungu.’ <verse eid="1SA 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 16:3" />Mwalaliche che Yese kukupeleka mbopesi ja kutinisya ko ni une tinjinnosya chakupanganya. Nomwe timunjitilile mauta pantwe pamalo pangu mundu jutinjinnosya jula.”<verse eid="1SA 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 16:4" />Che Samweli ŵatesile mpela yaasasile Ambuje Akunnungu, ni ŵajawile ku Beselehemu. Ilongola ŵa musi ŵajawile kukwachingamila ali nkutetemela, ni ŵammusisye, “Ana nnyiche kwa chitendewele?”<verse eid="1SA 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 16:5" />Che Samweli ŵajanjile, “Elo iiche kwa chitendewele, iiche kukwapelechela mbopesi ja kutinisya Ambuje Akunnungu. Nliŵiche chile kuti nkundikwe ni Akunnungu nipele tujaule kukupeleka mbopesi.” Che Samweli ŵantesile che Yese pamo ni achiŵanagwe akundikwe ni Akunnungu, nipele ŵaalaliche kuti nombe nawo apeleche mbopesi jakutinisya.<verse eid="1SA 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 16:6" />Che Yese ni achiŵanagwe paŵaiche, che Samweli paŵammweni che Eliabu, ŵalisalile muntima, “Kusyene, mundu jwasagulikwe ni Ambuje Akunnungu kuti ajitililwe mauta aŵe mwenye, ni jweleju jwajimi paujo pakwe!” <verse eid="1SA 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 16:7" />Nambo Ambuje Akunnungu ŵansalile, “Ngasinlola kusalala pane ulewu wakwe. Uneji nankanile pakuŵapo uneji ngangulola indu mpela yakuti kulola ŵandu. Ŵandu akulola usalale chapaasa nambo uneji nguilolaga yamuntima.” <verse eid="1SA 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 16:8" />Nipele che Yese ŵammilasile che Abinadabu ni kunjausya paujo pa che Samweli. Nambo che Samweli ŵatite, “Namose ajuju nganasagulikwa ni Ambuje Akunnungu.” <verse eid="1SA 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 16:9" />Che Yese ŵansalile che Shama apite paujo pa che Samweli, nambo che Samweli ŵatite “Namose ajuju nganasagulikwa ni Ambuje Akunnungu.” <verse eid="1SA 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 16:10" />Che Yese ŵaaŵilasile achiŵanagwe wose saba paujo pa che Samweli nambo che Samweli ŵansalile, “Ambuje Akunnungu nganansagula jwajulijose pasikati ja aŵaŵa.” <verse eid="1SA 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 16:11" />Pelepo che Samweli ŵammusisye che Yese, “Ana ŵanache achalume ŵankwete ali ŵeleŵa pe?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 16:11">Che Yese ŵajanjile “Apali jumo jwannondi nambo jweleju akuchinga ngondolo.” Che Samweli ŵansalile, “Muntume mundu akammilanje, uweji ngatutama paasi kulya, mpaka jwelejo aiche apano.” <verse eid="1SA 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 16:12" />Nipele che Yese ŵantumile mundu, nombejo ŵaiche najo. Jwele nchanda jo ŵaliji jwanchejewu ni ŵakwete meeso gakusalala ni uwoneche wakusalala. Ambuje Akunnungu ŵansalile che Samweli, “Sambano jwelejo ni jusyenesyene, njimuche munjitilile mauta.” <verse eid="1SA 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 16:13" />Che Samweli ŵajigele nsengo wakwe wauli ni mauta ŵanjitilile che Daudi mauta paujo pa achakulugwe. Kutandilila lyele lyuwa lyo mbumu jwa Akunnungu ŵannyichilile che Daudi kwa machili ni kutamilisya mwa jwelejo ni kwendelechela. Nipele che Samweli ŵausile ku Lama.<verse eid="1SA 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Daudi akuntumichila che Sauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 16:14" />Nipele mbumu jwa Ambuje Akunnungu ŵannesile che Sauli, ni mbumu jakusakala kutyochela kwa Ambuje Akunnungu ŵanjinjile che Sauli ni kunsausya. <verse eid="1SA 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 16:15" />Pelepo ŵakutumichila ŵa che Sauli ŵansalile kuti, “Tukuimanyilila mbumu jwakusakala kutyochela kwa Akunnungu akunsausya. <verse eid="1SA 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 16:16" />Sambano alakwe ambuje ŵetu, ntulajisye uweji ŵakutumichila ŵenu tunsosele mundu jwakumanyilila kuchigomba chingwenyengwenye, ni jwele mbumu jwakusakala kutyochela kwa Akunnungu patannyichilile, mundu jo chagombe ching'wenyeng'wenye ni mmwe chimpate eja.”<verse eid="1SA 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 16:17" />Che Sauli ŵaasalile ŵakutumichila ŵakwe, “Elo musosele jwelejo mundu jwakukombola kuchigomba ching'wenyeng'wenye yambone jo munyichisye apano.” <verse eid="1SA 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 16:18" />Jwanchanda jumo pasikati ja ŵakutumichila ŵatite, “Nammweni nchanda jumo jwa che Yese, jwa musi wa ku Beselehemu. Nchanda jo akukombola kuchityala chingwenyengwenye. Nchanda jo ali jwakukangamala ni jwakuimanyilila kuputa ngondo, akwete lunda mkuŵecheta ni sooni ali mundu jwakusalala. Ambuje Akunnungu ali pamo ni jwelejo.”<verse eid="1SA 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 16:19" />Kwayele che Sauli ŵatumile utenga ku che Yese, waukuti, “Mumbelechele che Daudi mwanagwenu jwakuchinga ngondolo.” <verse eid="1SA 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 16:20" />Che Yese ŵampeleche che Daudi ku che Sauli pamo ni mbunda jwatwichile mikate, ni nsaku wa divai ni kambusi. <verse eid="1SA 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 16:21" />Che Daudi ŵaiche kwa che Sauli ni kugatanda masengo gakwe. Che Sauli ŵannonyele kwannope mpaka ŵantesile aŵe jwakunjigalila yakumenyanilana yakwe. <verse eid="1SA 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 16:22" />Nipele che Sauli ŵatumile utenga kwa che Yese waukuti, “Nonyelwe ni che Daudi, mwaleche atame kunokuno, aandumichile.” <verse eid="1SA 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 16:23" />Kakajinji ajula mbumu jwakusakala kutyochela kwa Akunnungu paŵanyichilile che Sauli, che Daudi ŵajigalaga chingwenyengwenye chakwe ni kutanda kuchigomba, ni mbumu jo jannesile che Sauli, nombe che Sauli ŵalipikanaga eja.<verse eid="1SA 16:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="1SA 17" />
  <para style="s">Goliati akwanyosya Ŵaisilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 17:1" />Pakatemako Ŵafilisiti ŵasonganyisye mipingo jao ja ngondo ku Soko, musi wauli ku Yuda. Ŵaŵisile chigono chao pasikati ja Soko musi wauli chiwandi ni Yuda ni Aseka ku Efesi Damimu wauli pasikati ja Soko na Aseka. <verse eid="1SA 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 17:2" />Che Sauli pamo ni Ŵaisilaeli ŵasongangene ni kuŵika chigono ku chiŵata cha Ela. Ni ŵaliŵisile chile kuputana ni Ŵafilisiti. <verse eid="1SA 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 17:3" />Ŵafilisiti ŵajimi ku chikwesya, upaande umo ni ŵandu ŵa ku Isilaeli ŵajimi upaande wine, mbindikati jao kwaliji ni lichemba.<verse eid="1SA 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 17:4" />Kutyochela pa chigono cha Ŵafilisiti, ŵalikopwesye mundu jwamachili jwakuŵilanjikwa Goliati, mundu jwa musi wa ku Gati. Ŵaliji jwanlewu mita sitatu. <verse eid="1SA 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 17:5" />Muntwe mwakwe ŵawasile chisoti cha shaba, ni pantima pakwe ŵawasile chakulichika chachili ni utopele wa kilo hansini na saba. <verse eid="1SA 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 17:6" />Sooni mmakongolo ŵawasile indu yakulichinga ya shaba, mmakoyo ŵajigele mpaamba wa shaba yoyo. <verse eid="1SA 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 17:7" />Mpini wa mpaamba wakwe waliji mpela chigogo cha mundu jwakuluka nguo, ni ntwe wa mpaamba wo utopele wakwe waliji kilo saba. Chakulichinga chakwe cha pantima ŵajigalaga mundu jwine juŵanlongolelaga. <verse eid="1SA 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 17:8" />Goliati ŵajimi ni kunyokonya ni kwausya ŵangondo ŵa Chiisilaeli achitiji, “Ana nkutenda chichi kweleko? Uli nnyiche kukuputana ngondo? Uneji ndili Mfilisiti, mwanya achikapolo ŵa che Sauli. Nsagule mundu jumo pasikati jenu aiche kukuputana ni une. <verse eid="1SA 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 17:9" />Aambundaga ni kuumulaga, uweji chituŵe achikapolo ŵenu. Nambo nampundaga ni kummulaga, nipele ŵanyamwe chimme achikapolo ŵetu ni kututumichila.” <verse eid="1SA 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 17:10" />Nipele Mfilisiti jo ŵajendelechele kuŵecheta kwakuligamba achitiji, “Ngwatukana ŵangondo ŵa Chiisilaeli lelo jino, ambe mundu jumo kuti menyane najo.” <verse eid="1SA 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 17:11" />Che Sauli pamo ni ŵangondo wose ŵa ku Isilaeli paŵagapilikene maloŵe ga Mfilisiti jo ŵapwele mitima ni kogopa kwannope.<verse eid="1SA 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Daudi ku chigono chi che Sauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 17:12" />Che Daudi ŵaliji mwanache ju che Yese, mundu jwa ku Efulate ja ku Beselehemu chilambo cha ku Yuda. Che Yese ŵakwete ŵanache nane achalume pe. Katema che Sauli paŵaliji mwenye, che Yese ŵaliji ali achekulwipe kwannope, mundu jwa yaka yejinji. <verse eid="1SA 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 17:13" />Ŵanache achakulungwa ŵatatu ŵa che Yese, che Eliabu jwakwitiwo, ni che Abinadabu jwaaŵili ni che Shama jwaatatu ŵaliji apite ku ngondo ni che Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 17:14" />Che Daudi ŵaliji jwachiwango. Ŵananche achakulungwa ŵatatu ŵala ŵaliji ajawile ni che Sauli kungondo. <verse eid="1SA 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 17:15" />Nachiŵamuno che Daudi ŵajaulaga kakajinji ku che Sauli, ŵaujaga ku Beselehemu kukuchinga ngondolo sya atatigwe.<verse eid="1SA 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 17:16" />Kwa moŵa alobaini Goliati Mfilisiti jula ŵalikopwesye paujo, kundaŵi ni ligulo, ŵajimi ni kwatanda ŵangondo ŵa ŵandu ŵa ku Isilaeli ŵape mundu jwa kumenyana najo.<verse eid="1SA 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 17:17" />Lyuŵa limo, che Yese ŵansalile che Daudi mwanagwe, “Mwajauchisye achakulu ŵenu imanga yakalanga kilo kumi ni mikate kumi. Mwajauchisye chitema kuchigono chao ko. <verse eid="1SA 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 17:18" />Ajula jwankulu jwa mpingo wao wa ŵangondo elufu moja munjauchisye asi jibini kumi. Nkaalole achakulu ŵenu iŵaga akwendelechela chenene nipele kumuusalile. <verse eid="1SA 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 17:19" />Mwenye che Sauli ni achachimwene ŵenu ni ŵangondo wose ŵa ku Isilaeli ŵaliji ku lichemba lya Ela, alinkummenyana ni Ŵafilisiti.”<verse eid="1SA 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 17:20" />Kundaŵi kwakwe che Daudi ŵajimwiche kumasikusiku, ni ngondolo ŵasilesile ni jwakuchinga. Ŵajigele chakulya ni kwaula mpela yatite kulajiswa ni che Yese atatigwe. Paŵaiche kuchigono cha Ŵaisilaeli, ŵaasimene ali nkwaula kulipanga chile pamalo pao pakuputila ngondo ali nkugumila ngomo sya ngondo. <verse eid="1SA 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 17:21" />Ŵangondo ŵa Chiisilaeli ni ŵa Chifilisiti ŵaliji nkulipanga pa misitali jao mwakulolegana. <verse eid="1SA 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 17:22" />Che Daudi ŵaiŵisile yakulya ila piŵaliji mundu jwakulolela ndundu, ni ŵautuchile kujaliji misitali wa ŵangondo ŵa Chiislaeli ku kwakomasya achachimwene wakwe. <verse eid="1SA 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 17:23" />Paŵaliji nkukungulula nawo, Goliati ajula Mfilisiti jwakwete machili kutyochela ku Gati ŵalikopwesye paujo pa misitali jakwe ni kuŵecheta maloŵe galagala nti iŵatite kusyoŵelela. Nombe che Daudi ŵampilikane.<verse eid="1SA 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 17:24" />Ŵaisilaeli paŵammweni Goliati, ŵapwilinge ni kuutuka ni kwajogopa kwannope. <verse eid="1SA 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 17:25" />Nipele Ŵaisilaeli ŵatite, “Uli nkummwona mundu ju yakuti kulikoposya kakajinji? kusyene alikopwesye kwatukana Ŵaisilaeli. Mwenye che Sauli aŵechete kuti tachimpa chipanje chekulungwa mundu jutachimmulaga jweleju. Kupunda ni yeleyo mwenye tachimpa mundu jo mwanagwe jwankongwe kuti alombele. Sooni ŵandu ŵapaulongo wa atatigwe ngasalipa nsongo.”<verse eid="1SA 17:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 17:26" />Che Daudi ŵaausisye aŵala ŵaŵaliji ajimi chiŵandi nawo kuti, “Uli mundu jutammulaje Mfilisiti ju ni kwatyochesya Ŵaisilaeli soni ji chatendelwe ichichi? Aju Mfilisiti jwangaumbala ju ali nduni, mpaka ŵatukane ŵangondo ŵa Akunnungu ŵaali ŵajumi?” <verse eid="1SA 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 17:27" />Ŵandu wo ŵajanjile mpela iŵatite kunsalila kuundanda nkati mundu jutachimmulaga Goliati.<verse eid="1SA 17:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 17:28" />Nambo che Eliabu nkulugwe che Daudi paŵampilikene che Daudi ali nkukunguluka ni ŵandu ŵantumbilile kwa nnope che Daudi, ni ŵatite, “Kwachichi nnyiche akuno? Uli asila ngondolo kanandi munnechele nduni kwikonde ko? Ngwimanyilila kulyunga kwenu ni ungalumbana wenu. Nnyiche melepe njilole ngondo.”<verse eid="1SA 17:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 17:29" />Nambo che Daudi ŵajanjile, “Ana une ndesile chichi apano? Uli ngangukombola kuusya chindu?” <verse eid="1SA 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 17:30" />Che Daudi ŵangalauchile mundu jwine ni kummusya chindu chichocho, ni jwalijose juŵamusisye ŵajangaga iyoyopeyo.<verse eid="1SA 17:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 17:31" />Ŵandu ŵane ŵampilikene che Daudi iŵaŵechetaga, nipele ŵajawile kukunsalila che Sauli. Nombe che Sauli ŵalajisye aŵilanjikwe. <verse eid="1SA 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 17:32" />Che Daudi ŵansalile che Sauli, “Mundu jwalijose akajasa ntima ligongo lya aju Mfilisiti ju. Une tinyaule ngampute.” <verse eid="1SA 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 17:33" />Che Sauli ŵajanjile che Daudi, “Mmwe ngankombola kwaula kumputa Mfilisiti jula. Mmwe nli nchanda pe, nambo mundu jo aŵele nkuputana ngondo chitandilile uchanda wakwe.” <verse eid="1SA 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 17:34" />Che Daudi ŵansalile che Sauli, “Uneji jwakutumichila jwenu syoŵelele kuchinga ngondolo sya atati. Pati lisimba kapena dubu yikamwile mwanache jwangondolo, <verse eid="1SA 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 17:35" />une nguitoposya ni kuiputa ni kuipokola ngondolo mukang'wa mwakwe. Iŵaga lisimba lyo pane dubu ikung'uluchila, une nguikamula palukosi ni kuigwisya pasi ni kuiulaga. <verse eid="1SA 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 17:36" />Une jwakutumichila jwenu uleje masimba gamajinji ni dubu syejinji. Sambano namose ajula Mfilisiti jwangammanyilila Akunnungu jwaatukene ŵangondo ŵa Akunnungu ŵajumi, chaŵe mpela ŵawowo. <verse eid="1SA 17:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 17:37" />Ambuje Akunnungu juŵangulupwisye ni masimba ni madubu taachingulupusya ni aju Mfilisiti ju.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 17:37">Che Sauli ŵansalile, “Njaule, ni Ambuje Akunnungu aŵeje pamo ni mmwe.” <verse eid="1SA 17:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 17:38" />Che Sauli ŵammwasisye che Daudi yakuwala yakwe yapangondo, ŵammwasisye chisoti chakwe cha shaba ni chakulichinga chakwe cha pantima cha shaba. <verse eid="1SA 17:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 17:39" />Che Daudi ŵalitaŵilile lipanga li che Sauli mu chiunu, ŵalinjile kwenda nambo ŵalepele ligongo nganaisyoŵelela yakuwala yo. Ni ŵansalile che Sauli, “Uneji ngangukombola kwaula ku ngondo ndili mwasile yakuwala yi, pakuŵa uneji nganinaisyoŵelela.” Kwayele, ŵaiusile. <verse eid="1SA 17:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 17:40" />Che Daudi ŵajigele lubokola lwakwe mmakono, ŵasagwile maganga nsano gambone kutyochela mu kasulo, ŵagaŵisile mu nsaku wakwe wa jwakuchinga. Linati lyakwe lili chile mmakono mwakwe, ŵatandite kunjaula Goliati Mfilisiti jula.<verse eid="1SA 17:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Daudi akummulaga Goliati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 17:41" />Mfilisiti jula nombe ŵatandite kwasejelela che Daudi, ni ajula mundu juŵanjigalilaga chindu chakulichinga ali paujo pakwe. <verse eid="1SA 17:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 17:42" />Mfilisiti jula paŵalolechesye ni kwawona che Daudi yambone, ŵannyosisye, pakuŵapo che Daudi ŵaliji nchandape, jwanchejewu ni sooni jwakusala. <verse eid="1SA 17:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1SA 17:43" />Goliati ŵammusisye che Daudi, “Sambano lubokola lo lwachichi? Ana nkuganisya kuti une ndili mmbwa pakwikaga ni lubokola?” Goliati Mfilisiti jula ŵatandite kujiŵilanga minungu jakwe kuti jaaulaje che Daudi. <verse eid="1SA 17:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1SA 17:44" />Goliati Mfilisiti jula ŵansalile che Daudi, “Njise akuno! Chiilu chenu tinaipe ijuni yamwinani ni inyama yamwitinji!”<verse eid="1SA 17:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="1SA 17:45" />Nambo che Daudi ŵansalile Goliati Mfilisiti jula, “Mmwe nkuunyichilila ni lipanga ni mpaamba ni chimaje. Nambo une ngunnyichilila kwa liina lya Ambuje Akunnungu ŵa ukombole, Akunnungu jwa mipingo ja ŵangondo ŵa Chiisilaeli umwatukene mmwejo. <verse eid="1SA 17:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1SA 17:46" />Lelo jino, Ambuje Akunnungu tandende nampunde. Tinangwisye paasi tinankate ntwe wenu ni iilu ya ŵangondo ŵa Chifilisiti tinaipe ijuni yamwinani ni inyama yamwitinji. Pelepo chilambo chose tichimanyilile kuti Akunnungu apali ku Isilaeli. <verse eid="1SA 17:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1SA 17:47" />Ŵandu wose ŵaŵasongangene pelepa lelo, taimanyilile kuti Ambuje Akunnungu ngakukulupusya ŵandu ni mapanga atamuno mpaamba. Jeleji jili ngondo ja Ambuje Akunnungu, ni ŵelewo chatutende tumpunde ŵanyamwe wose.”<verse eid="1SA 17:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="1SA 17:48" />Goliati ŵatandite sooni kunjaulila che Daudi. Che Daudi ŵautwiche mwakwanguya kwaula ku msitali wa ngondo ula akaputane ni Goliati. <verse eid="1SA 17:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1SA 17:49" />Che Daudi ŵajinjisye nkono wake munsaku ni kukoposya liganga, ŵaliponyisye ni linati lyakwe ni kumputa nalyo Goliati pausyo. Liganga lyo lyajinjile muntwe mpaka Goliati ŵagwile pasi manguku. <verse eid="1SA 17:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1SA 17:50" />Yeleyo ni iŵatite che Daudi kumpunda Goliati ni linati lyakwe ni liganga ali jwangali lipanga mmakono mwakwe. Ŵamputile Goliati Mfilisiti jula ni kummulaga. <verse eid="1SA 17:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1SA 17:51" />Nipele che Daudi ŵautwiche ni kwima penani pa chiilu cha Goliati, ŵasolomwele lipanga lya Goliati mwigonelo mwakwe, nipele ŵakatile ntwe wakwe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 17:51">Ŵafilisiti paŵaiweni kuti jwangondo jwawo jwamachili pangondo awile, ŵautwiche. <verse eid="1SA 17:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1SA 17:52" />Pelepo ŵandu ŵa ku Isilaeli ni ŵandu ŵa ku Yuda ŵanyakwiche ni kwaula chammbujo achigumilanga. Ŵaakuilisye Ŵafilisiti mpaka ku Gati, ni mpaka pannango wekulungwa wakwinjilila ku Ekiloni. Iilu ya Ŵafilisiti ŵaŵaulajikwe yajenele mu litala kutandilila ku Shaalimu mpaka ku Gati ni ku Ekiloni. <verse eid="1SA 17:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1SA 17:53" />Paŵausile Ŵaisilaeli kutyochela kukwatopola Ŵafilisiti wo, ŵajigele kila chindu chichaliji mu chigono cha Ŵafilisiti mula. <verse eid="1SA 17:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1SA 17:54" />Che Daudi ŵaujigele ntwe wa Goliati ula ni kwaula nawo ku Yelusalemu, nambo yakumenyanila yapangondo ya Goliati ŵaiŵisile mu lisakasa lyakwe nsyene.<verse eid="1SA 17:54" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Daudi akwauswa kwa che Sauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="1SA 17:55" />Che Sauli paŵammweni che Daudi ali nkwaula kumenyana ni Mfilisiti Goliati jula, ŵammusisye che Abuneli, jwankulu jwa ŵangondo ŵakwe kuti, “Ana mmwe che Abuneli, nchanda ju mwanache jwaacheni?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 17:55">Che Abuneli ŵajanjile kuti, “Mwenye, kusyene, ni une ngangumanyilila.”<verse eid="1SA 17:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="1SA 17:56" />Mwenye che Sauli ŵatite, “Njaule nkausyeusye kuti jwele jwanchanda ju jwaacheni.”<verse eid="1SA 17:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="1SA 17:57" />Papopo che Daudi paŵausile pachigono pakumala kummulaga Mfilisiti Goliati, che Abuneli ŵanjigele ni kunjausya kwa che Sauli. Kele katema ko che Daudi ŵaliji chiŵela ajigele ntwe wa Goliati Mfilisiti mmakono mwakwe. <verse eid="1SA 17:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="1SA 17:58" />Che Sauli ŵammusisye che Daudi, “Ana mmwe nchanda, mmwe mwanache jwaacheni?” Che Daudi ŵajanjile, “Uneji ndili mwanache jwa jwakutumichila jwenu che Yese, kutyochela musi wa ku Beselehemu.”<verse eid="1SA 17:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="1SA 18" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 18:1" />Pakumala che Daudi kukunguluka ni che Sauli, che Yonasani mwanagwe che Sauli ŵanonyelwe nnope ni che Daudi, ni ŵannonyele kwa ntima wao wose nti yakuti kulinonyela nsyene. <verse eid="1SA 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 18:2" />Kutandilila lyuŵa lyo, che Sauli ŵanjigele che Daudi kumangwakwe, nganakunda kuti auje kwa atatigwe. <verse eid="1SA 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 18:3" />Pakuŵa che Yonasani ŵannonyele che Daudi nti yakuti kulinonyela nsyene, ŵatesile lilangano nawo. <verse eid="1SA 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 18:4" />Che Yonasani ŵausile mwinjilo uŵawasile ni kwapa che Daudi pamo ni yakuwala yakwe ya pangondo. Sooni ŵampele yakumenyanilana yakwe ya pangondo pamo ni lipanga ni mpaamba ni mkaanda wakwe. <verse eid="1SA 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 18:5" />Kwakulikose kuŵantumile ni che Sauli, che Daudi ŵaapundile ŵammagongo ŵakwe. Kwayele, che Sauli ŵantesile aŵe chilongola jwa mpingo wakwe wa ngondo. Chele chindu cho chaasengwasisye ŵandu wose namose ŵakutumichila ŵa che Sauli nombe.<verse eid="1SA 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Sauli akuntendela litima che Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 18:6" />Ŵangondo paŵaujaga kumusi, pamo ni che Daudi, pakumala kummulaga Mfilisiti jula, achakongwe kutyochela kila musi mu Isilaeli ŵatyosile kukunchingamila mwenye che Sauli. Achakongwe wo ŵaliji nkwimba nyiimbo sya sangalala ali nkugomba tugoma twamwana ni ing'wenyeng'wenye. <verse eid="1SA 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 18:7" />Sooni ŵaliji nkutyala ni kwimba nyiimbo syakuitichisyana yelei:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 18:7">“Che Sauli auleje ŵandu maelufu gakwe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 18:7">ni che Daudi auleje ŵandu makumi elufu gakwe.”<verse eid="1SA 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 18:8" />Che Sauli ngananonyelwa ni maloŵe gagali mu lujimbo lu, kwayele ŵatumbile kwannope. Ni ŵatite, “Ampele che Daudi makumi elufu nambo une ambele maelufu pe. Chachisigalile kuli kwapa che Daudi umwenye.” <verse eid="1SA 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 18:9" />Kutandilila lyuŵa lila ni kwendelechela che Sauli ŵaliji nkwakolela wiu che Daudi.<verse eid="1SA 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 18:10" />Kundaŵi kwakwe mbumu jwakusakala kutyochela kwa Akunnungu ŵanjinjile che Sauli kwa machili, ni ŵaliji nkuŵechetaŵecheta mu nyuumba mwakwe nti mundu jwakwete masoka. Katema ko che Daudi ŵaliji nkugomba ching'wenyeng'wenye nti moŵa gose. Che Sauli ŵakamulile mpamba, <verse eid="1SA 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 18:11" />nipele, chisisimuchile che Sauli ŵamponyisye che Daudi mpaamba kaŵili pakuŵa ŵaganisyaga kuti, “Tinansome ni mpaamba wu asigalile pa lipupa po.” Nambo che Daudi wakwepile kaŵili kosepe.<verse eid="1SA 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 18:12" />Che Sauli ŵanjogwepe che Daudi pakuŵa Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaliji pamo najo, nambo Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaliji annesile che Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 18:13" />Kwayele, che Sauli ŵantyosisye che Daudi paujo pakwe ni kuntenda aŵe chilongola jwa mpingo wa ŵangondo elufu moja. Nombe che Daudi ŵaalongwesye yambone ŵangondo wo ku ngondo. <verse eid="1SA 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 18:14" />Che Daudi yaajendele chenene kila chindu chatesile, pakuŵa Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaliji pamo najo. <verse eid="1SA 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 18:15" />Che Sauli paŵaiweni kuti che Daudi ŵaliji nkupunda katema kose ku ngondo, ŵapundile kunjogopa kwannope. <verse eid="1SA 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 18:16" />Nambo ŵandu wose ŵa ku Isilaeli ni ku Yuda ŵannonyele che Daudi, pakuŵapo ŵaalongwesye yambone pa ngondo.<verse eid="1SA 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Daudi akulombela mwali jwa che Sauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 18:17" />Nipele che Sauli ŵansalile che Daudi kuti, “Ajwapa mwali jwangu jwankulungwa che Melabu. Tinampe nlombele iŵaga timundumichile mpela jwangondo jwangu jwakulimba ntima ni jwakukulupilichika pakuputa ngondo sya Ambuje Akunnungu.” Che Sauli ŵatendaga yeleyo pakuganisya mu ntima mwakwe kuti Ŵafilisiti ni ŵatakammulaje che Daudi ngaŵaga che Sauli nsyene.<verse eid="1SA 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 18:18" />Che Daudi ŵansalile che Sauli, “Uneji nduni kwampaka me nkwegwe jwawo mwenye? Ntundu wangu namose ulongo wa atati ŵangu ngaikumanyika pa Isilaeli.” <verse eid="1SA 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 18:19" />Nambo pilyaiche lyuŵa lyakuti che Daudi alombele che Melabu, che Sauli atatigwe mwali jo ŵampeleche kwa mundu jwine liina lyakwe che Adiliyeli jwa musi wa ku Mehola aŵe ŵankwakwe.<verse eid="1SA 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 18:20" />Nambo che Mikali mwali jwine jwa che Sauli ŵannonyelaga che Daudi. Che Sauli paŵasalilwe ngani jo ŵasangalele kwannope. <verse eid="1SA 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 18:21" />Ŵaganisisye kuti, “Tinampe che Daudi aŵe ŵankwakwe, pelepo mwali jwangu ju tachiŵa mpela chitanje kwa jwelejo, nipele Ŵafilisiti tachimmulaga.” Kwayele che Sauli ŵansalile che Daudi kaaŵili, “Sambano nkwete lipesa liine lyakuti mme akwegwangu.” <verse eid="1SA 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 18:22" />Pelepo che Sauli ŵaalajisye ŵakutumichila ŵakwe achitiji, “Nkunguluche ni che Daudi pachisyepela ni kunsalila kuti, ‘Mwenye akunnonyela mmwejo, atamuno ŵakutumichila ŵakwe akunnonyela kwa yele mkunde kuti mme nkwegwe jwawo mwenye.’”<verse eid="1SA 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 18:23" />Nipele ŵakutumichila ŵa che Sauli wo ŵansalile che Daudi gele maloŵe go pachisyepela, nombe che Daudi ŵaasalile, “Uneji ndili mundu jwakulaga ni sooni jwangamayika kose. Uli, nkuganisya kuti chili chindu changalema une kuŵa nkwegwe jwa mwenye?”<verse eid="1SA 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 18:24" />Ŵakutumichila ŵala ŵansalile che Sauli nti iŵatite pakusala che Daudi. <verse eid="1SA 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 18:25" />Che Sauli ŵaasalile, “Munsalile che Daudi yeleyi: ‘Mwenye ngakusaka chindu chachili chose chakuti chiŵe mahali ga kulombela mwali jwakwe ikaŵe misumbu mia moja ja Ŵafilisiti kuti aliuchisye kwa ŵammagongo ŵakwe.’ ” Mwelemu ni muŵaganisyaga che Sauli kuti che Daudi aulajikwe ni Ŵafilisiti. <verse eid="1SA 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 18:26" />Ŵakutumichila ŵala paŵansalile che Daudi indu iŵasakaga che Sauli, che Daudi ŵasangalele kuti aŵe nkwegwe jwa mwenye. Kwa yele lyuŵa lya kwichisya mahali likanaiche, <verse eid="1SA 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 18:27" />che Daudi ni ŵandu ŵakwe ŵajawile, ŵaauleje Ŵafilisiti mia mbili ni kujijigala misumbu jao mpaka kwa mwenye che Sauli. Pelepo ŵajiŵalasile josepe kuti jwalakwe jo aŵe nkwegwe jwawo mwenye. Kwayele che Sauli ŵannombekasisye che Mikali mwalijwao kuti aŵe ŵankwakwe che Daudi.<verse eid="1SA 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 18:28" />Nambo che Sauli paŵaiweni kuti Ambuje Akunnungu ali pamo ni che Daudi, ni kuti che Mikali mwali jwakwe akunnonyela che Daudi jo, <verse eid="1SA 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 18:29" />ŵapundile kunjogopa nnope che Daudi, nipele ŵasandwiche mmagongo jwakwe umi wao wosepe.<verse eid="1SA 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 18:30" />Achakulu ŵa ŵangondo ŵa Ŵafilisiti ŵajendelechele kuputana ngondo ni Ŵaisilaeli, nambo ndaŵi syosepe siŵaikaga kukuputana, che Daudi ŵaliji nkupunda kwa nnope mu ngondo syose kwapunda achakulu wose ŵa ngondo ŵa che Sauli. Kwayele liina li che Daudi lyapikaniche nnope.<verse eid="1SA 18:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="1SA 19" />
  <para style="s">Che Sauli akulinga kumbulaga che Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 19:1" />Che Sauli ŵansalile che Yonasani mwanagwe ni achakulu ŵa ngondo ŵakwe wose kuti ambulaje che Daudi. Nambo che Yonasani mwanagwe che Sauli ŵannonyele kwannope che Daudi. <verse eid="1SA 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 19:2" />Kwayele che Yonasani ŵansalile che Daudi, “Atati ŵangu akusosa itajile kummulaga, kwayele nlilolechesye. Malaŵi kundaŵi njaule pamalo pakusisika pala, nkalijuŵe pelepo. <verse eid="1SA 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 19:3" />Une tiiche ni atati ŵangu ku ngunda ko ni kwima chiŵandi ni patinkalijuŵe po. Tingunguluche nawo nkati mmwe, ni une tinansalile chilichose chitinjichipikana.”<verse eid="1SA 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 19:4" />Che Yonasani ŵanlapile che Daudi paujo pa atatigwe, achitiji, “Nkaatendela chachilichose chakusakala jwakutumichila jwenu che Daudi, pakuŵapo jwelejo ngantendelela chachilichose changalumbana, yanayose yatesile inkamuchisye mmwejo kwannope. <verse eid="1SA 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 19:5" />Paŵammuleje ajula Mfilisiti Goliati jula, ŵautasile umi wakwe mu chakogoya, nombe Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaapele Ŵaisilaeli kupunda kwakukulungwa. Ni mmwe mwasangalele pimwaiweni yeleyo. Sambano ligongo chichi nkusaka kutenda sambi kwa kummulaga che Daudi mundu jwangali ni chileŵo.”<verse eid="1SA 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 19:6" />Che Sauli ŵampilikanile che Yonasani, nipele ŵalumbilile achitiji, “Ngulumbila kwa Ambuje Akunnungu ŵajumi, ngasinammulaga che Daudi.” <verse eid="1SA 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 19:7" />Nipele che Yonasani ŵammilasile che Daudi ni kunsalila yanayose yo. Che Yonasani ŵanjawisye che Daudi ku che Sauli ni che Daudi ŵantumichele che Sauli mpela iyatiji kuundada po.<verse eid="1SA 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 19:8" />Kanyuma kwaliji ni ngondo sooni pasikati ja Ŵafilisiti ni Ŵaisilaeli. Che Daudi ŵatyosile kuputana ni Ŵafilisiti, ŵaauleje Ŵafilisiti ŵajinji ni ŵaŵasigalile ŵautwiche paujo pao. <verse eid="1SA 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 19:9" />Nambo mbumu jwangalumbana kutyochela kwa Ambuje Akunnungu ŵannyichilile che Sauli paŵaliji atemi kumangwakwe ali akamulile mmakono mpamba, katema che Daudi paŵagombaga ching'wenyeng'wenye. <verse eid="1SA 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 19:10" />Che Sauli ŵalinjile kuntwinyichisya che Daudi mulikumba ni mpaamba wo, nambo che Daudi ŵasyembile nipele mpaamba wo wasomile mwikumba. Chilo chichocho che Daudi ŵautwiche ni ŵatolweche pelepo.<verse eid="1SA 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 19:11" />Chilo chichocho che Sauli ŵaatumile ŵandu kunyuumba ku che Daudi akaalole iŵaga ali kweleko kuti ŵaaulaje kundaŵi. Nambo che Mikali ŵankwakwe che Daudi ŵansalile che Daudi, “Iŵaga ngammutuka kuukulupusya umi wenu chilo chino, malaŵi timmulajikwe.” <verse eid="1SA 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 19:12" />Nipele che Mikali ŵantulwisye che Daudi pedilisha, nombe che Daudi ŵatyosile ni kuutuka. <verse eid="1SA 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 19:13" />Che Mikali ŵachijigele chinyago, ŵachiŵisile pachindanda ni kuntwe ŵaŵisile nsamilo wa manyunya ga mbusi. Nipele ŵachiunichile ni nguo. <verse eid="1SA 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 19:14" />Che Sauli paŵaatumile ŵandu kunkamula che Daudi, che Mikali ŵaasalile kuti, “Che Daudi ali jwakulwala.” <verse eid="1SA 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 19:15" />Nipele che Sauli ŵaatumile auje sooni kweleko, ŵaalajisye achitiji, “Munyichisye che Daudi kukwangu nachiŵamuno ali pachindanda kuti naaulaje.” <verse eid="1SA 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 19:16" />Ŵandu ŵala paŵajinjile mu nyuumba ji che Daudi ni kuchilola chindanda, ŵaiweni kwana chinyago ni nsamilo wamanyunya ga mbusi kuntwe. <verse eid="1SA 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 19:17" />Nipele che Sauli ŵammusisye che Mikali kuti, “Kwachichi muunambisye kwanti nnyi? Munnesile jwammagongo jwangu atoloche?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 19:17">Nombe che Mikali ŵajanjile che Sauli kuti “Che Daudi ŵaasalile kuti ‘Muuneche nyaule ngaakaŵa tinammulaje.’”<verse eid="1SA 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 19:18" />Che Daudi paŵatolweche, ŵajawile ku Lama ku che Samweli. Ŵansalile che Samweli indu yose iŵantendele che Sauli. Nipele che Daudi ni che Samweli ŵajawile kutama musi wa ku Nayoti. <verse eid="1SA 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 19:19" />Kanyuma che Sauli ŵasalilwe kuti che Daudi ali musi wa ku Nayoti kwele ku Lama ko. <verse eid="1SA 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 19:20" />Kwayele che Sauli ŵaatumile ŵandu akaakamule che Daudi. Nambo paŵausimene mpingo wa ŵakulondola ŵa Akunnungu ali nkulondola ni che Samweli ali nkwalongosya, mbumu jwa Akunnungu ŵaaichilile aŵala ŵakutumichila ŵa che Sauli, nombe nawo ŵatandite kulondola. <verse eid="1SA 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 19:21" />Che Sauli paŵasalilwe ngani syo, ŵaatumile ŵakutumichila ŵane, nombe nawo ŵatandite kulondola. Che Sauli paŵaatumile ŵakutumichila ŵane kaatatu, nombe nawo ŵatandite kulondola. <verse eid="1SA 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 19:22" />Pelepo che Sauli nsyene jo ŵajawile ku Lama. Paŵaiche ku chisima chekulungwa chachili kwele ku Seku, ŵansimene mundu jumpepe juŵammusisye, “Che Samweli ni che Daudi ali kwapi?” Jwelejo mundu jo ŵajanjile, “Ali ku Nayoti, kwele ku Lama ko.” <verse eid="1SA 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 19:23" />Nombe che Sauli ŵajawile ku Nayoti musi wa ku Lama. Paŵaiche kweleko, mbumu jwa Akunnungu ŵannyichilile, nombewo ŵatandite kulondola ali mwitala mpaka paŵaiche ku Nayoti musi wa ku Lama.<verse eid="1SA 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 19:24" />Che Sauli ŵausile yakuwala yakwe ni ŵaliji nkulondola paujo pa che Samweli. Ŵasigalile matakope lyuŵa lyansima, muusi ni chilo. Lyele ni ligongo ŵandu ŵatandite kuliusya, “Uli, che Sauli nombe aŵele jumo mwa ŵakulondola?”<verse eid="1SA 19:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="1SA 20" />
  <para style="s">Che Yonasani akunkamuchisya che Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 20:1" />Nipele che Daudi ŵatyosile musi wa ku Nayoti kwele ku Lama kwa kuutuka, ŵanjaulile che Yonasani ni kummusya kuti, “Ana ndesile ichichi? Neŵile ichichi? Ana atati ŵenu naaleŵele kwantiuli mwakuichila kusaka kuumulaga?” <verse eid="1SA 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 20:2" />Che Yonasani ŵajanjile, “Ngammulajikwa! Atati ŵangu ngaatenda chindu chilichose, chiŵeje chachikulungwa pane chamwanamwana, pangaasalila. Namose chele chindu chi ngaakombola kuusisa. Ngaiŵa yeleyo namose kanandi.”<verse eid="1SA 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 20:3" />Nambo che Daudi ŵalumbile achitiji, “Kusyene atati ŵenu akwimanyilila chenene inkuti kuunonyela, ni akuganichisya kunsisa chindu chi kuti pachaipanganye po nkasupuka. Nambo kwailiyose ila, ngulumbila kwa Ambuje Akunnungu ŵajumi, ni kwa mmwe, kuti ngukombola kuulajikwa katema kalikose.” <verse eid="1SA 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 20:4" />Che Yonasani ŵansalile che Daudi, “Chilichose chinkusaka nampanganyichisye, chiimbanganye.”<verse eid="1SA 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 20:5" />Che Daudi ŵansalile, “Malaŵi kwana chindimba chakuwone mwesi, ni une ngusachikwa kwika kulya pamo ni mwenye. Nambo mungunde kuti ngalijuŵe kwitinji mpaka ntoondo ligulo. <verse eid="1SA 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 20:6" />Atati ŵenu iŵaga ngasamona pachakulya, amuchilichisyaga, nipele mwasalile kuti ‘Che Daudi anganganichisye kuti naakunde ajaule kumangwawo ku Beselehemu, pakuŵa jiŵele ndaŵi jakupeleka mbopesi jakutinisya kweleko pamo ni ulongo wakwe wose nti yakuti kutenda kila chaka.’ <verse eid="1SA 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 20:7" />Iŵaga tajile kuti, ‘Atesile yambone,’ nipele mmanyilileje kuti une jwakutumichila jwenu ndili salama. Nambo iŵaga chatumbile, mmanyilile kuti akwete nningwa wakuumulaga. <verse eid="1SA 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 20:8" />Kwayele muundendele ukoto ntima uneji jwakutumichila jwenu, pakuŵapo mmwejo mwatesile lilangano ni une paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu. Nambo iŵaga ndesile chileŵo, nipele muumulaje mmwe mwasyene, nkaambeleka kwa atati ŵenu kuti amulaje?”<verse eid="1SA 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 20:9" />Che Yonasani ŵansalile, “Ngaŵa yeleyo! Ngaimanyilile namose chindu chamwana, kuti atati ŵangu akuganichisya yangalumbana nkati mmwe, ngangansise.” <verse eid="1SA 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 20:10" />Che Daudi ŵammusisye, “Tinaimanyilile chinauli iŵaga atati ŵenu tanjanje mwachikali?”<verse eid="1SA 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 20:11" />Che Yonasani ŵajanjile, “Njise tujaule kumigunda!” Nipele ŵajawile. <verse eid="1SA 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 20:12" />Che Yonasani ŵansalile che Daudi kuti, “Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu jwa ku Isilaeli, aŵeje jwaumboni jwetu. Malaŵi pane ntoondo katema nti akano tinaausye atati ŵangu. Iŵaga nganisyo syao pa mmwejo sili syambone tinjintumichisya utenga. <verse eid="1SA 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 20:13" />Ambuje Akunnungu aandendele kwa chikali iŵaga che Sauli akulapilila kummulaga, ni une pangansalila kuti mmutuchile kwakutalika kuti mme salama. Ambuje Akunnungu aŵeje pamo ni mmwe mpela iŵaliji ni atati ŵangu. <verse eid="1SA 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 20:14" />Iŵaga tinyendelechele kuŵa jwanjumi muunosye aula ukoto ntima wangamala mpela wa Ambuje Akunnungu kuti ngasimwa, <verse eid="1SA 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 20:15" />sooni njendelechele kulosya ukoto ntima wangamala kwa ulongo wangu, mpaka pele Ambuje Akunnungu patachaulaga ŵammgongo ŵenu pachilambo pa.” <verse eid="1SA 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 20:16" />Nipele che Yonasani ŵatesile lilangano ni ŵapaulongo wa che Daudi achitiji, “Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaauchisye ŵammagongo ŵa che Daudi.”<verse eid="1SA 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 20:17" />Che Yonasani ŵanlumbisye sooni che Daudi kuti tajendelechele kunnonyela, pakuŵa che Yonasani ŵannonyele che Daudi mpela muŵalinonyelaga nsyene. <verse eid="1SA 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 20:18" />Nipele che Yonasani ŵansalile che Daudi, “Pakuŵa malaŵi chili chindimba chakuwoneka mwesi, ŵandu chaiwone kuti nganimpagwa, ligongo chitengu chenu tichiŵe pangali mundu. <verse eid="1SA 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 20:19" />Ntondo ligulo njauleje pamalo pamwalijuŵile katema pagatandite maasauko ga, nkalindilile kunyuma kwa liganga lyalikuŵilanjikwa Eseli. <verse eid="1SA 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 20:20" />Uneji tinjiponya imaje itatu pambali mpela nguloonda chindu. <verse eid="1SA 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 20:21" />Nipele tinjimtuma jwakutumichila jwangu ajaule akasose mipamba jo. Nansalilaga kuti, ‘Nnole, imaje yo ili au upande wenu wu, nlokoteje,’ yeleyo malumbo gakwe nikuti nli salama, nomwe tinlikoposye pakulanguka pakuŵa ngulumbila kwa Ambuje Akunnungu ŵajumi kuti time salama. <verse eid="1SA 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 20:22" />Nambo nansalilaga nchanda jula kuti, ‘Nnole imaje ili paujo penu,’ pelepo ntyoche pakuŵa Ambuje Akunnungu asachileje kuti njaule kwakutalika. <verse eid="1SA 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 20:23" />Malinga ni malangano gatuŵichilene, mkumbuchile kuti Ambuje Akunnungu ali jwaumboni pasikati jetu moŵa gose pangali mbesi.”<verse eid="1SA 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 20:24" />Nipele, che Daudi ŵalijuŵile kumigunda. Katema ka chindimba cha kuwoneka mwesi, mwenye che Sauli ŵatemi kulya. <verse eid="1SA 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 20:25" />Nti yaitite kuŵa masyoŵelelo mwenye ŵatemi pachitengu chakwe chichaliji chiŵandi ni likumba. Che Yonasani ŵatemi kulolegana ni mwenye ni che Abuneli ŵatemi chiŵandi ni mwenye. Nambo pamalo pakutamaga che Daudi paliji pangali mundu. <verse eid="1SA 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 20:26" />Lyuŵa lyo, che Sauli nganaŵecheta chilichose, pakuŵa ŵaganisisye kuti pane che Daudi asimene ni chindu chachikwatenda akakukundikwa kwa kwapopelela Akunnungu mwakuti aiche pa chindimba po. <verse eid="1SA 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 20:27" />Palyuŵa lyaaŵili, pakumala chindimba chakuwoneka mwesi, chitendu chi che Daudi chaliji pangali mundu sooni. Nipele che Sauli ŵammusisye che Yonasani mwanagwe, “Kwachichi che Daudi mwanache ju che Yese, nganaika ku chakulya, liiso ni leloji?” <verse eid="1SA 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 20:28" />Che Yonasani ŵajanjile, “Ŵaanjondelele kwannope kuti naakunde ajaule ku Beselehemu. <verse eid="1SA 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 20:29" />Ŵaasalile kuti ‘Mungunde nyaule kwa achalongo achinjangu, pakuŵapo akupeleka mbopesi sya kutinisya ku musi wetu ko, ni achimwene jŵangu asachileje kuti ngaŵe nawo kweleko. Pakuŵa ngusachilwa kwaula mungunde nyaule kwa achalongo achinjangu.’ Lyelelyo ni ligongo nganapagwa pelepa kulya chakulya cha mwenye.”<verse eid="1SA 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 20:30" />Pelepo che Sauli ŵantumbilile kwannope che Yonasani, ni ŵansalile “Ugwe nchanda ndi mpela achikulu ŵenu, jwangajitichisya ni jwangalumbana kwa chachili chose! Naimanyi kuti nli upaande wa mwanache jwa che Yese ni nkulitesya soni mwasyene ni kwatesya soni achikulu ŵenu ŵammeleche! <verse eid="1SA 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 20:31" />Uli, ngankuimanyilila kuti che Daudi aŵaga jwanjumi, mmwe ngankombola kupata lipesa lyakuŵa mwenye jwa chilambo chi? Sambano njaule nkannyiche nawo apano, pakuŵa akusachilwa aulajikwe.” <verse eid="1SA 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 20:32" />Che Yonasani ŵajanjile, “Ligongo chichi aulajikwe? Ana atesile ichichi?” <verse eid="1SA 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 20:33" />Nambo che Sauli ŵamponyisye che Yonasani mpamba kuti ammulaje. Nombe che Yonasani ŵaimanyilile kuti atatigwe ili muntima mwakwe yakwaulaga che Daudi. <verse eid="1SA 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 20:34" />Pelepo che Yonasani akuno ali atumbile kwannope, ŵatyosile pachakulya kwachitema, pangalya chakulya chilichose pa lyuŵa lyaaŵili lya kuwoneka mwesi lyo. Che Yonasani ŵalilasiche kwannope kwa isambo ya chipongwe ya atatingwe iŵaatendelaga che Daudi.<verse eid="1SA 20:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 20:35" />Kundaŵi kwakwe che Yonasani ŵajawile ku migunda kula, kukusimana ni che Daudi mpela iŵalangene. Ŵajawile kweleko ni jwanchanda jumo, <verse eid="1SA 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 20:36" />paŵaiche kweleko che Yonasani ŵansalile nchanda jula, “Mmbutuche nyikuye imaje jitinajiponye.” Jwanchanda jula paŵaliji nkuutuka, che Yonasani ŵauponyisye mpamba chammbujo mwakwe. <verse eid="1SA 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 20:37" />Jwanchanda jula paŵaiche pamalo pachagwilile chimaje chila, che Yonasani ŵammilasile ni kunsalila, “Chimaje chili mmbujo mwenu mo. <verse eid="1SA 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 20:38" />Njanguyeje, nkajima pelepo.” Jwanchanda jula ŵasongangenye imaje ila ni kunjaulila che Yonasani. <verse eid="1SA 20:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 20:39" />Nambo jwanchanda jula nganaimanyililaga chilichose. Nkati malumbo ga chele chindu cho. Ŵaŵaimanyililaga ali che Yonasani ni che Daudi pe. <verse eid="1SA 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 20:40" />Nipele che Yonasani ŵampele jwanchanda jula yakumenyanila yakwe ni kunsalila, “Njaule, mmuje kumusi.”<verse eid="1SA 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 20:41" />Papopo nchanda jula paŵatyosile, che Daudi ŵajimwiche ni kutyoka paŵalijuŵile panyuma pa liganga lila. Ŵajineme mpaka pasi katatu kwa luchimbichimbi paujo pa che Yonasani. Wose ŵanaŵaŵili, che Daudi ni che Yonasani ŵakumbetene ni kulila. Che Daudi ni juŵalisile kwannope kupunda che Yonasani. <verse eid="1SA 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 20:42" />Pakumala pelepo che Yonasani ŵansalile che Daudi, “Njaule kwa chitendewele. Pakuŵa tulumbilile kuŵa ni uganja kwa liina lya Ambuje Akunnungu tuchitiji Ambuje Akunnungu ali jwaumboni pasikati ja mwe ni une, ni pasikati ja uŵelesi wangu ni uŵelesi wenu moŵa gose pangali mbesi.” Che Daudi ŵajimwiche ni kwaula, nombe che Yonasani ŵausile kumusi.<verse eid="1SA 20:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="1SA 21" />
  <para style="s">Che Daudi akumbutuka che Sauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 21:1" />Che Daudi ŵajawile kwa che Ahimeleki juŵaliji jwambopesi kwele ku Nobu ko. Che Ahimeleki ŵajawile kukunchingamila akuno ali nkutetemela, ni ŵammusisye, “Kwachichi nli jikape? kwa chichi nganinyika ni mundu jwine?” <verse eid="1SA 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 21:2" />Che Daudi ŵajanjile, “Nyiche jikape pakuŵa mwenye andumile naapanganyichisye chindu. Ŵaasalile kuti nganinansalila mundu jwalijose kwandi ni chindu chandumile kuchipanganya. Nangene ni ŵandu ŵangu kuti tusimane pamalo pampepe. <verse eid="1SA 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 21:3" />Uli, nkwete chakulya chilichose apano? Ngummenda muumbe mikate nsano pane chilichose chinkwete.” <verse eid="1SA 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 21:4" />Jwambopesi che Ahimeleki ŵansalile, “Pelepa nganingola nkate wakawaida. Ngwete mikate jajiŵichikwe pajika kwa ligongo lya Ambuje Akunnungu jajikulikwa ni ŵambopesi pe. Nkukombola kujigala mikate jo iŵaga ŵandu ŵenu nganagona ni achakongwe pa moŵa gagapite chiŵandi ga.” <verse eid="1SA 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 21:5" />Che Daudi ŵajanjile, “Kusyene une na achachanda ŵangu nganitugona na achiŵakwetu kwamoŵa gatatu ga, nti yatukuti kutenda patukuŵa paulendo watusyowelele. Ilu ya ŵandu ŵangu ikukundikwa kwa kwapopelela Ambuje Akunnungu moŵa gose patukuŵa paulendo, ni pa ulendo wu chindu chi chili chakusachilwa kwa nnope.” <verse eid="1SA 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 21:6" />Kwayele jwambopesi che Ahimeleki ŵampele che Daudi mikate jajiŵichikwe pajika kwaligongo lya Ambuje Akunnungu jajikulikwa ni ŵambopesi pe, pakuŵa nganipapagwa mikate jine ikaŵe jijojo jijatyochekwe paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu, ni kujiwika jine jijatyochele pachisisa.<verse eid="1SA 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 21:7" />Pa lyele lyuŵa lyo jwapali jwakutumichila jumo jwa che Sauli juŵaliji pelepo, ligongo ŵasakaga kupopelela ku nyuumba ja Ambuje Akunnungu. Jwakutumichila jo jwaŵilanjikwe che Daegi, jwakutyochela ku Edomu, jwakwimilila jwa ŵakuchinga ilango ŵa che Sauli.<verse eid="1SA 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 21:8" />Nipele, che Daudi ŵansalile che Ahimeleki, “Uli, nkwete lipanga pane mpamba kuti mumbe? Pakuŵapo masengo ga mwenye gandesile ndyoche kwakwanguya, ni une natyosile pangali lipanga atamuno yakumenyanila ine iliyose.”<verse eid="1SA 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 21:9" />Jwambopesi che Ahimeleki ŵajanjile, “Ngwete lipanga lya che Goliati Mfilisiti jumwammuleje ku lichemba lya Ela jula, lili panyuma pa chisibao cha jwambopesi, lyeŵilijilwe ni kaguo. Iŵaga nkusaka kulijigala lyelelyo, nipele njigale pakuŵa pangali lipanga line pelepa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 21:9">Che Daudi ŵansalile, “Pakuŵa pangali line lyakulandana ni lyelelyo, mumbe lilyolyo.”<verse eid="1SA 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 21:10" />Palyuŵa lyo, che Daudi ŵatyosile, ŵammutwiche che Sauli, ŵajawile kwa mwenye che Akishi jwa ku Gati. <verse eid="1SA 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 21:11" />Ŵakutumichila ŵa mwenye che Akishi ŵammusisye che Akishi jo kuti, “Ana ajuju nganaŵa che Daudi mwenye jwa chilambo ku Isilaeli? jweleju ni juŵangambaga achakongwe jula pa ndaŵi jiŵajimbaga kuti ‘Che Sauli auleje maelufu gakwe ni che Daudi auleje makumi elufu gakwe?’”<verse eid="1SA 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 21:12" />Maloŵe ga ŵakutumichila wo ganjinjile nnope che Daudi muntima, ni ŵatandite kunjogopa kwannope che Akishi mwenye jwa ku Gati. <verse eid="1SA 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 21:13" />Kwayele, ŵaligalawisye, ŵalitesile jwampungwane, paŵasachile kunkamula ŵaliji nkulembalemba pa minango ja musiwo ni lulowu luli chuluchulu mpaka kuseleleka pa ndewu syakwe.<verse eid="1SA 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 21:14" />Che Akishi ŵaasalile ŵakutumichila ŵakwe, “Nnole mundu ju ali jwampungwane. Kwachichi mkunnyichisya kukwangu? <verse eid="1SA 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 21:15" />Uli, nkuganisya kuti une ngwasaka ŵandu ŵapungwane mpaka kunyichisya mundu ju aitendekanye ayi paujo pangu? Mundu nti jweleju ngangusaka ajinjile mu nyuumba jangu?”<verse eid="1SA 21:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="1SA 22" />
  <para style="s">Che Sauli akwaulaga Ŵambopesi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 22:1" />Pakumala yeleyo, che Daudi ŵatyosile ku Gati ko, ŵatolochele ku mbugu chiŵandi ni musi wa ku Adulamu. Achachimwene ŵakwe ni achalongo ŵakwe ŵane paŵamanyilile pamalo paalijuŵile, wose ŵajawile kukwalimbisya ntima. <verse eid="1SA 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 22:2" />Ŵandu wose ŵaŵaliŵatilwaga pane juŵalionaga kuti che Daudi ŵaapanganyichisye indu yambone, pane aŵala ŵangananonyelwa ni utawala wa che Sauli, ŵalumbikene ni che Daudi. Ŵandu wose ŵaliji nti ŵandu mia nne, nombe che Daudi ŵaalongwesye.<verse eid="1SA 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 22:3" />Kutyochela kweleko, che Daudi ŵajawile mpaka ku Misipa chilambo cha ku Moabu. Ni ŵansalile mwenye jwa ku Moabu, “Ngummenda, atati ŵangu ni achikulu ŵangu aiche atameje apano kukwenu mpaka patimanyilile itachindendela Akunnungu.” <verse eid="1SA 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 22:4" />Nipele che Daudi ŵaalesile achaŵelesi ŵakwe atame ni mwenye jwa ku Moabu. Nipele ŵatemi kweleko moŵa gose che Daudi paŵaliji nkulijuŵa mu mbungu mula. <verse eid="1SA 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 22:5" />Nipele jwakulondola liina lyakwe che Gadi ŵansalile che Daudi, “Nkatama akuno, ntyoche kwakwanguya njaule ku chilambo cha ku Yuda.” Nipele che Daudi ŵatyosile, ŵajawile mu litinji lyalikuŵilanjikwa Heleti.<verse eid="1SA 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 22:6" />Pa lyuŵa limo che Sauli ŵaliji ku Gibea, ali atemi paasi pa chitela cha ukwesu, chichamesile pachikwesya ali ajigele mpamba mmakono ni ŵakutumichila ŵakwe ŵaliji ajimi pambali pakwe. Nipele ŵasalile kuti che Daudi ni ŵandu ŵakwe awoneche. <verse eid="1SA 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 22:7" />Nombe che Sauli ŵaasalile ŵakutumichila ŵakwe, “Sambano mwanya lukosyo lwa Benjamini mumbilikanile, uli nkuganisya kuti aju che Daudi mwanagwe che Yese tachimpa kila mundu migunda ni migunda ja misabibu? Pane uli nkuganisya kuti tachintenda kila mundu kuŵa jwankulu jwa mpingo wa ŵangondo elufumoja pane jwankulu jwa mpingo wa ŵangondo mia moja? <verse eid="1SA 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 22:8" />Ana lyeleli nganiliŵa ligongo lya ŵanyamwe ŵanawose kundaŵila malindi gakusaka kundyosya umwenye? Ngapagwa namose jumo jwenu juŵandanjile kuti chakachi mwanangu ŵatesile chilanga ni mwanache jwa che Yese. Nganapagwa namose jumo jwenu jwakulichenjeusya ni une atamuno kuusalila kuti mwanangu ni jwakunlimbisya ntima jwakutumichila jwangu kuti anyuŵilile kuti amulaje, mpela mwakutendela lelojino.” <verse eid="1SA 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 22:9" />Pelepo che Daegi, jwa lukosyo lwa Ŵaedomu juŵajimi chiŵandi ni achakulu ŵangondo ŵa che Sauli ŵatite “Nammweni che Daudi mwanagwe che Yese achiikaga ku Nobu kwa jwambopesi che Ahimeleki mwanagwe che Ahitubu. <verse eid="1SA 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 22:10" />Che Ahimeleki Ŵausisye Ambuje Akunnungu kwaligongo li che Daudi, ni sooni ŵampele yakula ni alila lipanga lya Goliati, Mfilisiti jula.”<verse eid="1SA 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 22:11" />Mwenye che Sauli ŵalajisye kuti jwambopesi che Ahimeleki mwanagwe che Ahitubu pamo ni ŵandu wose ŵapaulongo wa atatigwe ŵaŵaliji ŵambopesi ku Nobu ko aŵilanjikwe. Ŵanawose ŵaiche kwa mwenye che Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 22:12" />Che Sauli ŵatite, “Sambano mpilikane mmwe mwanagwe che Ahitubu.” Che Ahimeleki ŵajanjile, “Elo ambuje jwangu.” <verse eid="1SA 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 22:13" />Che Sauli ŵansalile, “Ligongo chichi mmwe ni che Daudi mwanagwe che Yese, ntesile malindi ga kuung'alauka kuti muundyosye pa chitengu cha umwenye? Kwachichi mumpele mikate ni lipanga, nombe mummendele kwa Akunnungu? Kwaligongo lyo, ang'alawiche ni akuunyuŵilila kuti amulaje mpela mwakutendela lelojno.”<verse eid="1SA 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 22:14" />Che Ahimeleki ŵajanjile, “Pasikati ja ŵakutumichila ŵenu, che Daudi ali jwakutumichila jwakukulupilichika kupunda ŵanawose. Ŵelewo ali akwegwenu mwasyene alakwe mwenye, ni ali jwankulu jwa Ŵakulindilila ŵenu mwasyene ni sooni akuchimbichikwa kupunda ŵanawose munyuumba jenu. <verse eid="1SA 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 22:15" />Lelo ngaŵa kaandanda kwa uneji kwausya Akunnungu chindu kwaligongo lyakwe. Mwenye, nkaang'anichisya yangalumbana une atamuno mundu jwine jwalijose mu ulongo wa atati ŵangu. Une jwakutumichila jwenu, nganguchimanyilila chilichose, chiŵeje chekulungwa atamuno chamwanamwana nkati kuntyosya mmwe kuti nkaŵa mwenye.”<verse eid="1SA 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 22:16" />Nambo mwenye che Sauli ŵansalile, “Che Ahimeleki, kusyene timmulajikwe, mmwe ni ŵapaulongo wose wa atati ŵenu.” <verse eid="1SA 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 22:17" />Che Sauli ŵaasalile ŵakulindilila ŵaŵajimi pambali pakwe, “Ngalauche ni kwaulaga ŵambopesi ŵa Ambuje Akunnungu, pakuŵapo ali upaande wa che Daudi. Ŵaimanyilile kuti che Daudi atuutwiche ni nganaasalila.” Nambo ŵakulindilila wo ngananyakula makono gao kuti ŵaaulaje ŵambopesi ŵa Ambuje Akunnungu. <verse eid="1SA 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 22:18" />Kwayele, mwenye che Sauli ŵansalile che Daegi, “Ngalauche mmwejo mwaulaje ŵambopesi.” Pelepo che Daegi jwa lukosyo lwa Ŵaedomu ŵagalawiche ni kwaulaga ŵambopesi wose. Palyuŵa lyo, che Daegi ŵauleje ŵambopesi semanini na tano ŵakuwala isibao ya chimbopesi ya nguo jeswela mbee. <verse eid="1SA 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 22:19" />Sooni ŵauleje ni lipanga ŵandu wose ŵakutama ku Nobu, musi wa ŵambopesi achalume ni achakongwe, ni ŵanache achanandi ni ŵakonga, ni ng'ombe ni mbunda ni ngondolo. <verse eid="1SA 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 22:20" />Nambo che Abiasali, jumo jwa ŵanache ŵachilume ŵa che Ahimeleki, mwanagwe che Ahitubu, ŵakulupwiche, ni kuutuka nipele ŵalumbikene ni che Daudi. <verse eid="1SA 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 22:21" />Che Abiasali ŵansalile che Daudi kuti che Sauli ŵaauleje ŵambopesi ŵa Ambuje Akunnungu. <verse eid="1SA 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 22:22" />Nombe che Daudi ŵansalile che Abiasali kuti, “Naimanyilile palyuŵa lila panammweni che Daegi jwa lukosyo lwa Ŵaedomu, kuti tachinsalila che Sauli. Kwayele, uneji ni junalemwesye chiwa cha ŵandu ŵa paulongo wa atati ŵenu. <verse eid="1SA 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 22:23" />Mmwe, ntame pamo ni une, nkajogopa. Pakuŵapo che Sauli jwakusaka kuumulaga une ni jujojo jwakusaka kummulaga mmwe. Mwaŵaga pamo ni une, yangalumbana yo ngainnyichilila.”<verse eid="1SA 22:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="1SA 23" />
  <para style="s">Che Daudi akwakulupusya ŵandu ŵa musi wa ku Keila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 23:1" />Pa lyuŵa limo che Daudi ŵasalilwe kuti, “Mpilikane, Ŵafilisiti akwagungumuchila ŵandu ŵa musi wa ku Keila ni akujigala yakulya ku ŵala syakuputukulila.” <verse eid="1SA 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 23:2" />Nipele, che Daudi ŵausisye Ambuje Akunnungu kuti, “Ana nyaule ngaagumuchile Ŵafilisiti ŵa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 23:2">Ambuje Akunnungu ŵajanjile “Elo, njaule nkaapute Ŵafilisiti ni kwakulupusya ŵandu ŵa musi wa ku Keila.”<verse eid="1SA 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 23:3" />Nambo ŵandu ŵa che Daudi ŵansalile kuti, “Apano pa Yuda pasyene tukogopa, chiiŵe uli, iŵaga tutujaule ku Keila ni kwagungumuchila ŵangondo ŵa Chifilisiti?” <verse eid="1SA 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 23:4" />Che Daudi ŵausisye Ambuje Akunnungu wo kaaŵili, nombe Ambuje Akunnungu ŵanjanjile, “Njaule ku Keila nkamenyane nawo pakuŵa tinjintenda mwapunde Ŵafilisiti.” <verse eid="1SA 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 23:5" />Nipele che Daudi ŵatulwiche ŵajawile ku musi wa Keila pamo ni ŵandu ŵakwe, ni kweleko ŵaaputile Ŵafilisiti, ŵauleje Ŵafilisiti ŵajinji ni kusumula ilango yao. Kwanti yeleyo che Daudi ŵaakulupwisye ŵandu ŵakutama ku Keila.<verse eid="1SA 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 23:6" />Che Abiasali mwanagwe che Ahimeleki, paŵautuchile kwa che Daudi kwele ku Keila, ŵajawile ni chisibao cha chimbopesi. <verse eid="1SA 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 23:7" />Che Sauli paŵasalilwe kuti che Daudi aiche ku Keila, ŵatite, “Akunnungu atesile yeleyo kuti naakamule che Daudi pakuŵapo alitaŵile asyene pakwinjila mmusi wauli ni lipupa ni minango jajikuugalikwa ni tumbua.” <verse eid="1SA 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 23:8" />Kwayele, che Sauli ŵaaŵilasile ŵangondo wose ajaule ku ngondo kwele ku Keila, ŵaasyungule che Daudi pamo ni ŵandu ŵakwe. <verse eid="1SA 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 23:9" />Che Daudi paŵapilikene kuti che Sauli aliŵisile chile kuti ŵaakamule, ŵansalile jwambopesi che Abiasali kuti, “Njisenawo apano chisibao cha chimbopesi cho.” <verse eid="1SA 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 23:10" />Nipele che Daudi ŵapopesile kuti, “Alakwe Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu jwa ku Isilaeli, kusyene une jwakutumichila jwenu, mbilikene yakuti che Sauli akwika kukuujonanga musi wa ku Keila kwaligongo lyangu. <verse eid="1SA 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 23:11" />Uli, ŵandu ŵakutama ku Keila taachakamuchisya che Sauli kuti aangamule? Uli che Sauli taiche kusyene mpela indite kupilikana une jwakutumichila jwenu? Alakwe Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu jwa ku Isilaeli, ngunchondelela muunyanje une jwakutumichila jwenu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 23:11">Ambuje Akunnungu ŵajanjile, “Che Sauli taiche.” <verse eid="1SA 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 23:12" />Che Daudi ŵausisye sooni, “Uli ŵandu ŵakutama ku Keila taachakamuchisya che Sauli kuti atukamule une pamo ni ŵandu ŵangu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 23:12">Ambuje Akunnungu ŵajanjile, “Tachimpeleka mmakono mwao.”<verse eid="1SA 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 23:13" />Nipele che Daudi ni ŵandu ŵakwe ŵaŵaliji mpela ŵandu mia sita, ŵatyosile ni kwaula kulikose kuŵakombwele kwaula. Che Sauli paŵapilikene kuti che Daudi autwiche kutyoka ku Keila, ŵalesile kwaula kweleko.<verse eid="1SA 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Daudi ku chilambo cha ikwesya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 23:14" />Nipele che Daudi ni ŵandu ŵakwe ŵatemi achilijuŵaga ku chilambo cha ikwesya, kuchipululu cha Sifu. Che Sauli ŵansosaga lyuŵa ni lyuŵa, nambo Akunnungu nganantenda che Sauli ankamule che Daudi. <verse eid="1SA 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 23:15" />Nipele che Daudi paŵaliji kwele ku Holeshi ku chipululu cha Sifu ŵapikene kuti che Sauli akwasosa kuti ŵaulaje. <verse eid="1SA 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 23:16" />Che Yonasani mwanagwe che Sauli ŵanjaulile che Daudi kwele ku Holeshi ko ni kunlimbisya ntima kuti Akunnungu akunlindilila. <verse eid="1SA 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 23:17" />Che Yonasani ŵansalile, “Nkajogopa, atati ŵangu che Sauli ngasankamula. Mmwe ni ŵatinchiŵa mwenye jwa ku Isilaeli, uneji tinjiŵa jwaaŵili jwenu. Namose atati ŵangu che Sauli akwimanyilila yelei.” <verse eid="1SA 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 23:18" />Wose ŵanaŵaŵili ŵatesile lilangano paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu. Che Daudi ŵasigalile ku musi wa ku Holeshi ni che Yonasani ŵajawile kumangwakwe.<verse eid="1SA 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 23:19" />Che Sauli paŵaliji chiŵela ku Gibea ko, ŵandu ŵa ku Sifu ŵansalile kuti, “Che Daudi akulisisa muchilambo mwetu, mu chipululu chachili ku musi Holeshi ko, ku chitumbi cha Hakila, chachili ku upaande wa kulujenda kwa Yeshimoni. <verse eid="1SA 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 23:20" />Sambano, alakwe mwenye, njise kuti nnyitende yaili muntima mwenu, ni kwauweji, tutunkamuchisye kuti munkamule che Daudi.”<verse eid="1SA 23:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 23:21" />Che Sauli ŵaajanjile, “Kusyene ŵanyamwe nkuungolela chanasa, Ambuje Akunnungu ampe upile. <verse eid="1SA 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 23:22" />Njaule nkalolesyelolesye, kuti mpamanyilile pamalo pakwaula kakajinji ni nduni jwammweni pamalo po. Pakuŵapo salilwe kuti jwelejo ali jwakalamuka kwannope. <verse eid="1SA 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 23:23" />Nlolesyelolesye mbande syose nsimanyilile malo syose sya kulijuŵaga, nipele mumbelechele utenga usyenesyene. Nipele tinjijaula pamo ni ŵanyamwe ni iŵaga ali chiwela kweleko, nipele une tinjinsosa pasikati ja ŵandu ŵajinji ŵa mitundu ja lukosyo lwa ku Yuda.”<verse eid="1SA 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 23:24" />Nipele ŵatyosile kwaula ku Sifu, achinlongolelaga che Sauli. Pa kele katema ko che Daudi ni ŵandu ŵakwe ŵaliji ku chipululu cha Maoni, ku Alaba yaani kuchiŵata cha lusulo lwa Yolodani kulujenda kwa Yeshimoni. <verse eid="1SA 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 23:25" />Che Sauli ni ŵandu ŵakwe ŵatandite kunsosa che Daudi. Nambo che Daudi paŵasalilwe ngani jo, ŵajawile kulijuŵa ku lwala syasili ku chipululu cha ku Maoni ni kutama kweleko. Che Sauli paŵapilikene ngani jo, ŵankuilisye che Daudi kwele ku chipululu cha Maoni. <verse eid="1SA 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 23:26" />Che Sauli ni wandu wakwe ŵaliji nkwaula upande umo wa chitumbi, ni che Daudi ni ŵandu ŵakwe ŵaliji mkwaula upande wine wa kwitumbi. Che Daudi ni wandu wakwe paŵaliji nkwanguya kwautuka, che Sauli ni wandu wakwe ŵaliji nkuŵandichila kwakamula che Daudi ni wandu wakwe. <verse eid="1SA 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 23:27" />Pelepo mundu jumo ŵanjaulile che Sauli ni kunsalila, “Njise njanguyeje, Ŵafilisiti akuchigungumuchila chilambo.” <verse eid="1SA 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 23:28" />Kwayele, che Sauli ŵalesile kwakuilisya che Daudi, ŵajawile kukumenyana ni Ŵafilisiti. Lyelelyo ni ligongo pamalo po paŵilanjikwe Sela Hamalekoti, malumbo gakwe, “Lwala lwati twakulupwiche kukamulwa ni ŵammagongo ŵetu.” <verse eid="1SA 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 23:29" />Che Daudi ŵatyosile pamalo po, ŵajawile kutama kuŵalisisile mmbugu mwa iliŵa ya ku Engedi.<verse eid="1SA 23:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="1SA 24" />
  <para style="s">Che Daudi akunneka che Sauli pangammulaga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 24:1" />Pakumala che Sauli kuuja kungondo kuŵamenyanaga ni Ŵafilisiti, ŵasalilwe kuti che Daudi ali ku chipululu cha Engedi. <verse eid="1SA 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 24:2" />Nipele che Sauli ŵaajigele ŵangondo elufu tatu ŵaŵasagwile ŵaŵaliji ŵakombola nnope kuputana mu chilambo chansima cha ku Isilaeli, ŵajawile kukwasosa che Daudi ni ŵandu ŵakwe ku lwala syasikuŵilanjikwa Mbusi sya mwitinji. <verse eid="1SA 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 24:3" />Paŵaiche chiŵandi ni machinga ga ngondolo gagaliji mungulugulu litala, paliji ni mbugu, che Sauli ŵajinjile mu mbugu mo kuti akasyetelele. Che Daudi ni ŵandu ŵakwe ŵaliji munkati mmangoningoni mwa mbugu jijojo. <verse eid="1SA 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 24:4" />Ŵandu ŵa che Daudi ŵala ŵansalile kuti, “Ali ni lyuwa lyati Ambuje Akunnungu ŵansalile kuti ‘Tinjintenda mwakamule ŵammagongo ŵenu kuti mwatende iliyose inkwisaka.’” Pelepo che Daudi ŵanjaulile che Sauli chapanyuma kwa nyakatulila, ŵakatile lujenje lwa chakuwala chi che Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 24:5" />Che Daudi ŵatandite kulilasika muntima pakuŵapo akatile lujenje lwa chakuwala chi che Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 24:6" />Nipele ŵaasalile ŵandu ŵakwe, “Ambuje Akunnungu anekasye ngasinampweteka ata kanandi mwenye jwangu jwajitililwe mauta kwa ligongo lya Ambuje Akunnungu pakuwa ali Ambuje Akunnungu ni ŵaŵansagwile aŵe mwenye.” <verse eid="1SA 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 24:7" />Kwa maloŵe go, che Daudi ŵasalile ŵandu ŵakwe ligongo lyangaulaga che Sauli. Nipele che Sauli ŵajimi, ŵakopweche mmbugu ŵajendelechele ni ulendo. <verse eid="1SA 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 24:8" />Kanyuma, che Daudi nombe ŵakopweche mmbugu ni kwaŵilanga che Sauli, “ambuje ŵangu mwenye!” Mwenye che Sauli paŵagalawiche panyuma, che Daudi ŵatindiŵele, ŵajineme mpaka paasi kwakwachimbichisya che Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 24:9" />Nipele ŵansalile, “Kwachichi nkwapilikanila ŵandu ŵakunsalila kuti, ‘Nnole che Daudi akusaka kummulaga?’ <verse eid="1SA 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 24:10" />Sambano nnole, lelo nnyiweni mwasyene kuti pamwaliji mu mbugu Ambuje Akunnungu ŵambele lipesa lyakuti nammulaje. Ŵandu ŵampepe ŵali pamo ni une ŵasalile kuti nammulaje, nambo nannesile nganinammulaga. Natite nganinambulaga ambuje jwangu pakuŵapo ŵelewo asagulikwe ni Ambuje Akunnungu aŵe mwenye kwa kwikitililwa mauta. <verse eid="1SA 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 24:11" />Alakwe atati ŵangu, nnole lujenje lu lwa mwinjilo wenu mmakono mwangu, kwa kukata lujenje lwa mwinjilo wenu pangammulasya, nkukombola sambano kwimanyilila kusyenesyene kuti unejinganinantendela sambi atamuno nganinangalauka. Uneji nganinanneŵela mmwejo nachiŵamuno mmwejo nkuusosa kuti mumulaje. <verse eid="1SA 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 24:12" />Ambuje Akunnungu alamule pasikati jetu, mmwe ni une. Ŵelewo ammuchisye yangalumbana imuundendele, nambo une ngandenda kwa mwe changalumbana chachili chose. <verse eid="1SA 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 24:13" />Nkumbuchileje chiŵecheto chachiikala chachikuti, ‘Chakusakala chikusatendekwa ni ŵandu ŵakusakala pe,’ nambo ngandenda kwa mwe changalumbana chachili chose. <verse eid="1SA 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 24:14" />Sambano mmwejo mwenye jwa ku Isilaeli, ana mundu chi junkusaka kunkamula! Uli nkunkuilisya nduni? Ana mmbwa jewe! Pane chiloboto! <verse eid="1SA 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 24:15" />Ambuje Akunnungu aŵeje jwakulamula pasikati jetu. Ŵelewo achilolechesye chigongomalo chankuundendela chi, anjenjele ni kuungulupusya ngaulajikwa ni mmwe.”<verse eid="1SA 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 24:16" />Che Daudi paŵamalisisye kuŵecheta maloŵe go, che Sauli ŵatite, “Uli, lyelelyo lili liloŵe lyenu mwanangu che Daudi?” Che Sauli ŵatandite kulila. <verse eid="1SA 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 24:17" />Nipele ŵansalile che Daudi, “Mmwejo nli mundu jwa nkutenda yakuisaka Akunnungu kuumbunda une, muundendele yambone, nambo une nantendele yakusakala. <verse eid="1SA 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 24:18" />Lelo, munosiye yantite kuwa wambone kwa uneji. Nganimumulaga nachiŵamuno Ambuje Akunnungu ŵampele lipesa lyakumulaga une. <verse eid="1SA 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 24:19" />Uli, mundu ankamulaga jwammagongo jwakwe akunneka ajaule salama? Ambuje Akunnungu ambuchisye yambone kwa ligongo lya indu imuundendele lelo. <verse eid="1SA 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 24:20" />Sambano naimanyi kusyene kuti mmwejo tinchiŵa mwenye jwa ku Isilaeli, ni chichiutenda umwenye wa ku Isilaeli uŵe wakulimbangana. <verse eid="1SA 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 24:21" />Nambo munumbilile kwa liina lya Ambuje Akunnungu kuti ngasinnyiulaga iŵelesi yangu, namose kulitenda liina lyangu liliŵalikwe pasikati pa ulongo wa atati ŵangu.” <verse eid="1SA 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 24:22" />Che Daudi ŵalumbilile kuti chaitende yose iŵaiŵendile che Sauli.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 24:22">Nipele che Sauli ŵausile kumangwawo, nambo che Daudi ni ŵandu ŵakwe ŵajawile ku malo kuŵalijuŵaga kula.<verse eid="1SA 24:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="1SA 25" />
  <para style="s">Che Samweli akwasika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 25:1" />Pakumala yeleyo che Samweli ŵawile, nipele Ŵaisilaeli wosepe ŵasongangene pamo kulila kwa malumbo malilo gakwe. Nipele ŵansichile kumangwakwe ku Lama.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="1SA 25:1">Che Abigaeli akunchondelela che Daudi akammulaga che Nabali</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 25:1">Pakumala yeleyo che Daudi ŵatyosile kwaula ku chipululu cha Palani. <verse eid="1SA 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 25:2" />Jwapali mundu jumo ku musi wa Maoni juŵakwete chipanje kwele ku Kalimeli, mundu ju ŵaliji jwakusichila kwannope. Ŵalanjile ngondolo elufu tatu ni mbusi elufu moja ni ŵaliji nkusikata manyunya kwele ku Kalimeli ko. <verse eid="1SA 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 25:3" />Mundu jo jwaŵilanjikwe che Nabali ni ŵankwakwe jwaŵilanjikwe che Abigaili. Che Abigaili ŵaliji jwankongwe jwalunda ni jwakusalala. Nambo che Nabali ŵankwakwe juŵaliji jwa ntundu wa che Kalebu ŵaliji mundu jwachigongomalo ni jwa kulema.<verse eid="1SA 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 25:4" />Katema che Daudi paŵaliji kweleko kuchipululu ko ŵapilikene kuti che Nabali ŵaliji nkusikata manyunya ngondolo syakwe kwele ku Kalimeli ko. <verse eid="1SA 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 25:5" />Kwayele ŵaajigele achachanda likumi, ŵaasalile, “Njaulanje ku che Nabali kwele ku Kalimeli ko nkaasalile kuti ngwakomasya. <verse eid="1SA 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 25:6" />Nkaasalile kuti che Daudi akuti ‘Ntame yaaka yejinji yaili ni mboka mmweji ni ŵapaulongo wenu ni yanayose inkwete. <verse eid="1SA 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 25:7" />Mbilikene kuti katema ka nkusikata manyunya ngondolo syenu, ngusaka mmanyilile kuti ŵakuchinga ŵenu ŵaliji pamo ni uwe, ni uwe nganitwatendaa chachili chose changalumbana. Sooni katema kose paŵaliji pamo ni uwe akuno Kalimeli ku, nganajiwikwa chilichose. <verse eid="1SA 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 25:8" />Mwausyaga tachinsalila. Sambano ngummenda, mwatendele ya mbone achachanda ŵangu, pakuŵapo tuiche pa ndaŵi ja sangalala. Choonde mwape chilichose chinkwete ŵakutumichila ŵenu wo ni une che Daudi mwanagwenu.’” <verse eid="1SA 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 25:9" />Achachanda ŵa che Daudi ŵajawile ni kwasalila che Nabali nti iŵalajisye che Daudi. Nipele ŵalindilile kanondi. <verse eid="1SA 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 25:10" />Nipele che Nabali ŵaajanjile ŵakutumichila ŵa che Daudi pakwausya kuti, “Ana che Daudi ju akulitenda ŵani? Ana chapi chakuntendasya mwanagwe che Yese aliwone kuti ali wmuhimu? Agano moŵa gano kwana ŵakutumichila ŵaajinji ŵakwautuka achambuje ŵawo. <verse eid="1SA 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 25:11" />Uli, nyigale mikate ni meesi ni nyama jinasikite kwaligongo lya ŵakukata manyunya ga ngondolo syangu ni kwapa ŵandu ŵangangukumanyilila kwakutyochela?”<verse eid="1SA 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 25:12" />Nipele achachanda ŵa che Daudi ŵala ŵausile ni kwasalila che Daudi iŵajanjilwe ni che Nabali. <verse eid="1SA 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 25:13" />Che Daudi ŵaasalile ŵandu ŵakwe kuti, “Kila mundu alitaŵilile lipanga lyakwe mchiunu.” Nipele kila mundu ŵalitaŵilile lipanga lyakwe, ni che Daudi nombe ŵalitaŵilile lipanga lyakwe. Ŵandu nti mia nne ŵankuiye che Daudi ni ŵandu mia mbili ŵasigalile ni ndundu.<verse eid="1SA 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 25:14" />Jwanchanda jumo pasikati ja ŵamasengo ŵa che Nabali, ŵansalile che Abigaili ŵankwakwe che Nabali kuti, “Che Daudi ŵaatumile ŵantenga kutyochela ku chipululu kuti ŵaakomasye ambuje jwetu, nambo ambujewo ŵaatukene. <verse eid="1SA 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 25:15" />Nambo ŵele ŵandu wo ŵaliji ŵambone kwa uwe. Nganatutendela chindu chilichose chakusakala, ni katema kose katwaliji nawo kwele ku chipululu ko, pangali chindu chetu chimo chichajiŵikwe. <verse eid="1SA 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 25:16" />Kukwetu, ŵaliji wakulindilila ndaŵi syose pitwachingaga ilango yetu chilo ni muusi wakwe. <verse eid="1SA 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 25:17" />Sambano nganichisye chele chindu chi ni mmanyilile chintende ichichi. Chele chindu chi chikomboleka kwikanalyo limbulunga kwa ambuje ŵetu ni ŵapaulongo wakwe wose. Wankwenu che Nabali ali mundu jwangalumbana, ni jwangasaka kupikanila chakwasalila mundu jwine.”<verse eid="1SA 25:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 25:18" />Che Abigaili ŵajanguisye, ŵajigele mikate mia mbili ni misaku jiŵili jajigumbele divai ni nyama ja ngondolo syejoche nsano ni kilo kumi na saba sya imanga yakalanga ni isagwa mia moja ya sabibu syejumule, ni mikate ja tini mia mbili ni yele indu yose yo ŵaikwesisye pachanya pa mbunda. <verse eid="1SA 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 25:19" />Ni ŵansalile jwanchanda jwakwe jula, “Nnongolele! Une tinankuye.” Nambo nganansalila che Nabali ŵankwakwe chilichose. <verse eid="1SA 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 25:20" />Paŵaliji nkutuluka ku chitumbi kwaula ku chiŵata, ali akwesile mbunda jakwe, che Daudi ni ŵandu ŵakwe nombe ŵaliji nkutuluka chitumbi kwika kuŵaliji. <verse eid="1SA 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 25:21" />Che Daudi ŵaganisisye kuti, “Uneji nalisawisye kulindilila ipanje yose ya mundu ju mu chipululu pangali chakupata, ni ngapagwa chindu chakwe chichapotele, nombejo andipile yangalumbana pakwatendela yambone inaatendele. <verse eid="1SA 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 25:22" />Ambuje Akunnungu aambute ni kuumulaga une, iŵaga malaŵi kundaŵi, nginguulaga ŵamasengo achalume wose ŵa mundu jo.”<verse eid="1SA 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 25:23" />Nipele che Abigaili paŵammweni che Daudi, ŵajangwiye kutuluka pa mbunda jakwe, ŵatindiŵele ni kukotama mpaka paasi paujo pa che Daudi. <verse eid="1SA 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 25:24" />Ŵaligwisisye pamakongolo pa che Daudi ni kwasalila, “Alakwe ambuje jwangu, chileŵo chi chiŵe kwa une pe. Choonde muungunde ngunguluche ni mmwe. Mpilikanile maloŵe gingusaka kunsalila. <verse eid="1SA 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 25:25" />Nkanganichisya che Nabali mundu jwachigongomalo, jwelejo ali jwakuloŵela mpela malumbo ga liina lyakwe yagatite kuŵa, nombejo akupanganya mpela mundu jwakuloŵela. Ambuje jwangu, aŵala achachanda ŵenu pamwatumile, uneji jwakutumichila jwenu nganinaawona. <verse eid="1SA 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 25:26" />Sambano ambuje jwangu, ngulumbila kwa Ambuje Akunnungu ŵajumi, ni yanli ŵajumi mmwe, kuti pakuŵa Ambuje Akunnungu ansiŵilile nkaliuchisya kwa kuulaga ni kuliichisya malalatilo, mwaleche ŵammagongo ŵenu ni aŵala wose ŵakunsachila yangalumbana aŵeje ŵakuloŵela mpela che Nabali. <verse eid="1SA 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 25:27" />Ambuje jwangu, ngunchondelela mpochele au ntuka wu unanjigalile, ni kwapa achachanda unnongene nawo. <verse eid="1SA 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 25:28" />Choonde muunechelesye une jwakutumichila jwenu kwa chilichose chiineŵile. Nguimanyilila kuti Ambuje Akunnungu tachintenda mmwe kuŵa umwenye jwa ku Isilaeli, ni ŵanache ŵenu nombe tachiŵa iyoyo, pakuŵapo mmwejo nkuputana ngondo ja Ambuje Akunnungu. Yangalumbana ikapagwa katema kose ka umi wenu. <verse eid="1SA 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 25:29" />Yakopochelaga ŵandu kunkuilisya kuti ammulaje, Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu jwenu, tachiulindilila umi wenu mpela mundu yakuti kulindilila indu ya ndalama. Nambo ŵammagongo ŵenu Akunnungu tachaponya kwakutalika mpela mundu yakuti kuponya maganga ni linati. <verse eid="1SA 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 25:30" />Pakumala Ambuje Akunnungu kutendekanya yambone yose yannanjile, ni kunsagula mme mwenye jwa ku Isilaeli, <verse eid="1SA 25:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 25:31" />alakwe ambuje jwangu, ngankola ligongo lya kulilasika namose kulaga muntima kuti mmuleje pangali ligongo kwa kuliuchisya. Nambo ambuje jwangu, Ambuje Akunnungu patachimpa upile, ngunchondelela mungumbuchile une jwakutumichila jwenu.”<verse eid="1SA 25:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 25:32" />Che Daudi ŵanjanjile che Abigaili, “Achimbichikwe Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu jwa ku Isilaeli, jwantumisye mmwe kuchingangana ni une. <verse eid="1SA 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 25:33" />Ambuje Akunnungu ampe upile kwa yantite kupanganya kwa lunda kwa kuusiŵilila kuti ngasimulaga ŵandu ni kuliuchisya une nansyene. <verse eid="1SA 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 25:34" />Kusyene, Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu jwa ku Isilaeli, asiŵilile ngasinammulasya mmwe. Ngankatende kwakwanguya kwika kukuchingangana ni une, kusyene, malaŵi kundaŵi ngapagwa jwannume jwalijose jwali paasi pa che Nabali jwakasigalile jwanjumi.” <verse eid="1SA 25:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 25:35" />Nipele, che Daudi ŵapochele indu yose iŵannyichisye che Abigaili, ŵansalile che Abigaili, “Mmuje kumangwenu kwa chitendewele. Nnole, une nampikene insasile, chimmendile cho nachipikene.”<verse eid="1SA 25:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 25:36" />Che Abigaili paŵausile kumusi, ŵansimene che Nabali achitendaga chindimba chekulungwa cha wandu achajinji ni chakulya mu nyuumba jakwe mpela ja chimwenye. Che Nabali ŵaliji asengwile kwannope muntima mwakwe ni ŵaliji akolelwe kwannope, kwayele che Abigaeli nganansalila chilichose ŵakwakwewo nipele ŵalindilile mpaka kundaŵi. <verse eid="1SA 25:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 25:37" />Pakwachele, che Abigaili paŵaweni kuti ŵankwakwe atulele nkologo waakopweche, ŵansalile indu yose, ni papopo che Nabali ŵatatele, ni ŵaliji mpela liganga. <verse eid="1SA 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 25:38" />Moŵa likumi kanyuma, Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaujigele umi u che Nabali.<verse eid="1SA 25:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 25:39" />Che Daudi paŵapilikene kuti che Nabali aŵile, ŵatite, “Achimbichikwe Ambuje Akunnungu jwammuchisye che Nabali kwa kuundukana, nombe Ambuje Akunnungu anekasisye une jwakutumichila jwakwe kuti ngatenda ya chigongomalo. Ambuje Akunnungu ammuchisye che Nabali kwa ugongomalo wakwe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 25:39">Nipele che Daudi ŵaatumile ŵandu kuti akaajigalile che Abigaili kuti aŵe ŵankwakwe. <verse eid="1SA 25:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 25:40" />Ŵakutumichila ŵa che Daudi paŵaiche kwa che Abigaili kwele ku Kalimeli ko, ŵansalile, “Che Daudi atutumile tunjigale kuti mme ŵankwakwe.”<verse eid="1SA 25:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 25:41" />Che Abigaili ŵajimwiche, ni kutindiŵala ni ŵakoteme mpaka pasi paujo pao, ni ŵatite, “Uneji ndili jwakutumichila pe, ndili chile kwagulula makongolo ŵakutumichila ŵa ambuje jwangu.” <verse eid="1SA 25:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 25:42" />Che Abigaili ŵajangwiye, ŵajimwiche ni kukwela pa mbunda jakwe, ŵalongene ni ŵakutumichila ŵakwe nsano achakongwe, ŵajawile ni ŵakutumichila ŵa che Daudi, nombejo ŵaliji ŵankwakwe che Daudi.<verse eid="1SA 25:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1SA 25:43" />Sooni che Daudi ŵalombele che Ahinoamu kutyochela ku Yesileeli. Kwayele ŵele achakongwe ŵaŵili wo ŵaliji achiŵankwakwe. <verse eid="1SA 25:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1SA 25:44" />Kele katema ko, che Sauli ŵannombekasisye che Mikali, mwali jwakwe, juŵaliji ŵankwakwe che Daudi, ku che Palitieli mwanagwe che Laishi, jwakutyochela musi wa ku Galimu.<verse eid="1SA 25:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="1SA 26" />
  <para style="s">Che Daudi akunneka che Sauli sooni pangammulaga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 26:1" />Achalume ŵampepe kutyochela musi wa ku Sifu ŵanjaulile che Sauli kwele ku Gibea ko ni kunsalila kuti che Daudi akulisisa ku litumbi lya Hakila, upaande wa kungopochelo lyuŵa kwa Yeshimoni. <verse eid="1SA 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 26:2" />Papopo, che Sauli ŵatulwiche ŵapite ku chipululu cha sifu ali ni ŵangondo ŵakulimbangana ŵa ku Isilaeli elufu tatu, kukunsosa che Daudi. <verse eid="1SA 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 26:3" />Che Sauli ŵaŵisile chigono mungulugulu litala pachanya chikwesya cha Hakila chachikulolegana ni musi wa Yeshimoni, nambo che Daudi ŵaliji nkutama kwele kuchipululu ko. Paŵaiweni kuti che Sauli aiche kukunsosa, <verse eid="1SA 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 26:4" />ŵatumile ŵakulolesya, ni ŵasalilwe kuti “ili isyene che Sauli aiche”. <verse eid="1SA 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 26:5" />Pelepo che Daudi ŵatyosile ŵajawile mpaka peuto paŵaŵisile che Sauli chigono. Ŵapaweni peuto pati che Sauli ni che Abuneli mwanagwe che Neli, jwankulu jwa ŵangondo ŵa che Sauli agonile. Che Sauli ŵaliji agonile mu chigono ni ŵangondo ŵaliji ŵaasyungwile.<verse eid="1SA 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 26:6" />Che Daudi ŵaausisye che Ahimeleki juŵaliji Mhiti ni che Abishai mpwakwe che Yoabu, achikuluŵawo ŵaŵilanjikwe che Seluya, kuti, “Nduni jutajaule pamo ni une kuchigono chi che Sauli?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 26:6">Che Abishai ŵajanjile, “Uneji tinyaule pamo nomwe.”<verse eid="1SA 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 26:7" />Kwayele, chilo che Daudi ni che Abishai ŵajinjile mu chigono chi che Sauli, ŵansimene che Sauli ali agonile pasikati ja chigono cho, ni mpamba wakwe uli wetotomeche pasi chiŵandi ni ntwe wakwe. Che Abuneli ni ŵangondo ŵaliji agonile kwasyungula che Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 26:8" />Che Abishai ŵansalile che Daudi, “Lelo Akunnungu ampele lipesa lyakummulaga jwammagongo jwenu. Nipele muuneche naasome mpaka paasi kwa chiputiko chimo cha mpamba wangu, nganansoma kaŵili.”<verse eid="1SA 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 26:9" />Nambo che Daudi ŵansalile che Abishai kuti, “Nkammulaga, pakuŵa kusyene Ambuje Akunnungu tachinjamuka mundu jwajulijose jutaugolosye nkono wakwe pa jwasagulikwe kwakwajitilila mauta.” <verse eid="1SA 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 26:10" />Che Daudi wajendelechele kuwecheta kuti, “Mpela Ambuje Akunnungu yatite kuŵa ŵajumi, kuti Ambuje Akunnungu nsyene tachimmulaga che Sauli, pane pa lyuŵa lya chiwa chakwe tilichiika, pane tachijaula kungondo ni kuwilila kukoko. <verse eid="1SA 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 26:11" />Nambo Ambuje Akunnungu akunganya ngasing'olosya nkono wangu kummulaga mundu jwansagwile kwakunjitilila mauta. Nambo njigale mpamba wakwe pamo ni chitumba chakwe cha mesi yauli chiŵandi ni ntwe wakwe, nipele tujaule.” <verse eid="1SA 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 26:12" />Nipele che Daudi ŵaujigele mpamba ula ni chitumba cha meesi chiŵandi ni ntwe u che Sauli ni wose ŵatyosile. Nambo ngapagwa juwaiweni namose juwaimanyilile atamuno juŵajimwiche, pakuŵa Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaaichisye lugono lwakutopela.<verse eid="1SA 26:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 26:13" />Nipele, che Daudi ŵajawile upaande ŵaaŵili wa lichemba lyo, ŵajimi pachanya chitumbi kwakutalichila nnope ni mpingo wa che Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 26:14" />Che Daudi ŵaaŵilasile ŵangondo ŵa che Sauli ni che Abuneli mwanagwe che Neli achitiji, “Che Abuneli, ana nkuumbikana?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 26:14">Che Abuneli ŵausisye, “Ana nduni mmwe junkummilanga mwenye?”<verse eid="1SA 26:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 26:15" />Che Daudi ŵajanjile, “Uli, mmwe nli jwannume? Ana nduni jwali mpela mmwe mu Isilaeli? kwachichi nganimunlindilila mbuje gwenu, jwali mwenye? Pakuwa mundu jumo pasikati jetu ŵajinjile pelepo kuti ammulaje mbuje gwenujo. <verse eid="1SA 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 26:16" />Chindu chintesile ngachilumbana. Ngulumbila kwa Ambuje Akunnungu ŵajumi, kuti mwe ni wandu ŵenu nkusachilwa kuulajikwa, pakuŵapo nganimunlindilila mbuje gwenu, jwati Ambuje Akunnungu anjitilile mauta. Sambano nnole, mpamba wa mwenye ni chitumba cha meesi chichaliji chiŵandi ni ntwe wakwe iŵaga ipali!” <verse eid="1SA 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 26:17" />Che Sauli ŵalimanyilile liloŵe li che Daudi, ni ŵausisye, “Uli, lyelelyo lili liloŵe lywa mwanangu che Daudi?” Che Daudi ŵajanjile, “Ambuje ŵangu, mwenye, ndili une che Daudi.” <verse eid="1SA 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 26:18" />Ni ŵajendelechele kuŵecheta kuti, “Nambo kwachichi alakwe ambuje jwangu nkuunguilisya une jwakutumichila jwenu? Ana ndesile ichichi? Ana chigongomalo chantiuli chinantesile? <verse eid="1SA 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 26:19" />Nipele, sambano ambuje jwangu mwenye, mpilikane maloŵe ga jwakutumichila jwenu. Iŵaga Ambuje Akunnungu ni jwangalawisye mmwe kuti mme wammagongo wangu, nipele apochele mbopesi sya kutinisya syasisyatendekasye agalausye nningwa wakwe. Nambo iŵaga ali ŵandu, nipele wandu wo alwesekwe paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu pakuŵa andopwele une kutyochela pamalo patupele Ambuje Akunnungu kuti paŵe petu, achitiji, ‘Njaule nkajitumichile minungu jine.’ <verse eid="1SA 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 26:20" />Nkaaneka mwilile ku chilambo chachilendo, kwakutalika ni pawele Ambuje Akunnungu. Ligongo chichi alakwe mwenye jwa ku Isilaeli ntyosile kukuusosa umi wangu mpela mundu jwakusakula ngwale kumatumbi?”<verse eid="1SA 26:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 26:21" />Nipele che Sauli ŵatite, “Ndesile sambi. Mmuje che Daudi mwanangu. Ngandandila sooni kulinga kumbulaga ligongo muukulupwisye umi wangu lelo. Uneji mele jwakuloŵela ni sooni neeŵile kwannope.” <verse eid="1SA 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 26:22" />Che Daudi ŵajanjile, “Alakwe mwenye, mpaamba wenu uli apano, muntume jwanchanda jwenu aiche kukujigala. <verse eid="1SA 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 26:23" />Ambuje Akunnungu akumpa ntuuka kila mundu jwali jwakukulupilichika ni jwakutenda indu yakuisaka. Lelo Ambuje Akunnungu ŵambele lipesa lyakummulaga, nambo uneji nganigolosya nkono wangu kuti nammulaje mmwejo nsagulikwe ni Ambuje Akunnungu kwa kunjitilila mauta. <verse eid="1SA 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 26:24" />Nnole, mpela yandite kuulola umi wenu kuŵa wandalama leo jino, nombe Ambuje Akunnungu aulole umi wangu kuŵa wandalama ni kuungulupusya kutyochela mu malagasyo gose.”<verse eid="1SA 26:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 26:25" />Nipele che Sauli ŵansalile che Daudi, “Akunnungu ampe upile mwanangu che Daudi. Tinchitenda indu yekulungwa, ni indu yenu tiinjindele yambone mu yosepe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 26:25">Nipele che Daudi ŵatyosile, che Sauli nombe ŵausile kumangwakwe.<verse eid="1SA 26:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="1SA 27" />
  <para style="s">Che Daudi akutama ni Ŵafilisiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 27:1" />Che Daudi ŵalisalile muntima mwakwe, “Palyuŵa limo che Sauli tachiimulaga. Mmbaya kukwangu mutuchile ku chilambo cha Ŵafilisiti. Che Sauli tachileka kuusosa pa Isilaeli, ni une chime salama ngamulaga.” <verse eid="1SA 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 27:2" />Kwayele, papopo che Daudi ni ŵandu ŵakwe mia sita ŵajawile ku Gati kwa mwenye che Akishi mwanagwe che Maoki. <verse eid="1SA 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 27:3" />Che Daudi ni ŵandu ŵakwe pamo ni ulongo wakwe ŵajile kutama ni che Akishi kwele ku Gati ko. Che Daudi ŵakwete achakongwe ŵaŵili: Che Ahinoamu jwakutyochela ku Yesileeli ni che Abigaili jwa ku Kalimeli, jwankongwe jwawililwe ni ŵankwakwe che Nabali. <verse eid="1SA 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 27:4" />Che Sauli paŵapilikene kuti che Daudi autuchile ku Gati, ŵalesile kwasosa.<verse eid="1SA 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 27:5" />Lyuŵa limo che Daudi ŵansalile che Akishi, “Iŵaga ngundikwe paujo penu ngunchondelela mumbe musi umo mu chilambo chenu kuti uŵe pamalo pangu pakutama. Ngaŵa yambone une jwakutumichila jwenu kutama apano pamo ni mmwe mu musi wa chimwenye wu.” <verse eid="1SA 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 27:6" />Lyuŵa lyo, che Akishi ŵampele che Daudi musi wa ku Sikilagi. Kwayele, kutandilila lyuŵa lyo musi wa ku Sikilagi uŵele wao mamwenye ŵa ku Yuda.<verse eid="1SA 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 27:7" />Che Daudi ŵatemi ku chilambo cha Ŵafilisiti kwa chaka ni miesi ncheche. <verse eid="1SA 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 27:8" />Pa moŵa go che Daudi ni ŵandu ŵakwe ŵaagungumuchile Ŵageshuli, ni Ŵagilisi ni Ŵaamaleki ŵaŵaliji achinsyene chilambo cho kalakala nnope. Malo jao jajenele kutandilila ku Telemu kulili litala lyalikwaula ku Shuli, mpaka mu mpika mwa chilambo cha ku Misili. <verse eid="1SA 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 27:9" />Che Daudi ŵaauleje ŵandu ŵa chilambo cho, panganneka jwanjumi namose mundu jumo, aŵeje jwannume pane jwankongwe, ŵajigele ngondolo ni ng'ombe ni mbunda ni ngamia ni yakuwala. Nipele ŵausile ni kwika ku che Akishi. <verse eid="1SA 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 27:10" />Che Akishi paŵammusisye che Daudi kuti, “Ana lelo mwajile kukumenya ngondo ni ŵani?” Che Daudi ŵansalile, “Twajile kukumenyana ni ŵandu ŵa ku Negebu ja ku Yuda” pane “Ŵandu ŵa ku Negebu ja ku Yelameeli” pane “Ŵandu ŵa ku Negebu ja Ŵakeni.” <verse eid="1SA 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 27:11" />Che Daudi ŵauleje ŵandu wosepe, ngananneka jwanjumi mundu jwajulijose aŵeje jwannume pane jwankongwe kuti akapagwa mundu jwakwika ku Gati, ŵaganisisye kuti: Akukombolanga kwamanyisya ngani syetu achitiji, “Yeleyi ni indu yaakuitenda che Daudi ni ŵandu ŵakwe.” Yeleyi ni iŵatesile che Daudi pa ndaŵi syosepe siŵatemi ku chilambo cha Ŵafilisiti. <verse eid="1SA 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 27:12" />Kwayele, che Akishi ŵankulupilile che Daudi, achiganisyaga kuti, “Ŵaisilaeli achinjakwe akunchima kwannope. Kwayele, tachindumichila pa umi wangu wose.”<verse eid="1SA 27:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="1SA 28" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 28:1" />Pa moŵa go Ŵafilisiti ŵasongangenye mipingo jawo ja ŵangondo kuti amenyane ni Ŵaisilaeli. Che Akishi ŵansalile che Daudi kuti, “Mmanyilile kuti mmwejo ni ŵandu ŵenu nkusachilwa kwaula pamo ni une kukuputana ngondo.” <verse eid="1SA 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 28:2" />Che Daudi ŵanjanjile che Akishi, “Elo! Chimumone une jwakutumichila jwenu yanguti kukombola kuputana.” Che Akishi ŵansalile kuti, “Ni une tinantende kuŵa jwakulindilila jwangu katema kose ka umi wangu wosepe.”<verse eid="1SA 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Sauli akusosa ukamuchisyo kwa jwachisango</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 28:3" />Katema ko, che Samweli ŵaliji awile, ni Ŵaisilaeli wose ŵanlilile nipele ŵansichile ku musi wakwe kwele ku Lama ko. Che Sauli ŵaliji ŵaŵinjile mu chilambo ŵachisango ni ŵasaŵi.<verse eid="1SA 28:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 28:4" />Ŵafilisiti ŵasongangene ni kuŵika chigono chao kwele ku Shunemu ni che Sauli ŵaasongangenye Ŵaisilaeli wose ni kuŵika chigono chao ku litumbi lya Giliboa. <verse eid="1SA 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 28:5" />Che Sauli paŵauweni mpingo wa ŵangondo ŵa Ŵafilisiti ŵatandite kogopa, ni ŵaliji ni lipamba kwannope. <verse eid="1SA 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 28:6" />Che Sauli ŵausisye kwa Ambuje Akunnungu, nambo Ambuje Akunnungu ngananjanga kwa kusagamila atamuno kwa maganga ga ulimu atamuno kwa litala lya ŵakulondola. <verse eid="1SA 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 28:7" />Pelepo che Sauli ŵaasalile ŵakutumichila ŵakwe, “Muusosele jwankongwe jwakukombola kukunguluka ni ŵandu ŵawile, kuti naajaulile ngaausye.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:7">Ŵakutumichila ŵakwe ŵanjanjile, “Apali jwachisango jumo kwele ku Endoli ko.”<verse eid="1SA 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 28:8" />Nipele, che Sauli ŵaligalawisye kwakuwala yakuwala ine akamanyika, ŵajawile kweleko pamo ni ŵandu ŵakwe ŵaŵili. Ŵaiche kwa jwankongwe jo chilo, ni ŵansalile, “Mmuchilichisye kwa masoka, chindu chichichisimane, ni muunyichisye ajula jutinansalile.”<verse eid="1SA 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 28:9" />Jwankongwe jula ŵansalile, “Mmwejo nkumanyilila kusyene kuti mwenye che Sauli ŵaauleje ŵachisango ni ŵasaŵi wose muchilambo cha ku Isilaeli. Sambano kwachichi nkuumichila chitanje kuti muundanjisye ni kuumulaga?”<verse eid="1SA 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 28:10" />Che Sauli ŵanlumbilile kwa liina lya Ambuje Akunnungu achitiji, “Ngulumbila kwa Ambuje Akunnungu ŵajumi, kuti ngapagwa majamuko galigose gatigansimane kwaligongo lya chele chindu chi.”<verse eid="1SA 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 28:11" />Jwankongwe jula ŵammusisye, “Ana nkusaka nammilanjile nduni?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:11">Che Sauli ŵajanjile, “Muumilanjile che Samweli.”<verse eid="1SA 28:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 28:12" />Jwankongwe jula paŵammweni che Samweli ŵalisile kwakunyanyisya, ni ŵansalile che Sauli, “Kwachichi muunambisye? Mmweji nli che Sauli!”<verse eid="1SA 28:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 28:13" />Mwenye che Sauli ŵansalile “Nkajogopa! Nkuwona ichichi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:13">Jwankongwe jula ŵanjanjile, “Nguchiwona chindu nti nnungu jichikopochelaga paasi.”<verse eid="1SA 28:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 28:14" />Che Sauli ŵansalile jwankongwe jo, “Akulandana na acheni?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:14">Jwankongwe jo ŵajanjile, “Jwannume jwachekulwipe, akukwela, nombejo awasile mwinjilo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:14">Pelepo che Sauli ŵaimanyilile kuti jwelejo ali che Samweli. Che Sauli ŵajineme mpaka pasi kwa kwachimbichisya. <verse eid="1SA 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 28:15" />Che Samweli ŵansalile che Sauli, “Kwachichi muunagesye pakuunyichisya akuno?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:15">Che Sauli ŵajanjile “Uneji ndili pa isausyo yekulungwa! Ŵafilisiti akuputana ngondo ni une, ni Akunnungu anesile jika. Ngakunyanga sooni kwa litala lya ŵakulondola atamuno kwa kusagamila. Lyelelyo ni ligongo nammilasile muumanyisye chakupanganya.” <verse eid="1SA 28:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 28:16" />Che Samweli ŵatite, “Kwachichi nkusaka une nansalile chakutenda akuno Ambuje Akunnungu annesile jika ni aŵele jwammagongo jwenu? <verse eid="1SA 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 28:17" />Ambuje Akunnungu ampanganyichisye achila chansalile kwa litala lyangu. Ambuje Akunnungu autyosisye umwenye kukwenu, ampele njenu che Daudi. <verse eid="1SA 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 28:18" />Pakuŵapo mmwejo nganimunjitichisya Ambuje Akunnungu, namose nganinkwanilisya lutumbilo lwakwe kwa kwaulaga Ŵaamaleki wosepe mpela yatite kunnajisya ni indu yao yiŵakwete mpela iŵatite pakunsalila. Lyelelyo ni ligongo lelo Ambuje Akunnungu akuntendela mmwejo yeleyi. <verse eid="1SA 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 28:19" />Kupunda ni yeleyo, Ambuje Akunnungu tachintenda mmwejo pamo ni Ŵaisilaeli wose mme paasi pa Ŵafilisiti. Malaŵi, mmwejo ni ŵanache ŵenu tinchiŵa pamo ni une; namose mpingo wa ŵangondo wa Ŵaisilaeli Ambuje Akunnungu tachatenda aputikwe ni Ŵafilisiti.”<verse eid="1SA 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 28:20" />Chisisimuchile, che Sauli ŵagwile manguku, kwa lipamba ligongo lya maloŵe ga che Samweli, machili gaamalile, pakuŵa ŵaliji jwangalya chachilichose lyuŵa lyose, muusi ni chilo. <verse eid="1SA 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 28:21" />Pelepo jwankongwe jula ŵanjaulile che Sauli, ni paŵaiweni kuti che Sauli akwete lipamba kwannope, ŵansalile, “Uneji jwakutumichila jwenu nanjitichisye mmwe, nautasile umi wangu mu chakogoya pakutenda achila chimuusalile nantendele. <verse eid="1SA 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 28:22" />Sambano choonde mumbilikanile uneji jwakutumichila jwenu, tinankolochesye nkate kuti nlye nomwe tinkole machili ga kuendelechela ni ulendo wenu.” <verse eid="1SA 28:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 28:23" />Nambo che Sauli ŵakanile nikuti, “Ngangulya.” Nambo aŵala ŵakutumichila ŵa che Sauli ŵalumbikene pamo ni njwankongwe jula, ŵanchondelele kuti alye, nombejo ŵaapilikanile. Kwayele ŵajimwiche pasi pala ni kutama pachindanda. <verse eid="1SA 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 28:24" />Jwankongwe jula ŵakwete ng'ombe ja mwana jakwimbala, ŵajisinjile mwakwanguya, ŵajigele utandi ŵa ngano, ŵaukandile ni kolosya mikate jangataga amila. <verse eid="1SA 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 28:25" />Ŵampele che Sauli, ŵaapele nombe ŵakutumichila ŵakwe, nombe nawo ŵalile. Nipele ŵatyosile chilo chichocho.<verse eid="1SA 28:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="1SA 29" />
  <para style="s">Ŵafilisiti akukana kwaula ku ngondo ni che Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 29:1" />Ŵafilisiti ŵasongangenye ŵangondo ŵao wose kwele ku Afeki ko, ni Ŵaisilaeli ŵaŵisile chigono chiŵandi ni uliŵa wa mesi wauli ku Yesileeli. <verse eid="1SA 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 29:2" />Ilongola nsano ŵa Ŵafilisiti paŵaliji nkupita ni mipingo jao ja ngondo ja ŵandu mia moja mia moja ni mipingo ja ŵangondo elufu moja elufu moja, che Daudi nombe ali ni ŵandu ŵakwe pamo ni che Akishi ni ŵangondo ŵakwe ŵaliji nkukuya chapanyuma pa ŵangondo wo. <verse eid="1SA 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 29:3" />Achakulungwa ŵa mipingo ja ngondo ja Chifilisiti ŵausisye, “Ŵaebulania ŵa akutenda ichichi apano?” Che Akishi ŵajanjile ŵele achakulungwa ŵa mipingo jangondo ja Chifilisiti, “Ajuju ali che Daudi, juŵaliji paasi pa che Sauli mwenye jwa ku Isilaeli, nombe jo aŵele ni une kupunda chaka chimo. Ni kutandilila paŵautuchile kukwangu, nganinansimana ni chileŵo chachilichose.”<verse eid="1SA 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 29:4" />Nambo achakulungwa ŵa mipingo ja ngondo ja Chifilisiti ŵaatumbilile kwannope che Akishi, ni ŵansalile, “Mwausye ajaule kunsinda wakwe umwapele kuti atame. Akajaula pamo ni uwe ku ngondo, akaika kutugalauka, ni kutujimuchila ku ngondo. Ana ngankwiwona kuti mundu ju tachaulaga ŵandu ŵetu ni kwa litala lyo tajilane ni mbujegwe che Sauli? <verse eid="1SA 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 29:5" />Ana aju nganaŵa che Daudi julajula jwati achakongwe ŵajimbile ngani syakwe paŵaliji nkutyala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 29:5">‘Che Sauli auleje ŵandu maelufu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 29:5">nambo che Daudi auleje ŵandu makumi elufu.’”<verse eid="1SA 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 29:6" />Nipele che Akishi ŵammilasile che Daudi ni kunsalila, “Ngulumbila kwa Ambuje Akunnungu ŵajumi, kuti mmele jwakukulupilichika kukwangu. Ikaliji yambone kukwangu tujaule ŵanawose kungondo, pakuŵapo nganinachiwona chakusakala chilichose kukwenu kutandilila lyuŵa lila pamwaiche kukwangu mpaka lelojino. Namose yeleyo, mamwenye ŵane ŵa nganakola chikulupi ni mmwe. <verse eid="1SA 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 29:7" />Kwayele sambano, mmuje kumusi, nkatame kwa chitendewele, nkatenda chachilichose chakwatumbilisya ilongola ŵa Ŵafilisiti.”<verse eid="1SA 29:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 29:8" />Che Daudi ŵanjanjile che Akishi, “Nambi ndesile chindu chachi changalumbana? Mpela inkuti kusala kuti, nganimuumona ni chileŵo chilichose kutandilila alila lyuŵa panatandite kuntumichila mpaka lelojino. Kwachichi ninajaule kukuputana ngondo ni ŵammagongo ŵa ambuje jwangu, mwenye?”<verse eid="1SA 29:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 29:9" />Che Akishi ŵansalile, che Daudi, “Ngumanyilila kuti nkukulupilichika nti katumetume jwakwinani jwa Akunnungu. Namose yeleyo, achakulungwa ŵa mipingo ja ngondo ja Ŵafilisiti atite kuti, ‘Akajaula ku ngondo pamo ni uweji.’ <verse eid="1SA 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 29:10" />Sambano mmwe pamo ni ŵandu ŵenu, malaŵi kundaŵindaŵipe njimuche ni kwaula patikuche.”<verse eid="1SA 29:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 29:11" />Kwayele, Malaŵi jakwe kundaŵi, che Daudi pamo ni ŵandu ŵakwe ŵatyosile ni kuuja ku chilambo cha Ŵafilisiti. Nombe Ŵafilisiti wo ŵajawile ku Yesileeli.<verse eid="1SA 29:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="1SA 30" />
  <para style="s">Che Daudi akuputana ni Ŵaamaleki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 30:1" />Pa lyuŵa lyaatatu, che Daudi ni ŵandu ŵakwe ŵaujile ku Sikilagi. Ŵaamaleki ŵaliji agungumuchile malo ga kulujenda kwa chilambo cha Yuda yaani Negebu pamo ni musi wa Sikilagi ni kuutinisya mooto. <verse eid="1SA 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 30:2" />Ŵaliji ŵaajigele mateeka achakongwe ni ŵandu wose ŵaŵaliji mmusi mo, achakulugwa ni ŵananche. Nganambulaga namose jumo nambo wajigele ni kwaula nao. <verse eid="1SA 30:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 30:3" />Che Daudi ni ŵandu ŵakwe paŵaiche ŵausimene musi wetinisye ni mooto, ni achakongwe ni ŵanache ŵao ŵachilume ni ŵachikongwe, ajigalikwe mateeka. <verse eid="1SA 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 30:4" />Pelepo che Daudi ni ŵandu ŵakwe ŵatandite kulila kwa kunyanyisya, mpaka machili gakulila gamasile. <verse eid="1SA 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 30:5" />Achakongwe ŵaŵili ŵa che Daudi, che Ahinoamu kutyochela ku Yesleeli ni che Abigaili jwankongwe jwawililwe ni ŵankwakwe che Nabali, nombe nawo ŵajigalikwe mateeka.<verse eid="1SA 30:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 30:6" />Sambano, che Daudi ŵaliji pa yakogoya yekulungwa ligongo ŵandu ŵaŵechetaga kumponya maganga. Kila mundu yampetekaga muntima ligongo lya kwapootesya ŵanache ŵawo ni achiŵali ŵao. Nambo che Daudi ŵapegwilwe machili ni Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu jwakwe. <verse eid="1SA 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 30:7" />Nipele che Daudi ŵansalile jwambopesi che Abiasali mwanache jwa che Ahimeleki, “Munyichisye chisibao cha umbopesi.” Che Abiasali ŵampelechele. <verse eid="1SA 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 30:8" />Che Daudi ŵammusisye Ambuje Akunnungu kuti, “Uli naukuye au mpingo wa ŵangondo wejigale ŵandu ŵetu? Ana tinaakamule?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 30:8">Ambuje Akunnungu ŵajanjile, “Muukuye pakuŵapo tinkaakamule ni kwawombola mateeka.”<verse eid="1SA 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 30:9" />Kwayele, che Daudi ŵatyosile pamo ni aŵala ŵandu mia sita ŵaŵaliji nawo. Paŵaiche pa kasulo ka Besoli, ŵaasimene ŵampepe mwa ŵandu ŵaŵajigalikwe mateeka ŵaalesile pelepo. <verse eid="1SA 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 30:10" />Nambo che Daudi ŵajendelechele kwaukuilisya mpingo ula ali ni ŵandu mia nne, ŵandu mia mbili ŵasigalile papopo pakuŵa ŵaliji apesile kwannope, nganakombola komboka kasulo ko. <verse eid="1SA 30:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 30:11" />Ŵandu ŵaŵaliji ni che Daudi ŵala ŵansimene mundu jumo Mmisili mwikonde mo, ni ŵanjawisye ku che Daudi. Ŵampele mundu jo nkate ni mesi. <verse eid="1SA 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 30:12" />Sooni ŵampele chipande cha nkate wa tini ni isagwa iŵili ya sabibu syejumu. Paŵamalisisye kulya, ŵapatile machili, pakuŵa ŵaliji jwangalya atamuno kung'wa chindu chachilichose kwa moŵa gatatu, muusi ni chilo. <verse eid="1SA 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 30:13" />Che Daudi wammusisye, “Ambuje jwenu ali nduni? Ana nkukopochela kwapi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 30:13">Ŵelewo ŵajanjile, “Uneji ndili jwanchanda Mmisili. Ndili kapolo jwa mundu jumo Mwamaleki. Ambuje jwangu anesile panyuma moŵa gatatu gagapite pakuŵa naliji ngulwala. <verse eid="1SA 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 30:14" />Uwe twajawile kukuputa ngondo ku Negebu, yaani kulujenda kwa chilambo cha ku Yuda, pa malo paakutama Ŵakeleti, ni malo jaakutama ŵandu ŵa ntundu wa Kalebu. Ni uweji twachomile mooto musi wa ku Sikilagi.”<verse eid="1SA 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 30:15" />Che Daudi ŵammusisye, “Uli nkukombola kumbechesya ku wele mpingo wa ŵandu ŵaŵajigele ŵandu ŵetu wo?” Jwanchanda jo ŵajanjile, “Iŵaga timuulumbilile kwa liina lya Akunnungu kuti ngamumulaga, namose kuumusya kwa ambuje jwangu, tinjinjausya.” <verse eid="1SA 30:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 30:16" />Jwanchanda jula ŵannongwesye che Daudi mpaka kwauli mpingo ula. Paŵaiche kweleko ŵaasimene Ŵaamaleki ŵala ali apwilingene palipose ali nkulya ni kung'wa ni kuntyala ligongo indu iŵasumwile kutyochela mu chilambo cha Ŵafilisiti ni chilambo cha Yuda yaliji yejinji nnope. <verse eid="1SA 30:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 30:17" />Che Daudi ŵaaputile kutandilila kundaŵi mpaka lyuŵa lyaaŵili lyakwe ligulo. Nganapagwa jwannume jwalijose juŵakulupwiche ikaŵe achachanda mia nne ŵaŵakwesile ngamia ni kuutuka. <verse eid="1SA 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 30:18" />Che Daudi ŵawombwele kila chindu chiŵajigele Ŵaamaleki, pamo ni achiŵankwakwe ŵaŵili ŵala. <verse eid="1SA 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 30:19" />Che Daudi ŵachiwombwele kila chindu chichaliji chakwe, ngapagwa changapatikana, aŵeje jwanchanda pane jwanchekulu, mwanache jwachilume pane jwachikongwe, ni kila chindu chichajigalikwe ni ŵandu wo. <verse eid="1SA 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 30:20" />Sooni che Daudi ŵausisye mipingo jose ja ngondolo ni ng'ombe ni ŵandu ŵaliji nkusakula ilango yo paujo pa ilango ya che Daudi, ŵaliji nkuti, “Ayiyi ni indu yasumwile che Daudi.”<verse eid="1SA 30:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 30:21" />Che Daudi ŵaiche kwa aŵala ŵandu mia mbili ŵaŵasigalile ku kasulo ka Besoli kwaligongo lyakuti ŵaliji apesile. Ŵandu ŵala paŵammweni che Daudi pamo ni aŵala ŵaŵaliji pamo nawo, ŵajawile kukwachingamila. Che Daudi paŵaiche pakuŵandikana nawo, ŵaakomasisye. <verse eid="1SA 30:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 30:22" />Nambo ŵandu wose ŵangalumbana ni ŵauwanga pasikati ja ŵandu ŵaŵalongene ni che Daudi ŵatite, “Pakuŵa ŵanyaŵa nganajaula pamo ni uwe, ngatwagaŵila indu itujigele. Nambo kila mundu akukombola kwajigala ŵankwakwe ni achiŵanagwe ni kutyoka.”<verse eid="1SA 30:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 30:23" />Che Daudi ŵaajanjile, “Ngaŵa yeleyo achalongo achinjangu. Ngankusachilwa kutenda yeleyo kwa achila chatupele Ambuje Akunnungu. Atutesile tuupunde aula mpingo wa ngondo uwaiche kutugungumuchila. <verse eid="1SA 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 30:24" />Nduni jutagajitichisye ginkuŵecheta go! Ajula jwajawile ku ngondo ni ajula jwasigalile ni ndundu yetu, ŵanawose tachipegwa yalumo.” <verse eid="1SA 30:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 30:25" />Kutandilila lyuŵa lyo che Daudi ŵalamwile kuti litala lyakugaŵanya indu chanti nyi liŵe lilamusi, ni yeleyi ikutendekwa mu Isilaeli mpaka lelo jino.<verse eid="1SA 30:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 30:26" />Che Daudi paŵausile ku Sikilagi, ŵaajauchisye achachekulu ŵa chilambo cha ku Yuda ŵaŵaliji achambusangagwe, liunjili mwa indu yasumwile achitiji, “Jeleji jili mituka kukwenu kutyochela mu indu itusumwile kwa ŵammagongo ŵa Ambuje Akunnungu.” <verse eid="1SA 30:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 30:27" />Mituuka jo jaliji kwaligongo lya ŵaakutama musi wa ku Beseli, ni ŵaakutama musi wa ku Lamoti jajili ku Negebu yaani kulujenda kwa chilambo cha ku Yuda, ni ŵaakutama musi wa ku Yatili, <verse eid="1SA 30:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 30:28" />ni ŵaakutama musi wa ku Aloeli, ni ŵaakutama musi wa ku Sifimoti, ni ŵaakutama musi wa ku Eshitemoa, <verse eid="1SA 30:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 30:29" />ni ŵakutama musi wa ku Lakali ni ŵakutama misi ja ku Ŵayelameeli, ni ŵakutama misi ja Ŵakeni, <verse eid="1SA 30:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 30:30" />ni ŵakutama musi wa ku Holoma ni ŵakutama musi wa ku Bolashani, ni ŵakutama musi wa ku Ataki, <verse eid="1SA 30:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 30:31" />ni ŵakutama musi wa ku Hebuloni. Che Daudi ŵaapelechele mituka nombe ŵandu ŵakutama ku misi jose jiŵajimajimile nsyene jo ni ŵandu ŵakwe nombe.<verse eid="1SA 30:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="1SA 31" />
  <para style="s">Chiwa chi che Sauli ni ŵanache ŵakwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 10:1-12">1 Indu ya katema 10:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 31:1" />Nipele, Ŵafilisiti ŵaputene ngondo ni Ŵaisilaeli, ni Ŵaisilaeli ŵaautwiche Ŵafilisiti, ni achajinji ŵaulajikwe ku chitumbi cha Giliboa. <verse eid="1SA 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 31:2" />Nambo Ŵafilisiti ŵaagungumuchile che Sauli ni achiŵanagwe, nipele ŵaauleje che Yonasani ni che Abinadabu ni che Maliki Shua, ŵanache ŵakwe che Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 31:3" />Ngondo jaliji jekulungwa kwannope kwa che Sauli. Ŵandu ŵakuputa mipamba paŵammweni, ŵammulesye ŵamba. <verse eid="1SA 31:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 31:4" />Nipele che Sauli ŵansalile mundu juŵanjigalilaga yakumenyanilana yakwe, “Nswekule lipanga lyenu muusome, mumulaje, kuti aŵa ŵandu ŵangaumbala ŵa pitaiche tachitanda kuuseka une ni kuumulaga.” Nambo mundu juŵanjigalilaga yakumenyanilana jula nganalinga ligongo ŵajogopaga kwannope. Kwayele, che Sauli ŵajigele lipanga lyakwe nsyene ni kuligwilila. <verse eid="1SA 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 31:5" />Pelepo mundu juŵanjigalilaga yakumenyanila paŵaiwe kuti che Sauli aŵile, nombejo ŵaligwilile lipanga lyakwe, ŵawile pamo ni che Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 31:6" />Yeleyo ni iyatite kuwa che Sauli, ni ŵanache ŵakwe ŵatatu, nombe ni mundu juŵanjigalilaga yakumenyanila yakwe pamo ni ŵandu ŵakwe wose pa lyuŵa limpepe lilyolyo. <verse eid="1SA 31:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 31:7" />Ŵaisilaeli ŵaŵaliji pesi pa lichemba lya Yesileeli, ni ŵane ŵaŵaliji kungopochelo lyuŵa kwa lusulo lwa Yolodani paŵaiweni kuti Wangondo ŵa Ŵaisilaeli autwiche, nombe che Sauli ni ŵanache awilenje, ŵasamile ni ŵajilesile misi jao. Nombe Ŵafilisiti ŵajawile kutama mu misi jo.<verse eid="1SA 31:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 31:8" />Malaŵi jakwe, Ŵafilisiti paŵajawile kukujigala indu ya ŵandu ŵaŵauleje ŵala ŵasimene che Sauli ni ŵanache ŵakwe ŵatatu ali awile pa litumbi lya Giliboa. <verse eid="1SA 31:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 31:9" />Ŵaukatile ntwe wa che Sauli ni kummula yakuwala yakwe, nipele ŵaatumile ŵantenga ku chilambo chose cha Ŵafilisiti kulalika ngani jambone mu nyuumba ja inyago yao ni kwa ŵandu ŵao. <verse eid="1SA 31:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 31:10" />Yakumenyanilana yakwe ila ŵaiŵisile mu nyuumba ja kwapopelela nnungu jwao Ashitaloti, ni ŵachikoleche chiilu chakwe palipupa lya musi wa ku Beti Sheani.<verse eid="1SA 31:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 31:11" />Nambo ŵandu ŵakutama musi wa ku Yabesh Gileadi paŵapilikene iŵatite kwapanganyichisya che Sauli ni Ŵafilisiti, <verse eid="1SA 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 31:12" />ŵangondo ŵakulimba ntima wose ŵatyosile, ŵajesile chilo chosepe mpaka ku Beti Sheani, ŵaitulwisye pepupa po ilu ya che Sauli ni ŵanache ŵakwe. Ŵaichenago mpaka ku Yabeshi ni kujijocha kweleko. <verse eid="1SA 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 31:13" />Kanyuma, ŵajigele maupa gao ni kugasika pasi pa chitela cha ukwesu kwele ku Yabeshi ko; nipele ŵataŵile kwa moŵa saba.<verse eid="1SA 31:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 31" />
</usx>